<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">KIS-ALKITAB Bahasa Ansus</book>
  <para style="h">Pi Rasuri</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kis.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pi Rasuri Enari</para>
  <para style="toc1">Piwe Rasuripa Enari</para>
  <para style="mt1">Piwe Rasuripa Enari</para>
  <para style="is">Kawio anduna we Pi Rasuripa Enari</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku Pi Rasuripa Enari mamo, buku wepui na Lukasi. Buku retenang we Lukasi soi peino Kawio Weweng na Lukasi. Pi we retenang na buku Pi Rasuripa Enari nini pai mamo, parari Yesusi ne rasuri ura ea kodu paya, na Allai ne Duainunung Mamarang pai ne mambiri pa, piata ya embuwu Arera Weweng parari Yesusi, na bendari Yerusalemi, na raora Yudea pai setenang, na raora Samaria, kong ki nunei werea napa (1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku ninipai tato kewio parari na awe rasuri paya eserai embuwu Yesusi pi denyauwa pa, weretenang na nyontarai Yaudi paya interi terera ki nyontarai Yaudi wa paya, donapa na ya empau entadu uira pitau kong eaya tato engkada. Na pitoai etona yana pa donane akama Keresteng pai doa kong terera wu nunei setenang. Lukasi tato yerai we kewio kangkuna we weentatora paya, we akama Keresteng pai mamo rang waworu na akama Yaudi pai dina. Akama nini kio unapea wa we biateta parenta Roma pai wa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pi we puba tato na buku nini pai mamo we rabuangpa toru. Na rabuang toru nina pa kewio parari topitotoi Duainunung Mamarang pai dong paya pa we nyontarai we embuwu Arera We Wieng parari Yesusipa kong parari Akama Keristeng pai doa pa, aino: (1). Retenang Akama Keristeng pai doa na Yerusalemi na awe piana Yesusi wieita to rora-marising pa; (2). Akama Keristeng pai terera na raora Paresitina pai; kong (3). Akama Keristeng pai terera era ea wu raora eaya na raora Rawanang Rabuangpaia woroi ea sisu raora Roma pai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kawio na bukunei mamo kiutua tonina:</para>
  <para style="io1">Entamamang we embuwu Kawio Weweng pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Etamamang we embuwu Arera Weweng pa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Entiri nyontarai pei we riwang Yudasi. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Embuwu Arera Weweng pa na Yerusalemi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Embuwu Arera Weweng pa na raora Yudea kong Samaria. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi ne mariwa pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Paulusi retenang depai pa we wiwu Arera we Wieng pai pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1—14:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Rasuri paya embe sidang na Yerusalemi. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Paulusi we kodu depai we wiwu Arera Weweng pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36—18:22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Paulusi we toru depai wiwu Arera Weweng pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:16">18:23—21:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Entapu Paulusi entoni to wangka pai na Yerusalemi, engkori to Kaisarea kong weita to Roma. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sen derekamana we dong Duainunung Mamarang pai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Teopilusi au we moi, na neu weraung retenangpai entoi parari pitau we Yesusi nyari kong denyauwa pa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk. 1:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />na Yesusi riuwa ne mariwa pa, ma sisu a we weita to rora-marising pa. Wieita to rora-marising wami mamo, Yesusi dong arerapa we ne rasuri paya na Duainunung Mamarang pai ne mambiri pa. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Piana Yesusi keda pa kong wieng taweriea, na ape piakodu mamo denyawi ne taraipai we rasuri paya pampang we kamang topino I wo keda mana taraie tewa, mamo kewio koya parariapi Allai ne riu we Mananu pa. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Na apeana Yesusi penduikui ya, mae demi ya doyo, “Mendawarui Yerusalemi wa mae metamang na yana kio Yai dona we mia piwe derekamanapa. Kamang yanapa etopana we mia na pampong pato.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luk. 24:49</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Tutu na pampong pa Yoanisi webaptisi mia na maria mae ape bototoi ea mamo Allai ingkai webaptisi mia na Duainunung Mamarang pai.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mrk. 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Yoh. 1:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi wieita to rora-marising</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Na a we rasuri paya empandura kong Yesusi pa, etong autang wei etoyo, “Seni au, topitotoi pa na a nini pai Au boyo nuari parenta Israeli nei ea ne?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyontarai Israeli paya endoaoa we Kristusi memeari we Mananu we ya, parari na pampompa Mananu Dauti riu we mananu pa </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesusi rioa wea doyo, “Piana pa menduinaria wa, wo Yai mantauni di kiutu pa, parari ne mambiri pa. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Mana miawo ingkai metadu mambiri pa, na awe Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao mia pa, mae mia wo ingkai membesaksi membuwu Yau na Yerusalemi kong Yudea kong Samaria ra sisu nu wope wanei tantenang.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat. 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mrk. 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luk. 24:47-48</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Yesusi kewio ra kaipa I wieita to rora-marising na endenapa mamo mandipipai widori.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mrk. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-51">Luk. 24:50-51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Awe Yesusi wieita pa ne rasuri paya etoa endetatuwari, mamo na tantuma mampang pe kodu usasung asung webua uroa rurang ya. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Interi mampang ne asaru ungkawio uroyo, “E! Nyontarai Galilea pa mia, pitoi dona metoa mendeto rora pei ampa e? Yesusi nini we wieita to rora-marising pai, ingkai teweri eama na mandipi parariapino mendetuwari wieita nina.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rasuri etamamang Sen Duainunung Mamarang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Interi rasuri paya entaweri na wi Saituni to Yerusalemi, nu yani mamo woroi kiro koiri warui Yerusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Na Yerusalemi endawu manu we piana enainai pai. Interi embeita to mandarong na yei pei. Rasuri paya esanomi peino Petrusi kong Yoanisi, Yakobusi kong Andareasi, Pilipusi kong Tomasi, Bartolomiusi kong Matiusi, Yakobusi, Alpiusi ne kumai dina, Simoni na pandura Seloti <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seroti mamo pandura pei na nyontarai Israeli paya anong pi na. </char></note> kong Yudasi, Yakobusi ne kumai dina.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat. 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mrk. 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luk. 6:14-16</ref></char></note><figure style="fig" file="LB00235C.TIF" size="col" ref="1:13">Manu we ne mandarong na yei pai</figure> <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Mae ya engkai esanerarong koiri we empandura entandau kuira. Ya entandau kong wawing we na pampong etua Yesusi pa mae Yesusi nyani Mariai, kong Yesusi neta paya.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we riwang Yudasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Na apei ea, ya empandura kuira, wake empiaring ea piarei, interi Petrusi tewa doa kewio doyo, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Neta neupa mia, piwe entoi kamana na Weraung Mamarang nei piana parariato, na pampongpa Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao Dauti impaina kewio kakera parari Yudasi. Yudasi nini di kio rai pai we entapu Yesusi. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Na pampongpa mamo Yudasi nini wo koiri na tane pandura nei. I wo piana Yesusi diri kyong tata we meriwa mae piata Yesusi.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Yudasi piana wiori kakopa pea na pe moyawapa na wio Yesusi pa. Na awe nyaina kakopa yani mamo keda tebari, anengpai teabu anewaipai mentantaing kiai tori. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Nyontarai tau we enaina Yerusalemi pa engkai esaneao piyana pa, impaina esau nu yani na kawio enempa we “Hakal-Dama”, aino Kakopa Weria.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mat. 27:3-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Wo na weraung mamarang Masmuri Dauti soi topinina:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">topitotoio nu nyainai pai empikari menanopi ki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">mae nyontarai pei nyai na wa,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">eaino entoi topinina tato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">topitotoio pata nempa pikara nyontarai pea etawaraki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:26">Mzm. 69:26</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109:8</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Impaina Petrusi kewio doyo, “Nyontarai pei tato dua tata konta ea i we saksi parari Sen Yesusi wieng taweri warui kaida pa. Nyontarai yani paiwo piana kyong tata na tatua Sen Yesusi, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />na awe Yoanisi webaptisi pai sisu awe Yesusi wieita to rora-marising,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mrk. 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:19">16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk. 3:21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:51">24:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Impaina nyontarai we empadukui ya mane esoretuwa nyontarai pe kodu, Yusupi nini endearoni na anong pe kodu Barsabasi, esawi konta we Yustusi kong Matiasi.” <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24-25" />Interi ya entandau etoyo, “Sen, Au rembau nyontarai nea esanerarong pa, Yudasi piana sawa na pata we rasuri pa kong piana kedato. Impaina bonyawa we ama, matei na nyontarai kodu ne asaru, we Seni biri we riwang Yudasi we mampata kong amapa.” <verse eid="ACT 1:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Impaina nyosanong kodu yana ya empiwa oa, wa yopi Matiasi, toyana enduwari we rasuri we duara kong rasuri uraya koiri paya.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Allai Duainunung riama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Na a Pentakosta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pentakosta pai mamo a we piakodu ea ura na a Paskah pai </char></note> pai wo rasuri kong, nyontarai we endoao Yesusi paya empandura na nu pe koiri.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Im. 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Ul. 16:9-11</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Na tantuma entarao piwe riotu na rora pai parari wanang we wia era, we riotu wadi domuo yana manu we empadui ya nai wadi. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Interi ya endeo piwe dea parariapi adia we tebaboa kong sa na ya koiri-koiri. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Impaina ya engkai Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao ya, impaina dong ya engkawio na kawio tau pea weiya, parari Duainunung Mamarang pai dona engkawiora pa.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Na a yani tato nyontarai emamarang na kawasa Yaudi tau enda na nunei tantenangma, enai na Yerusalemi, ya wo nyontarai we esanesa Allai di ya. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Na awe entarao piwe riotu wadi, mamo enda wu manu we rasuri kong nyontarai endoaoa paya enai nai wadi. Ya enukaeng we entarao rasuri kong we endoaoa paya engkawio na kawio enempa. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Interi esarokutuya kia engkawio etoyo, “Nyontarai engkawio nisaya wo endapi raora Galilea tato? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Mana tata tangkai tantarao ya engkawio na kawio tangkawio nai na raora tanenei pa, topitotoi pei toyana pae? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Tata wo nyontarai na Partia, Media, Elami, na Mesopotamia, Yudea kong Kapadokia, na Pontusi kong Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />na Prigia, Pampilia, na Mesiri kong raora na nu Libia pai we kikeu we Kirene; kong ea na tata we enda na Roma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />tata wo nyontarai Yaudi kong nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa mana esua akama Yaudi pai, nyontarai Kreta kong Arapi, tata tangkai tantarao ya engkawio na kawio tanenei kiai parari piwe aneaerai Allai dona pa!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Ya esarokutuya kia mae etutang waweri ya etoyo, “Pitoai tonina pae?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Mana na ya, eaya tato etoya we rasuri kong nyontarai endoaoa paya etoyo, “Nyontarai nea wo emaeru.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrusi wiuwu arera mamarang we nyontarai we empau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Interi Petrusi tewa doa kong rasuri ura ea koiri paya mae kewio na raupui beba we nyontarai we empau paya doyo, “E neta neu Yaudi pa mia kong nyontarai we menai na Yerusalemi pa mia, mentarakepana aiwarao piwe yo ekawiora we mia ne. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Nyontarai nisa ya emaeru parari we metaoapa wa, wo nina ne saraka denyawa a riora bo enjatang ayarima peinina. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Na awe rampa piana Allai kewio kakera na nabi Yoeli topinina;<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Allai doyo, ingkai tawa na a ria menaing na wane, Yau ingkai Ewuwu Duainunung Mamarang pai wu nyontarai nea engkai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mene kumai muang paya kong mene kumai wawing paya, ingkai engkakera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mene aimiomang paya ingkai etadu pi anyawa pa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mene paituampa ya ingkai etadu ami yona weya pa.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Wu neu woming muang paya kong wawing paya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ingkai Ewuwu Duainunung Mamarang nei na a ria menaing yani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Mae ingkai ya engkakera pitaubai we etopana weya pa.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Yau ingkai yong pitantuma pau na yei na rora peidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">kong pianeaerai pa na ung na nunei:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">ingkai dedu ria pei kong adia, wiou kong sona.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Wo wanei ingkai berorang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Yembai wanei merai parari ria.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">Pi yanapa tawa wo, imbaromi Seni ne a baba mamarang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A Baba mamarang pai mamo, awe Allai kiutu Kawio parari nyontarai we engkada kong embeng</char></note> wadi ingkai rama pa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Na a yani matei di yau we Seni anompa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">ingkai dedu pariripa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Yl. 2:28-32</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />E nyontarai Israeli pa mia, mentarama kawio we etopana nina: Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti pai piana Allai demi we mia ma. Piya na pa denyawa na paya kong pitantuma pa kong kamang we Allai nyari na Yesusi na mene madu kuira pa. Piyana pa mendeoa eampa. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Parari we Allai mantauni dapa pa. I kiutu we dong Yesusi we mia, interi memuni kong mempikari we nyontarai emamuna paya etoni yeroi na aitaba pai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat. 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mrk. 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luk. 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Yoh. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Mana Allai doni tewa taweri na kiori warui kaidapa, wo I andi kaidapai riuwai pampamba.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5-6">Mat. 28:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mrk. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luk. 24:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dauti piana kewio kakera parari Kristusi kawio ingkai sopanapa doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Yau erewo Seni pempong yau pampang;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">I wo yirii yau, impana edidora na pianea wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Mzm. 16:8-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Topiana pa aneurarong nei merarising</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">woreunei yeparandin Au,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">neu tarai kakopa we ingkai keda nei i wo nyai na we medori piboki na kaida wau.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Wo Auwo pika duainunungnei nyaina maring karuari wanei rarong pe wa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Au wo pika nemu woming we emamarang neya enai na kaida pai wa.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Au ingkai tuba anyaupa we yau, rang we depai to wieng ki woroi-woroi wane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Au ingkai bong neu mararising ne ra baba tutu Au borua yau.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Maneta pa mia ekawio na anyuing wa parari Dauti i tantamami woriai pai, I wo keda esirai to ne aisata pai nai kong tataki a nina. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Allai dong apa pei wei kong pepora parari we I ingkai riuwa nyontarai pei na Dauti ne tapung woriai pai we mananu. Dauti mantauni rearona piyana pa tutu mantauni tato nabi dina.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Mzm. 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2Sam. 7:12-13</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />I wo aneao pitoai Allai ingkai donapa, impaina i kewio kakera we Mananu Mampariri we Allai derekamani pai, I ingkai wieng taweri na kaidapa. Dauti kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">I wo Allai pikari nyaina maring karuari wa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">netarai pai menaing na kambireipai rarong wa.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yesusi nini Allai doni tewa taweri na ne kaida pa, amangkai piana mantau amandeo piwe tawa yana. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />I piana wieita to rora-marising, Yai Allai doni meoi na ne wara-dowatang pai. Interi dedu Duainunung Mamarang we piana Allai derekamani pai. Impaina I wuwu Duainunung Mamarang yani pai wiama yumao ama, Duainunung yani di mendeoi kong mentaraoi nina. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Dauti wo wieita to rora-marising wa, mana Dauti kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Allai kewio we neu Seni doyo,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Moyoi na neu dowatang nei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:35">kio Yau yong we embemarowa we Aupa entuang esopeo aemupa!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mzm. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Impaina nyontarai Israeli pa mia mengkai mesaneoa kangkuna, wo Yesusi we metoni yeroi na aitaba pai, Allai piana riuwari we Sen kong Kristusi to.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Na awe nyontarai tau we entarao pi yana impaina etatuwa ya kia interi ya etutang Petrusi kong rasuri ea wauya etoyo, “Maneta pa mia, pitoai topitotoi ingkai amatona pae?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Interi Petrusi kewio weya doyo, “Mia mengkai mesane taweri warui mene sasaripa mae embebaptisi mia na Yesus Kristusi anongpa, imbaro sasari menempa Allai dupipira, toyana maneta pa mia ingkai metadu Allai Duainunung Mamarang pai. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Wo Allai ne arera nina we mia tutu mentapumi paya, kong nyontarai we enai na raora we woroi pa, aino nyontarai tau we Sen Allai yau ya pa.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Topiana Petrusi kewio we nyontarai tau paya, kong derekamana kangkuna imbaro ya empika enetarai warui kawasa we emamuna nisa, yatino kawasa we ingkai Allai dong mambabati weya pa. <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Impaina nyontarai tau we endoao kawio we Petrusi sopana pa, ya embebaptisi. Toyana nyontarai we endoaoa pa empau ea na ayani embe piaura we ring we toru (3,000) konta ea. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Na yana empandui ya pampang, kong etadu anyau na rasuri paya, mae etampi kuira kong entandau kuira.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyontarai we esanesa Allai esanewaweria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Nyontarai tau esarokutuya kong ematai tutu pitantuma tau we rasuri etona pa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Interi nyontarai tau we endoao Allai pa empanduiya pampang kong piwe enempa emariwa kuira na,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Kis. 4:32-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />kong na ya mamo ei dewayang pitau nempa toratoraia interi embiwo pe yana maiya parari pitoai koiri-koiri esanewea pa. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Na esanerarong koiri anemai mamo empandui ya na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai na Yerusalemi we entandau, kong na manu enempa koiri to koiri etampi kuira na emararising kong esaneaiwa ya. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Ya etaparanding Allai pampang tutu nyontarai tau esaneweng ya, impaina anemai Seni dong nyontarai endoaoa pa empau ea tutu nyontarai tau Allai periri ya ea.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Petrusi dong we Piaya penang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Na apeana saraka a riora botoru rawandeng, awe Yaudi entandau pa, Petrusi kong Yoanisi unda wu Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai we untandau na yana. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Na Aturarei Baba esawi we Aturarei Weng pai, na yana nyontarai muang pei piaya na nyani dawini pa, anemai mamo nyontarai pea engkori na kewang pei we meoi na yana imbaromi dewa pe pea wei, na nyontarai we esua wu Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai na Yerusalemi pa. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Na yana nyontaraipai reo Petrusi kong Yoanisi undama we uro usua to Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai mamo i dewa asaru imbaro urong pianea wei. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petrusi kong Yoanisi undekakepani mae Petrusi kewio wei doyo, “Remumao andu!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Interi nyontarainei rekakepang asaru, i anesara we dedu pianea na asaru.<figure style="fig" file="cn01895B.tif" size="col" ref="3:5">Petrusi dong nyontarai piaya pei penang</figure> <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Mana Petrusi kewio wei doyo, “Yau neu pe pea wa wiria, mana pitoai neu pa ingkai yona we au: Na Yesus Kristusi nyontarai Nasareti pai Anong pa, rua.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Interi Petrusi riu na nyontarainei wara dowatang pai piataria doa, nayana to aempa kong aeng kamain pa paya. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Nyontarainei yero doa mae ria towana tonina, interi yua kong Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru to Allai ne Manu Mamarang rarong pai, ria yeraropi mae deparanding Allai. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Nyontarai tau endeoi we ria mae deparanding Allai. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Ya endearoani we nyontarai nini andi anemai meoi deiwiewa na Aturarei Weng pai na Allai ne Manu Mamarang wadi, impaina esarokutuya kia tutu endeo piwe tawa na nyontarai wadi pa.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi denyau nyontarai tau na Seni ne Manu waraseta repom pai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Nyontarai we piaya mana penang yani dua Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru pampang, ra sisu Sarabi wepiang Seni ne Manu wadi we esawi we Sarabi Salomoi, nyontarai tau we na yasa, ya esarokutuya impaina endama we esoriwari itoru. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Awe Petrusi reo nyontarai we empau paya, impaina kewio weya doyo, “E nyontarai Israeli pa mia, pitoi dona mesarokutuya we piwe tawa nina pae? Pitoi dona mamo mendekakepang ama pampang pae? Metorato nyontarai we piaya nini tewa ria ne tutu paya na andu e? Ete tutu andu usomi Seni na wemai pae? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Kel. 3:15</ref></char></note> Andu wa mana Allai. Allaio Abrami, Isaki, kong Yakupi itosomi wei pai, Allai we tane woriai paya esomi wei pai, Allai di piana riuwa ne Woming Yesusia tedai raweina. Yesusi nini piana metoni we mananu paya kong mentampiri, mia tato membateta Pilatusi na awe anewe pika Yesusi pa. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat. 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mrk. 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luk. 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Yoh. 19:12-15</ref></char></note> I memarang kong mei, mana miawo membatetari kong metairorai imbaro Pilatusi warapika nyontarai we piana miung nyontarai pa we mia. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Maneta pa mia, miati memuni pa, I wo andi dong aseng ne we nyontarai ne tata kuira pa, mana Allai doni wieng taweri warui kaida pai, mantau amandeoa na amandekamine. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Piwe piana mendeoa kong mendearoani nina na we piaya nini, wo i piana penang to, tutu I wo rioaoa na Yesusi anong pa kong ne paya pa. Impaina na Yesusi Anong yani pai donane i piana penang mae doa na mendenawau nina.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Manetapa mia, ereukamana we pitoai mia kong mananu paya mengkai menari we Yesusi pa, tutu mia wo mendearoang piwe metonapa wa. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Mana na rang yani, pitoai Allai sopana pampong na ne nabi paya pa, wo Kristusi iwo topitotoi pa ingkai didiwa, piana tawa parariato. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Topiana mamo manetapa mia, topitotoi pa mesanetaweri warui mene sasari pa kong topitotoi mentaweri wu Allai ma imbaromi I dupirandeni mene sasari pa, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />imbaro Seni dong mia mesanerarongpa paya, kong demi Yesusi ria wu miama, Yesusi nini na retenangpa Seni doni we Mananu Mampariri we mia eampa. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />I andi nyaina rora-marising pai kio awe Allai dong pitau yana waworu parari we Allai sopana na ne nabi emamarang paya na pampong pa. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Ul. 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18-19">18-19</ref></char></note> Musai kewio doyo, ‘Allai, mene Seni pai, ingkai demi nabipei na mandarong menempai we mia, parari Yai demi yau pa, pitoai sopana we mia pa, mendekakepana na wemai. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Wo ingkai tawa ki, we matei di reokakepana wa pitoai nabipai sopana pa mamo, nyontarai yani ingkai Allai keai tori warui Ne nyontarai paya.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Mae nabi pitau entopang kawio we rana Allai na pampong pa, retenang na nabi Semueli kong nabi peaya we endatuwari ema pa, ea kia entopang kakera parari awa pui nini. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Kej. 22:18</ref></char></note> Allai ne arera we nabi paya engkawio kakerai pa, arera yani we maneta pa mia, na arera we Allai nyari kong tantapumi woriai paya, I kewio we Abrami tonina doyo, ‘Na nemu tapumu woriai paya, Yau ingkai emyuang kawasa taubai na nunei tantenang.’ Arera nini pai we mia tato. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Impaina Allai diri Ne Woming pai, demi riama we mia pampong, imbaro miuang so mia memanaing warui piwe moyawa pa kong mesanetaweri we Seni.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Petrusi kong Yoanisi uroa na Majelisi Akama endena wau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Na awe Petrusi kong Yoanisi uroa ungkawio rai we nyontarai we empau paya pa, interi imami peaya kong wewedung we weetaiwai Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai kong nyontarai we embe Saduki peaya endawu Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru ma. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Ya engkayou kia tutu entarao Petrusi kong Yoanisi umbuwua we kawasa paya we Yesusi piana wieng taweri warui ne kaidapa, nina ne denyawa we nyontarai we engkadapa tarai ingkai embeng taweri ea. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Impaina ya entapu rasuri pa asaru etong asaru to wangka rarong pai, tutu piana diruto, impaina ya endukepang Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru ki kamai pai. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Mana nyontarai we entarao rasuri pa asaru une anyau pa, madupea yati endoaoa, impaina nyontarai endoao anyau parari Yesusi pa empau ea embe piaura we ring we ring (5,000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Kamai ea Majelisi Akama paya kong we embedung na Yaudi paya kong kuru akama Yaudi paya, empanduikui ya na Yerusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Empandu ya kong Imami Baba Hanasi kong Kayafasi, Yoanisi, Aleksanderi, kong tau we esua mandarong imami baba pai. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Interi engko Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru wu mananu paya interi etutang asaru etoyo, “Naina paya matei kong matei anong pa murong nyontarai we piaya nini riampa e?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Interi Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao Petrusi paina kewio doyo, “Tuani mia, we membedung we Yaudi pa, kong we membe Majelisi Akama pa mia! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Na a nini undoa na mendena ne, etutangkakewa we andu tutu urong pi we mai we umpata nyontarai we piaya wadi, mae mia meto meserai we na paya matei nyontarai yani pai penampa, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />toyana mamo tuang mananu pa mia mengkai kong nyontarai taubai Israeli pa mia, mentarama! Nyontarai piaya nini tewa doa na mendenape nina, i penang nina tutu Anong Yesusi Kristusi nyontarai Nasaretio metoni yeroi na aitaba pai, mana Allai doni wieng taweri eampa. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Mzm. 118:22</ref></char></note> Yesusi nini pai di na waya na Weraung Mamarang entopani etoyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">Diri we menari manu pai mengkaipiri pi, ria ea we diri wepyang to.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Impaina na Yesusi memeari tato, nyontarai ne tata tatadu pariri pa, wo na nunei tantenang, na nyontarai nea koiri tato anong ne dedu paya pea wa, mana na Allai we periri nyontarai pa.” <verse eid="ACT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Na awe Majelisi Akama paya endeo Petrusi kong Yoanisi ungkawio na umataiwa mae esaneao we asaru mamo uradu anyau we tadai pea wa, impaina ya esarokutuya kia, mae ya endearoang Petrusi kong Yoanesi asaru mamo urua Yesusi. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Mana Majelisi Akama paya entopang pianea we etintarura Petrusi kong Yoanesi asaru wa, tutu nyontarai we uroni penang yani pai doa rurang rasuri pa asaru na endena pa. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Impaina etami rasuri kodupa asaru unda tori warui mayoi sidang pai, interi engkawio mai we pitoi etona we asaru eampa. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Etoyo, piwe topitotoi ai ingkai tatona we nyontarai ne asaru pae? Nyontarai pa engkai we na Yerusalemi nini piana esaneoa na wemai wo pi aneaerai we tawa na yana we rasuri pa asaru urona pa, pi yana tatawo tampora wa. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Imbaro we ninane endeo entopana ra baba pe, mamo mendema tasua asaru na paya, imbaro undeo ungkawio we nyontaraipei tato ete we nyontarai peaya na Yesusi anompa pe. <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Impaina esau rasuri pa asaru usua taweria ea, interi ya esua rasuri pa asaru we uranyau ete ungkawio we matei ea tato na Yesusi anompa wa. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Mana Petrusi kong Yoanisi uroa uroyo, “Mantau mesanetatuata, pitoi we pitarai na Sen Allai renapa pa; urong parari kawio menempa ete urong parari Allai ne kawio pae? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Wo amangkawio manaimba parari we piana amandeoa kong amantaraoa meari pa.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Majelisi Akama paya etadu kawio pea wa we etong mambabati we Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru pa, impaina etamindui asaru interi empika asaru unda ea, tutu ematai nyontarai madupei paya etaparanding Allai tutu pi we tawa yana pa. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Nyontarai piaya we dedu panang na tantuma yani pai piana ne puda pe piakodu to.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we endoaoa pa ya etewa Seni we dong mambiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Impaina na awe Mananu Agama paya empika Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru pa untaweri wu uneta paya kong we empandui ya paya, mae ungkawio parariapi pitau we weembedung na imami pa kong mananu Yaudi paya entopana we asarupa. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kel. 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neh. 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Mzm. 146:6</ref></char></note> Na awe uneta empandu ya pai entaraoa piyana pa, ya kuira entandau na esanerarong koiri we Allai, ya engkawio etoyo, “Seni, Au nuari rora kong nunei kong rawanang kong pitau pai. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Mzm. 2:1-2</ref></char></note>Na Dumuainunung Mamarang pai piana kowio na nemu woming Dauti amane woriai pai, kowio boyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Pitoai kawasa we endearoang Seni wa engkayou pae?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Pitoai nyontarai tau na nunei asenetau we unawa pa nina e?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Mananu na nunei etamamang we etoamuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">kong we embedung empandui ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">emarowa we Seni kong Kristusi pai.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mrk. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk. 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">7-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-29">Yoh. 18:28-29</ref></char>
    </note>Wo taraie Herodesi kong Pontiusi Pilatusi urong mayoi pei kong nyontarai we endearoang Seni wa kong nyontarai Israeli ya na bendari nini. Mae ya esanetatuata we embemarowa we Yesusi, Nemu Woming Mamarang pai, we piana Au ruwari we Kristusi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Esanerarong koiri we etong pitau yana pa, Au piana anemutatua na pampong wo ingkai piyana tawa pararia, mae Au kutu yanapa na yei parariapi paya kong we aneaoa pa meari. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Na ninato Seni, reaoa topino ya emamuna we ama nina, mae bong mambiri we nemu woming ne ama, imbaromi amambuwu Nemu Arera ne na matai wa. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Bong waramu paya pai ma imbaromi nyontarai we esui pa empanang kong nuari piwe tantuma pa na nemu paya pa naina Yesusi anong pa, Au nemu woming Mamarang pai.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Mae ya entandau akai pa, nu we empandu yanai wadi medidou, kong Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao ya, impaina na yana to ya engkawio kangkuna parari Allai ne Arera pa.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piwe nyontarai we endoaoa pa etonapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44-45">Kis. 2:44-45</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nyontarai tau we endoaoa pa esanerarong koiri kong esanetatuata koiri tato, na ya koiri tato anetatuata we piwe nempa we memeari wa. Mana pitoai ei nempa weya kuira. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Na paya we baba pa, rasuri paya etanyau topino Yesusi wieng taweri warui kaida pa, Impaina Seni myuangso ya raweina. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Impaina nyontarai pe koiri na ya na meoi pa ne pianea wawiria, tutu ya etamamang we embo ene kakopa pa kong manu pa, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />mae pe yana engko wu rasuri paya, interi embiwo pe pa tate nyontarai we weesanewea paya. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36-37" />Topiana parari we na Yusupi, i wio kakopa we nempa yana, interi pe we dedutapa dona we rasuri paya, Yusupi nini mamo wia na marandang Lewi na nu Siprusi. Rasuri wauya esawi anong pei Barnabasi ete kumai dong mararising.<verse eid="ACT 4:36-37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ananiasi kong Sapirai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Nyontaraipei ea anongpei Ananiasi, i kong ne wawini Sapirai umbo une kakopa pa ea. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Usanerarong koiri we umbarakepang pe pa ea wata we asaru mae Ananiasi kio ea dona we rasuri paya. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Mana Petrusi kewio we Ananiasi doyo, “Ananiase, pitoi pika Nyombatang pai yumao anemurarong pai pa, impaina weangkari Duainunung Mamarang nei, mae warakepang pe we muraduta na murawayang kakopa pa wau ea wata we aupa e? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Na awe bowayang kakopa pa wami mamo kakopa pa au nemupa kong awe bowayang na pa mamo pe pa au nemupa tato, mae bona parari we anemutatuata pa, pitoi anemutatua we weangkari tonina pe, wo weangkari nyontarai wa mae piana weangkari Allai!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Na Ananiasi tarao kawiopa tebari tantuma mae ne asengpa takutu, impaina nyontarai we entarao piwe tawa tantuma pa ematai kia. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Interi aimiomang peaya esuama esasan Ananiasi netarai kakopa pai interi engkori toria we etaisatai.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Waketo saraka riora toru dapira mamo Ananiasi wawini Sapirai riama, mae i riuinari piwe tawa yana wa. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petrus kewio we Sapirai doyo, “Topana we yau, pe we muraduta na kakopa we murawayana pei nina kie?” Sapirai kewio doyo, “Pe we uraduta peinaki.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Interi Petrusi doyo, “Pitoi au kong awamui mungkawio mai we muntou mumbeangkari Duainunung Mamarang pai pa e? Remua! Aimiomang we etaisata awamui peati etoa na aturarei ri pe wana, wo ingkai engko nentarai pai tato toria.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Na yanato Sapirai aseng pa takutu na Petrusi renawau, na awe aimiomang paya esuamapa etadu Sapirai piana kedato, interi engkoria etaisatai rurang awani. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Impaina jemaati we endoaoa we Yesusi paya, kong nyontarai peaya tato we entarao piwe tawa tantuma pa mamo ematai kia.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kamang kong pi aneaerai kong pi tantuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Rasuri paya enari kamang pitau kong pitantuma na Allai pa na nyontarai tau pa ene madu pa, nyontarai tau we endoaoa paya esanerarong koiri kong anemai mamo empandu ya na Seni ne Manu Mamarang pai ne sarabi we esawi Waraseta Salomoi pai. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Kong nyontarai we na ri peaya, ya ene barui pea we endama empandura kong nyontarai we endoaoa paya, topiana nyontarai tau paya entuang we nyontarai we endoaoa paya. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Impaina anemai mamo nyontarai we endoao Seni paya ya empau ea, mamo muang kong wawing. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Tutu nyontarai we endoao Seni empau kia donane we esui paya etosa embata na andaung pa ete kewang pa, enduwa we esui paya na kewang wu rang wanea imbaromi Petrusi riana yanapa mamo duainunungpai dedu ya waro empanang. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Kawasa tau enda na raora kikeu na bendari Yerusalemi, ya engko nyontarai we esui kong we semi-semi yumao yapa, kong nyontarai yasa rasuri paya etosa empanang.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mananu Yaudi etong rasuri wau ya esua to wangka rarong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Interi Imami Baba pai kong ne weetuari paya, yatino nyontarai we pandura Saduki paya, ya esane kayou we rasuri wauya. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Impaina ya entapu rasuri wauya interi etoya esua to wangka baba pai rarong pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Mana na diru wadi Seni ne mampang pei riama yepa aturarei na wangka wadi mae kio ya emati tori, kewio weya doyo, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mendara metoa na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai mae mentopana we nyontarai paya, parari topitotoi pa embeng waworu pa.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Impaina rasuri wauya etong parari arera we mampang wadi sopana weya pa, interi ayarima kakepang pa, ya enda esua to Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai mae etanyau na yana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Na ayari yani tato, Imami Baba pai kong ne we etuari wauya endara ekonta we embedung we Yaudi wauya. Ya wo Majelisi Akama diya. Interi etami nyontarai peaya we engko rasuri wauya na wangka rarong paia. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Mana nyontarai we etami ya pa enda sisu wangka pai, mamo endeo rasuri paya na wana wa, impaina entaweria entopang piwe tawa yana pa we Majelisi Akama paya. <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />Ya engkawio we Majelisi Akama paya etoyo, “Amanda sisu wangka pai mamo amandeo aturarei pa emparemana na we piboki, kong maninuing paya etoa na aturarei pai repong, mana na awe amasepa aturareipai, amandeo rasuri paya na wangka rarongpai wa.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Impaina maninuing Allai ne Manu Mamarang paya kong we embedung we imami paya entarao kawio yanapa, esarokutuya kong ematai piwe tawa yana. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Interi nyontarai muang pei riama sopang arera pea doyo, “Yai pa mia Mentarama! Nyontarai we metosa enaina wangka rarong pai, nina wo etanyau nyontarai madu peaya na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai.”<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rasuri paya etoa na Majelisi Akama endenapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Impaina we etaiwai Seni ne Manu Mamarang pai kong we wedung weya pa, enda we engko rasuri pa asaru taweri, mana engko asaru na etawaya wa, tutu ya wo ematai nyontarai empau paya esoya na kami pe. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Interi engko rasuri wau asarua uroa na Majelisi Akama endenawau, mae Imami Baba pai dong autang we asaru. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />I kewio doyo, “Ama wo piana ama sua mia na kangkuna to we mendeo metanyau na nyontarai yani Anong pa eampe, mana mentarao piwe amantopanapa wa. Mae menda membuwu mene anyau nina na Yerusalemi tantenang. Yana meari wa mae mia wo mentubakepang ama tutu amati amatonane Nyontarai yani kedapa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat. 27:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Toyana Petrusi kong rasuri ea paya etoyo, “Topitotoi pa, amawo amatong parari piwe Allai daoapa ki, wo we nyontarai pei wa. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Allai o tane woriai pa esomi wei pai, piana dong Yesusi wieng taweri warui kaidapai. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />I piana Allai riuwaria tedai, we Mananu kong we Mampariri, imbaromi rai Israeli emanaing warui ene sasari pa mae Allai dupirandeni ene sasari pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Impaina amati amambuwu piana pa, ama kong Duainunung Mamarang Allai doni we nyontarai we etong parari Ne arerapa.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Majelisi Akama paya entarao kawio yana pa impaina engkayou kia mae ya wo esanetatuata we emung rasuri paya. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Mana nyontarai pei na Majelisi Akama pai, i wo nyontarai embe Farisi dina, anong pei Gamalieli, i tato nyontarai we denyau Kawio we Musai soi kong kawasa entuang wei kia. I tewa doa interi demi engko rasuri wauya toria. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Mae kewio we Majelisi Akama ea wauya doyo, “Neta neu nyontarai Israeli pa mia! Mesanetatuata aiwarao pitoai ingkai metona tawa we nyontarai nisa ya pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Wo na awe rampa nyontarai pei anong pei Teudasi, doyo i wo nyontarai baba dina, impaina wake nyontarai pe embe piaura we kodu (400) etuari konti, mana pimamuna Roma pea emuni kong tau we etuari paya entatera kong pandura yani menaing. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Na apeana ea, awe entoikamang nyontarai pa esanomi pa mamo, nyontarai pei anong pei Yudasi, iwo riana raora Galileai, i anemangkusi kia we dona nyontarai madupei etuari, mana i tato emuni kong nyontarai tau we etuari paya entatera tato. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Impaina piwe tawa ninane yona yisua mia, imbaromi mendeo metong pianea we nyontarai nisa pe, mempika ya ki, topino ene anyau ne na nyontarai, mamo anyau nina kong we entonapa ingkai manaing. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Mana parari kawio yana rana Allai mamo mia wo mene barui pea we mesua nyontarai nisa ya wa, topino donane membarui we Allai pe.” <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Interi ya etami nyontarai peaya engko rasuri wau ya esua taweri we etutang we ya kong esua ya etoyo, mendeo metanyau na nyontarai yani anompa naria eampe, topiana etairora nyontarai peaya endaruba rasuri wau ya interi empika ya. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Na yanato rasuri wauya enda tori warui Majelisi Akama wauya na emararising tutu Allai dorato ya emai we etadu didiwa, wo etua Yesusi. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Interi anemai ya etanyau pampang na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai kong nyontarai paya ene manu pa, mae ea embuwu Arera Weweng pai parari Yesusi Kristusi, topino I wo Mananu Mampariri we Allai derekamani pina.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Nyontarai pe embeitu etiri ya we empata we engkiaripi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Nyontarai we etua Yesusi pa empau ea, mae na a yani nyontarai Yaudi we engkawio na kawio Yunani pa, ya esaneung Yaudi tarai wauya yatino we etong parari kanang Iberani paya, tutu wiwai etona we etingpata nyontarai we engkiari pianea wa pa, ene wawing kabong paya etadu ea wa tato. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Topiana pa rasuri ura ea kodu wauya empandu nyontarai tau we endoao Allai paya interi engkawio weya etoyo, “Neta pa mia, roweang pa donane amandewaria impaina amambuwu Allai ne Arera nei wa pe, yana pa wo moya wa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Impaina neta pa mia metiri nyontarai pe embeitu na mia, we tandearoang ya wo emai kong Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao ya kong esanekurayang, imbaro amanduwa ya we endu mariwa nina we etimpata nyontarai we engkiari pi paya. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Imbaro amawo piana amantandau kong amambuwu Allai ne Arera ne meari ki.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Nyontarai paya kuira endoawe piwe rasuri paya entopana pa, interi ya etiri Stepanusi, nyontarai we rioao Yesusi kia mae Duainunung Mamarang pai yumaoi, kong etiri Pilipusi, Prokorusi, Nikanori, Timoni, Permenasi, kong Nikolausi na Antiokia; iwo nyontarai Yaudi dina wa mana i yua Akama Yaudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Nyontarai we embeitu paya enda entoa na rasuri pa endenawau, interi rasuripaya entandau enduwa embaramipa embarawawu ya kong etewara we myuang pa na Seni so ya. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Impaina Allai ne Arera ne embuwua tate nupa kong we etua Yesusi na Yerusalemi paya empau ea, kong imami taubai paya endoaoa we Yesusi.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Entapu Stepanusi kong entubakepani na Majelisi Akama endena wau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Mae Stepanusi dedu Allai ne weweng dona pinoma pa kong dedu Ne paya pa, impaina nyari pitantuma na Allai kong piwe aneaera pa na kawasa tau endenawau. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Mana nyontarai peaya na jemaati Yaudi pei entawa embatetari. Nyontarai yani paya esau ya we jemaati Libertini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jemaati Libertini mamo, nyontarai na pampong embo ya we woming, mana na pui nina ya embai ya to impaina embe woming ea wa.</char></note> yatino Jemaati Yaudi o embe woming ea wa. Ya wo nyontarai Yaudi na Kirene kong Areksanderia. Ya engkong nyontarai Yaudi we na Kilikia kong Asia paya, embateta kong Stepanusi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Mae ya wo enebarui pea we etimbateta piwe Stepanusi sopanapa wa, tutu Duainunung Mamarang pai yumaoi paina anekurayang na kawio dingkawiora pa. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Impaina ya embai nyontarai peaya we engkawio aya ya etoyo, “Amawo amantarao nyontarai nini pai kengkani Musai kong Allai!” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Topiana ya engkawio aya nyontarai peaya kong mananu Yaudi peaya, tutu kuru akama Yaudi paya, interi ya enda we entapu Stepanusi, interi engkori wu Majelisi Akama paya. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Interi ya engko nyontarai we embai ya paya ma etong kawio we mai wa we etimbu Stepanusi, nyontarai yani engkawio etoyo, “Nyontarai nini pai wo tetipa Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai kong tetipa Kawio we Musai soi pa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Wo amati piana amantarao i kewio doyo, Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti pai ingkai pyambari Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai kong riwang kanang we wiana Musai we tata pa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Nyontarai tau we endama na mayoi Majelisi Akama paya endekakepang Stepanusi, mae na a yani endeo Stepanusi rekami pa dea waweria parari mampang pei rekami peina.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Stepanusi kewio na Majelisi Akama ende na wau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Imami Baba pai dutang Stepanusi doyo, “Pitau we nyontarai pa entopana pa wepitarai e?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Interi Stepanusi kewio doyo, “Neta neupa mia kong iyai pa mia, mentarama! Topino tantapumi woriai Abrami dedaung to Harani wami, na awe nyaina Mesopotamia pa, Allai we tedai raweina piana denyawi wei to.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:27">Kej. 11:27</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 17:14">17:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Mae Allai kewio wei doyo, ‘Pika mandarong nemu pai kong kakopa nemu pa kong ruato raora we ingkai Yenyawa we au pa.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Kej. 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Impaina Abrami pika raora nyontarai Kasdimi, interi dedaung to Harania. I nyaina yana ki tamani keda, interi Allai demi Abrami dedaung warui nu Harani ma nyaina nina, na kakopa ninawo mia yai kong neta pa mia menai na nina. <figure style="fig" file="HK00037C.TIF" size="col" loc="7.4" ref="7:4">Abrami dedaung warui nu Harani</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Na a yani pai Allai dong pianea wa na raora yani we Abrami kio wei we ne wa, mae kakopa katea ki we ne wa, mana Allai derekamana we ingkai dong kakopa yana pa wei kong we ne tapung woriai wanea, a yani pai wo dedu kumai pei wami.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Kej. 12:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Mana Allai sopana wei tonina doyo, ‘Nemu tapumu woriai wanea ingkai enai we nyontarai embeiya na kakopa ea enempa. Nyontarai we na raora yani ingkai etong pampinong ya na kangkuna kong embe woming we ya pudape piaura we kodu.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Kej. 15:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Allai kewio pampang we Abrami doyo, ‘Toyana ki, mana kawasa we etong nemu tapumu woriai neaya embe woming pa, Yau yong mambabati oya, impaina ya ingkai enda warui nu yani kong esomi we Yau na nina.’ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kejadian 15:13-14 </char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Interi Allai dona we Abrami kamana sunati wadi; toyana na awe Isaki nyani meoituturi pa ne ape injatoru mamo Abrami kioria wesunati, mae Isaki tato we sunati ne kumai Yakupi, kong Yakupi tato we sunati ne kumai ura ea kodu we embe entapumi woriai we rai Yaudi wauya pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">Kej. 21:2-4</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 25:26">25:26</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 29:31">29:31</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 30:40">30:40</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 35:16-18">35:16-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Tutu tantapumi woriai paya esane kayou Yusupi, impaina ya embowi we woming to Mesiri mana Allai deruari,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:1">Kej. 37:1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 50:14">50:14</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />kong warapikari warui uira taubai we deduta pa, Allai dong ne weweng dona pinoma pa wei kong anekurayang pa we Yusupi na awe doa na Firauni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Firauni mamo, nyontarai anong peina wa, mana anong we Mananu Mesiri pina</char></note> mananu Mesiri pai renapa. Impaina Firauni riuwari we gubernuri na raora Mesiri kong i wedung we pitau Firauni nempa. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Interi piwawi baba pei riama miung raora Mesiri kong Kanani impaina nyontarai wauya esuira kia. Aidonane tantapumi woriai paya etadu roweang peawa. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Mana Yakupi taraoa we na Mesiri wo pasibu pe madupea, i demi ne kumai paya yatino tane woriai paya enda to Mesiria, enda we retenang pina. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Na awe enda we kodu pai mamo, Yusupi weroana we neta wauya topino i wo Yusupi dina. Na ayani to mananu Mesiri wadi rearoana weya wo Yusupi ne mandarong pina. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Topiana Yusupi dong arera we tamani Yakupi, dewara imbaro ne mandarong pai kiai etadaung to Mesiri, empau kuira piatoru ea uraya ring (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Impaina Yakupi dedaung to nu Mesiria, na yana pato, i kong tantapumi woriai paya enai na raora yani ki engkada. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Tantapumi woriai paya eneina pa engko to aisata na Sikemi kong esiraiya na aisata we Abrami wiori warui Hemori ne kumai paya na bendari Sikemi, na pe pau pea pa. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Mana na awe Allai ne apaa we Abrami pa ra kikeu pa mamo, nyontarai Israeli pa empau ea na Mesiri.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kel. 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:10">3:10</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Interi rakio mananu Firauni pei eiya tewa ea we deirora raora Mesiri pai, nyontarai yani wo rearoang Yusupi wa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Mananu yani weangkari ya kong dongkangkani tantapumi woria paya, parari deirora ya engkayai kumai mararia paya toria embata na yana pa ki engkada. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Na ayani paidi Musai nyani dawini pa kong i tato weng na Allai renawau. Na yembai pe botoru woroi ampa iwo etongsaiwari na tamani ne manupai. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Interi ungkoria umpikari na mariapai, na yana to Firauni antuwawing pai deduti kioria dosaiwari parari mantauni ne kumai dina. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Toyana etanyau Musai na anyau taubai we na Mesiri pa, impaina i piaya kia, na kawio sopana pa kong piwe donapa. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Awe Musai ne pudape piakodu pa mamo na anerarongpai anewe do ria reo neta nyontarai Israeli paya. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Interi i reo nyontarai Mesiri pei miungtati nyontarai na mandarong Israeli pei, impaina i piata nyontarai wadi mae miung nyontarai Mesiri paia keda. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musai dorato rai nembadi esaneaoa we Allai dirii we andi periri ne rai wadi pa, mana ya esaneaoa wa. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Interi kamai wadi i reo nyontarai Israeli pe kodu undora waweri asaru, impaina i dosaera we imbaro usanetaweri we umbekoiri ea, i kewio we asaru doyo, Maruwo mambenetai di maru mana pitoi dona mundora maru pae? <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Mana nyontarai we riora neta wadi sampi Musai tori mae kewio wei doyo, ‘Matei riuwa au we mananu kong we kutu kawio we amapa ne? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ete au bo mung yau tatoe parari rawandempe mung nyontarai Mesiri pai pae?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Na awe Musai tarao kawio we nyontarai wadi sopana yana, impaina meti ria to Kakopa Midiania nyai na yana, nayana didau mae dedu kumai muang pe kodu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">Kel. 18:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Puda pe piakodu ea, mampang pei riawurima na mapangpai we kikeu we wi Sinai, na adia we dang meti na waikiri we weneina pai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musai arokutuya kia reo pi yani, impaina i ria kikeu we reo pitoina, interi tarao Seni kewio wei doyo, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Yau wo Allai o mentapumi woriai, Abrami, Isaki, kong Yakupi itosomi wei pai andi Yau,’ Musai metai mae didora tutu iwo ne barui pea we reto waikiri we dang wadi wa. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Interi Allai kewio wei doyo, ‘Pika sandaripa warui aemupa, wo nu we boanai pai mamo kakopa mamarang pina. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Yau wo piana erewoa pitarai neu kawasa na Mesiri ene uira pa to, yau wo piana etarawo etaiwau pa, aidonane Yau ewia we epika ya, impaina taramuma! Yau yemia au toweri to nu Mesiri wanea.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Musai nini piana ya empiri to na kawio we entopana etoyo, ‘Mateidi dong puaya au we ruwai kong pika ama pae?’ I to, Musai we Allai demi we mananu kong wemampariri pa, na paya we mampangpai denyawi netaraipai wei na waikiri weneina pai pa. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Andi kio ya entori warui nu Mesiri pai na nyari pitantuma pa kong piwe aneaerai pa, na Mesiri, na rawanang Merai pai kong na mapangpai we puda pe piakodu pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Kel. 7:3</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Bil. 14:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musai nini paidi kewio we nyontarai Israeli paya doyo. ‘Allai ingkai dirii nabi pei na mentapumi woriai wanea parari I diri yau nina pa.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Ul. 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Musai nini pai nyaina rai Israeli paya ene madu kiuira pa na mapang pai, andi mampang pai riama kewio konti na wi Sinai pai we tantapumi woriai paya, I tato kio Allai ne Arera pa we sopana we tata pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Kel. 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Ul. 5:1-33</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Mana tantapumi woriai paya emaidai entuang wei pe, ea kong entampiri mae esanewe entaweri to kakopa Mesiri pai ea. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Interi ya engkawio we Haruni etoyo, ‘Au nuari nyombatangnai pea we ama imbaro amato ya we seng we etara ama, wo amawo amanduinari pitoai tawa na Musai pa, i wo nyontarai we kio amatori warui kakopa Mesiri tonina ma pa!’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40-41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-6">Kel. 32:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Interi ya enari nyombatangnai pei parari sapi antung pei imbaro etong pikika pa we etisomi wei, kong etong munara we etaparanding nyombatangnai we mantau enari wadi. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Impaina Allai dedaiweria karutarea kong pika ya esomi piori we na rora pai we endoaoa we seng, piana parari pitoai entoi na weraung mamarang na nabi paya topinina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘E kawasa Israeli pa mia! Na pudape piakodu menai na mapang pai, mengkutu piaung pa metona we pikika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">metorato pikika yana pa metona we Yau e?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Am. 5:25-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Wereria wiria, mana yawa nyombatangnai Moloki pai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">mia kuira mengkori kong nyombatangnai piori Refani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">nyombatangnai yani pai wo mantau menari we mesomi wei, wo Yau ingkai Ekai mia woroi rasisu nu Baberi.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Stepanusi kewio pampang doyo, Yawa denyawa we Allai nyainai pai, wiata kong tane woriaipa ya na mapang wadi, Yawa Mamarang yani pai Allai demi Musai nyari parari kambari we Allai denyawi wei pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Kel. 25:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Interi Yawa yani pai tane woriai paya, engkori pampang na ene rangpa ra sisu awe Yosuai kio ya etawa kakopa nini warui kawasa eaya ene paya pa, yatino Allai dedawa ya warui tane woriai pa endenawau, yawa nini pai wiata ra sisu awe Dauti riu we mananupa. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Allai dong ne weweng dona pinoma pa we Dauti, impaina Dauti dewara we I rioa wei we nyari manu pei we Allaio Yakupi yomi wei pai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2">2Sam. 7:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Mana Salomoi di nyari manu pai we Allai pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1Raj. 6:1-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Toyana ki, mana Allai we Tedai raweinapai nyaina manu we nyontarai enari pai wa; wo na weraung we nabi pa entoi pai riotu topinina,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Rorapai wo pata mananu we Yau emayoi nai pina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kong nunei wo nu aeune doanai pina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Impaina mia menari manu pei we Yau wa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">ete manari nu pea we emayoi na wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:49-50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Yes. 66:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Interi Allai kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:50">Wo mantau Yau enari pitaubai ninane pa.’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Mia mendukami maitui mae menukepana we Allai wa kong mentarakambireipa mengkowu we Allai ne kawio pa. Mia wo membateta Allai Duainunung Mamarang pai pampang, memparariapi mentapumi woriai paya na pampong pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Yes. 63:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Na nabi na pampompa paya engkai mentapumi woriai paya piana etong pampinong ya na kangkuna, mae emung nyontarai na pampong Allai demi ya embuwua parari Allai ne Woming we mei ingkai riama pai, mae Andi na nina pa miati metoni emuni pa. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mia wo piana metadu Allai ne kawio pa we Musai deduta warui mampang paya pa, mana metong pararia wa.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stepanusi esoina kamia keda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Na awe Majelisi Akama paya entarao pitau we Stepanusi sopana yana pa, esanerarong pa ui mae engkayou wei kia. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Mana Stepanusi we Duainunung Mamarang pai yumaoi pai, reto rora pai, I reo Allai ne wedea pai kong reo Yesusi doa na Allai ne dowatang pai. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Interi Stepanusi kewio doyo, “E mendema, Yau erewo rora-marising teparera kong Kumai Nyontarai pai doa na Allai ne dowatang.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Impaina Majelisi Akama paya engkowu entarakambireipa mae ya etanana kia interi ya endawu Stepanusi. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Na yanapa ya empapari warui bendari wadi tori interi esoi na kami. Nyontarai we endekamana parari Stepanusi pa, entuba ne asung na ri pa wata kong aimiomang pei anong pei Saulusi. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Eso Stepanusi na kamipa toyana mae tendau doyo, Sen Yesusi e! Ko neu duainunungnei. <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Interi sanang aebu pa mae dewara na weraupui kangkuna mae doyo, “Sen remo sasari ninane bona tawa we ya pe!” Na kewioa kaipa mamo ne aseng pa takutu.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1a" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1a" />Mae Saulusi tato rioa we Stepanusi emunia keda pa.<verse eid="ACT 8:1a" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulusi dongkangkani nyontarai we endoaoa paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1b" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1b" />Na a yani paito nyontarai Yaudi paya etongkangkani kangkuna we kawasa endoaoa pa na Yerusalemi, impaina nyontarai we endoaoa paya embawu tatera to raora na Yudea kong Samaria, mana we rasuri pa yati entoriwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:1b" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Nyontarai esomi we Allai paya esai etaidu tutu Stepanusi kaida nempa kong engkoria esirai. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Mana Saulusi yemupa kangkuna we rioya nyontarai we endoaoa paya, I yua meti na manu pa mae piapa muang kong wawing paya tori interi demi nyontarai pa etosa esua wangka rarong pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Kis. 22:4-5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arera weweng rana Allai pa Pilipusi wiuwua na Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Nyontarai endoaoa we piana entatera paya, embuwu Arera Weweng pa, na nupa tantenang. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Mae Pilipusi ria to bendari pei na Samaria kong wiuwu Yesusi, Mananu Mampariri we Allai derekamani pai we nyontarai paya na yana. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Na awe kawasa paya entarao Pilipusi ne anyau pa kong endeo piwe aneaerai pa, taubai na yapa endekakepana na wemai kia. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Wo semi-semi paya etanana kangkuna mae emati tori warui nyontarai we semi-semi yumao ya pa, kong nyontarai we empaya pa kong we esaetaberi paya empau dong ya empanang. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Impaina nyontarai we na bendari yani pai emararising kia. <verse eid="ACT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Na bendari pai mamo nyontarai pei anong pei Simoni. Piana woroi ampa na paya na semi-semi pai i nyari pi we aneaerai kia, donane nyontarai Samaria paya esarokutuyao pi we nyari yana, i kewio weya doyo, “Yau wo nyontarai pampinoma di yau wa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Impaina nyontarai taubai na bendari yani pai, baba kong maia paya etuari mae etaparandini etoyo, “Nyontarai nini pai Allai ne paya dina, i we anong we ‘Paya Baba pa.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Piana woroi to paina na semi-semi ne paya pa, donane nyontarai paya endekakepani kong etuari. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Mana nina wo endoao Arera we Piboki Pilipusi wiuwua weya pa, parari Allai ne riu we Mananu pa kong parari Yesus Kristusi, Mananu Mampariri pai anong ne, interi ya etong enetarai pa we Piripusi webaptisi ya, muang kong wawing. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simoni mantauni rioaoa, impaina Pilipusi webaptisi i tato, interi i dua Pilipusi pampang, Simoni reo piwe aneaera kong piwe tawa tantuma na Allai we Pilipusi donapa, donane i arokutuya kia. <verse eid="ACT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Na awe rasuri paya na Yerusalemi entaraoa topino nyontarai Samaria paya piana endu Allai ne Arera pa, interi etami Petrusi kong Yoanisi unda ra. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Na awe Petrusi kong Yoanisi usaetiapa, asaru untandau we nyontarai Samaria paya imbaro ya etadu Duainunung Mamarang pai. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Tutu Duainunung Mamarang pai riama we yumao nyontarai pei na ya wami, wo ya embebaptisi na Sen Yesusi anongpa meari peina. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Interi Petrusi kong Yoanisi urong umbaramipa wata na nyontarai Samaria paya, impaina etadu Duainunung Mamarang pai. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Na awe Simoni reoa topino rasuri pa asaru urong umbarami pa wata na nyontarai paya mamo, ya etadu Duainunung Mamarang pai, impaina kio pe pea we dona wu Petrusi kong Yoanisi asarua. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Interi i kewio doyo, “Murong paya yanapa we yau tato, imbaro yau tato yong warau ne wata na nyontarai pei mamo i dedu Duainunung Mamarang pai.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Mana Petrusi kewio doyo, “Au koda kong pe nemu pa to! Tutu borato piwe Allai dona pa wori na pe pae? <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Au wo konta na mariwa nini pai wa, wo anemurarongpai mei wa na Allai renawau. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Impaina au anemutaweri warui piwe bona moyawa pa we anemurarong unawa pa, mae tondau we Seni imbaro I dupirandeni we anemutatuata moyawa pa warui anemurarong pai. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Wo yau wo erewo au mamo anemurarongpai parari neopi we dawiri kong wemoyawa pa dawi au.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Interi Simoni dewara we Petrusi kong Yoanisi doyo, “Maruwo muntandau we Seni imbaro pitaubai we muntopana moyawa yana reo dedu yau pe.” <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Petrusi kong Yoanisi untopana parari Allai ne Arera pa rakai na yana, interi untaweri to Yerusalemi ea, na undataweri pa mamo umbuwu Arera Weweng na awa tau na raora Samaria pa.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilipusi kong nyontarai baba pei na Etiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Seni ne mampangpei kewio wu Piripusi doyo, “Pilipuse towa rua! Rua to do matani to rangkapung wia na Yerusalemi to Gasa, rang yani menanopi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Interi Pilipusi ria, na a yani nyontarai sida-sida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sida-sida pai mamo nyontarai muang dina, na awe ne pudapa ura ea kodu pa, embe kabiri i imbaro riupi we mananu pai na ne mandarong ete ne istana pai we deiwai pitaubai nempa.</char></note> pei, i riu wang wetadai, wewedung na mandarong Kandake, wawing mananu na Etiopia pai pitaubai nempa, i ria yomi we Allai na Yerusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Mae teweri na wa we piaung empapari pai, i meyoi na wa rarongpai mae detora na weraung nabi Yesayai. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Impaina Duainunung Mamarang pai kewio we Pilipusi doyo, “Rua kikeu wa we rianai pai.”<figure style="fig" file="LB00331C.TIF" size="col" ref="8:29">Pilipusi ria denyau nyontarai baba Etiopia pai</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Topiana pa Pilipusi ria kikeu wei interi i tarao nyontarai wadi detora na weraung nabi Yesayai, Pilipusi dutani doyo, “Yai e! Anembau piwe botora pae?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Nyontarai pai kewio doyo, “Topitotoi yau ingkai aneubawi pa, mana ei kewio anyawi we yau wa paina?” Interi i kewio aya Pilipusi imbaro umbeita na wa we depairi pai mae meyoi kikewi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Waya detori na weraung mamarang pai riotu topino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“I perari domba we empapari we engkutui</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">parariapi domba antung we esea netuing pai mana weraupui wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">topiana I kewio wa perari woretamung.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Yes. 53:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />I entatipari kong etongpampinomi na wemai wa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Ne asengpa takutu warui na nunei wawonei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">impaina nyontarai pei kewio parari woriai nempai wa.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Interi mananu na Etiopia wadi kewio we Pilipusi doyo, “Eyutang au, mateidi nabi nini kewio parari pa? Sopang parari mantauni ete parari nyontarai pei ea ne?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Impaina na Pilipusi retenang kewiopa na rirang weraung mamarang pai yana, i wiuwu Arera Weweng parari Yesusi we mananu wetedai pai. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Na rang rabuang pa, ya enda sisu nu pei etadu maria pea, mananu Etiopia wadi kewio doyo, “Remua maria piwani, pitoai dona mamo webaptisi yau wa pae?” [<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Pilipusi kewio wei doyo, “Parari Tuane roaoa na anemurarong pai tantenang, mamo au ingkai webaptisi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:37">Mananu Etopia wadi kewio doyo, “Yau eroaoa we Yesusi Kristusi wo Allai Antung pina.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na pampompa ei soi parari Sen ne Kawione yatino Kawio nina pa kawio riotu tuwara pina</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Interi nyontarai Etiopia wadi demi we yiru wapai we pioweta, interi asaru umbia, Pilipusi kong nyontarai Etiopia wadi umbia to maria pai rarong pa, interi Pilipusi webaptisi nyontarai wadi. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Na awe umbeita warui maria wadi pa, na tantuma Sen Duainunung Mamarang wadi kio Pilipusi warui nu yani, impaina mananu Etiopia pai riuinari Pilipusi eawa, anerarongpai merarising kia interi i yana wa we yanai pai kiori teweri. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Na tantuma Pilipusi nyai na Asdoti, i ria topong na ne rang rarong pa wiuwu Arera Weweng pai parari Yesusi, na bendaripa tantenang ra sisu bendari Kaisarea rau.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saulusi anetaweri warui ne sasari pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Na a yani pai Saulusi wo anekangkuna we doamuna kong miungtati nyontarai we etua Seni wauya, i ria kewio we imami baba pai,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1-19a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3-16">Kis. 22:3-16</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:9-18">26:9-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />we dewa weraung parenta pei kiori to we embedung we manu Yaudi esominai pai na Damsiki, imbaromi na wana dedu nyontarai we enda na Rang Yesusi pai eaya mamo, tepu ya dawi embaramipa mae kio ya to Yerusalemi.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Impaina Saulusi ria to bendari Damsiki paia, ria kikeu we bendari wadi mamo, na tantuma wedeapei na rora pai dea wari raora we Saulusi doanai pai. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Interi i sawa to kakopa pai, na yana tarao nyondaupui pei kewio wei doyo, “Saulus, Sauluse! Pitoai donane mungtati Yau pa?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saulusi kewio doyo, “Mateidi au, Seni?” Nyondapui pai doyo, “Yau Yesusi we piana muntatiri pai. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Mana towa boa, ruato bendari rarong waneia, na wana ingkai entopana we au pitoiai topitotoipa bongpararia pa.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Toyana nyontarai we endakong Saulusi paya entantuma kong embe endaupui kateawa, tutu ya entarao nyondaupui pai mana endeo nyontarai pei wa. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Interi Saulusi tewara doa, mana rekamipa piana renawa reo pianea wa, na yana ya enduna warang pa etinti esua to Damsiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />A tantenang pe botoru mamo reoa katea wa kong i dampi wa mae dunung maria wa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Na Damsiki nyontarai pei, iwo dua Yesusi anong pei Ananiasi, Seni denyau netarai pai parari ami mae kewio wei doyo, “Ananiase!” Ananiasi kewio doyo, “Seni yau nina!” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Interi Seni kewio doyo, “Au ruato rang we anong pei Rang Yeriwang to Yudasi manu nempai, na wana butang we nyontarai pei anongpei Saulusi we riana awa Tarsusi, nyontarai yani wo andi tendau pa. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Mae na pi parari ami pei, mamo i reo nyontarai we anong pei Ananiasi yuara pui riuwa warampa warawawuri, imbaromi i reoa naria ea.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Mana Ananiasi kewio doyo, “Sen, yau wo piana etarawo nyontarai tau engkawio kakera nyontarai nini, we dongkangkani nemu nyontarai endoao na Yerusalemi paya. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Kong Saulusi piana riama we do dewara kong we embedung na imami paya, we tepu nyontarai we endoao Au paya engkai.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Mana Seni kewio we Ananiasi doyo, “Ruaki, wo Yau piana yirii we piata Yau, imbaro i wiuwu Anoune we kawasa peaya, ya wo Yaudi diya wa, kong we mananu paya tutu rai Israeli pai tato. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Mantau Yau ingkai yenyawa wei, uira pitaubaio topitotoi dedutapa tutu wiuwu Anoune.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Impaina Ananiasi ria yua to Yudasi manu nempai, i riuwa warangpa mae warawawu Saulusi mae doyo, “Sauluse netaneupa au, Sen Yesusi we remoi na rang rabuangpa na awe ruamapa, andi demi yau eramapa imbaromi au remuna ea kong Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao au.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Na a yanito parariapi diang neuna pei tepa warui Saulusi rekamipa interi i reoana taweri, toyana i tewa mae webaptisi. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Mae dampia kaipa mamo netaraipai paya taweri ea.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulusi denyau na Damsiki</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulusi nyai na Damsiki ape bototoi ea kong we etua Yesusi paya. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Na yanato i riato manu Yaudi esominapa mae wiuwua we Yesusi wo Allai Antung dina. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Nyontarai paya engkai esarokutuya we entarao Saulusi kewio toyana paina, impaina engkawio etoyo, “I wo nyontarai we na Yerusalemi piana miung nyontarai pitau we endoao Yesusi pa to? Kong ria toninama we tepu nyontarai endoaoa paya mae kio ya wu we embedung na imami paya to?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Mana Allai dong paya we Saulusi we nyari nyontarai paya endoaoa na kawio sopana pa, Kawio we sopana yana pa denyawa we na Yesusi tarai I wo Mananu Mampariri dina, impiana nyontarai Yaudi we enai na Damsiki paya etadu piea wa we etimbatetari.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Wepira ape bototoi manyonapa, nyontarai Yaudi paya engkawiotatuata we emung Saulusi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2Kor. 11:32-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Impaina diru kong raida ya etamamang na aturarei baba na bendari pai we emuni, mana piwe engkawiotatuata yana pa, ei piana sopana we Saulusi to. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Mana na diru peandina, we etua Saulusi paya engkoria, interi empiri na rawangpei rarong pai to umbaua.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saulusi na Yerusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Saulusi ria to Yerusalemia, mae na yana pa i meriwa we ingkai kionta kong we etua Yesusi paya, mana ya emataiti tutu ya wo endoaoi wa topino taraie dodua Yesusi. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Mana Barnabasi ria wuria, mae kiori wu rasuri paya, mae i tato kewiora we ya parari topino Saulusi mantauni reo Seni na rang rabuang pa mae Seni kewio wei, Barnabasi tato kewio pararia we Saulusi piana denyau na Damsiki na Yesusi anong pa na metai wa. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Topiana pa Saulusi nyai kong ya mae denyau na metai wa na Yerusalemi tantenang na Seni anong pa. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />I kewio derura kong nyontarai Yaudi we engkawio na kawio Yunani pai parari Yesusi, mana esamupa we eto emuni. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Impaina nyontarai we endoaoa peaya, engko Saulusi to Kaisarea, interi etanatui pampani to Tarsusi. <verse eid="ACT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Topianapa jemaati taubai na Yudea, Galilea, kong Samaria tantenang enaina we piboki, Allai ne Duainunung pai piata ya, mae ematai Seni, jemaati paya empaya ea kong empau naria ea.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi na Lida kong Yope</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petrusi ria waria piaio jemaati paya, na apeana i piaio Seni ne nyontarai emamarang we enai na Lida paya. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Na yanapa i dedu nyontarai muang pei anong pei Eneasi, i piana piaya pudape injatoru mae tewa warui nu denanai pai wa. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Interi Petrusi kewio we Eneasi doyo, “Enease, Yesusi Kristusi dong au ponang, towa mae bosaiwa andaung we buenanai pai.” Na yanato i tewa doa. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Impaina kawasa taubai na Lida kong Saroni endeo Eneasi penang pa, mamo engkai endoao Seni.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Na raora Yope mamo nyontarai wawing pei anong pei Tabitai, i wo nyontarai we rioao Seni, (anongpa esawa na kawio Yunani aino Dorkasi, nina ne topino rusa), i wo dong piwe mai kia mae piata nyontarai we enepianeawa paya. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Na a yani yuia keda, interi etoni kiuwira, mae etonia wiata na mandarong we na yei pai. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Na Yope mamo woroi kaira wa warui Lida, impaina awe weetua Yesusi na Yope paya entarao Petrusi nyaina Lida, interi esoretuwa nyontarai pe kodu unda wu Petrusi kong ungko arera ninane, “Rua moraru to nu amaneng wanea.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Interi Petrusi tewa mae ria kong asaru, enda sisu wanapa engko Petrusi to mandarong we na yeipai, wawing kabong paya engkai esoriwari Petrusi mae esai kong etanyawa asung tanang kong asung tarimbai we Dorkasi dawa we ya na awe i wieng pa. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Mana Petrusi demi ya enda tori engkai, interi meoi sanang aebu pa mae tendau. Impaina arota we Dorkasi netarai kakopa wadi mae kewio doyo, “Tabita towa!” Toyana Dorkasi rekamipa tapira mae tewa, na awe reo Petrusi mamo tewara meoi. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Interi Petrusi riu na warang pa mae riupiataria doa, toyana Petrusi yau nyontarai we endoaoa paya kong wawing kabong paya interi dong Dorkasi we piana wieng taweri pai wu yara. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Arera parari piwe tawa na Tabitai pa, embuwua na bendari Yope tantenang, impaina nyontarai madupei endoaoa we Yesusi wo Mananu Mampariri dina. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Interi Petrusi nyaina bendari Yope pai ape bototoiea na Simoni ne manu wadi, i wo nyontarai we nyari piaung rerawapa raka kong manyena we dawa we pianea ea.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petrusi kong Korneliusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Na bendari Kaisarea mamo nyontarai muang pei anong pei Korneliusi, i wo ne pangkati perwira we “Rai pimamuna Italia pai.”<figure style="fig" file="HK00193C.TIF" size="col" ref="10:1">Rai pimamuna Roma pai</figure> <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />I kong ne mandarong pai tantenang ematai we Allai kong esomi wei, i tendau pampang we Allai. Korneliusi nini wo piata nyontarai Yaudi taubai we ene pianea wa pa.<verse eid="ACT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Na apeana saraka riora botoru raida pai, i reoa na pitarai pianea parari ami, wo Allai ne mampang pei riama yauwi doyo, “Korneliuse!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Interi Korneliusi rekakepang mampang wadi na metai interi kewio doyo, “Pitoipa Seni e?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Mampang wadi kewio doyo, “Nemu tondau kong warangbampa taparera we nyontarai paya piana Allai reoa to kong Allai tato anekakepang auto. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Impaina na ninato bomi nyontarai peaya to Yope we engko nyontarai we anong pei Simoni we esawi na Petrusi. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />I nyaina Simoni ne manupai, Simoni nini dong piaung rerawa pa ra kaa kong manyena we pianea ea, ne manupai sura na kareng arawa pa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Na a we mampangpai ria warui Korneliusi pa, i yau ne we empatari na manu pa kodu kong nyontarai pimamuna maninuing we mei pei, na pimamuna we etuari pampang paya. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Interi Korneliusi kewio parariapi piwe tawapa, interi demi ya to Yope. <verse eid="ACT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Kamai eampai mamo nyontarai ne itoru itonda sisu rang rabuang we piana kikeu na Yope, wa saraka riora ura ea kodu mamo Petrusi wieita to manu mangkawawuani paia we tendau. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Interi Petrusi wewi kia impaina anewe dampi, mana roweang pe emanyena toyana pa, na tantuma i dedu pianea parari demi. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />I reo rorapai tebau kong pianei perariapi irei we teparera enpiri wu nunei, yawa na beou manuapa. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Na irei rarompai mamo dedu piaung we esae manuapa yatino we ena ri paya, piaung we esawaya pa kong aya we esapo pa. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Interi nyondaupui pei kewio wei doyo, “Petruse towa kutui buani!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petrusi doyo, “Wengki Seni, yau wo yang roweang we ewe tapua pa wa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Mana nyondaupui yani kewio wei ea doyo, “Pitoi ai Allai sopana we mamarang pa, mamo remo topana we wetapua wau pe.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Interi pi reoa yana, kong nyondaupui we kewio pa we botoru mae irei pai wieita to rorapai. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petrusi anerarongpai dutang waweri tutu piwe reoa pa, na yana nyontarai we Korneliusi demi ya pa enda sisu manu we Petrusi nyainai pai. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Interi esau nyontarai peima etutani etoyo, “Simoni we esawi we Petrusi andi nyai manu nini e?” <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Na awe Petrusi anetatua piwe reoa pa toyana mana Duainunung Mamarang pai kewio wei doyo, “Nyontarai pe itombe toru itoru itosera au. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Towa wiara weu kong anemuriru we ruakong ya pe, wo Yau yemia endama pa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Interi Petrusi wia raweu mae kewio we ya doyo, “Yauno mesera yau pa; Pitoi donane mendama mesera yau pae?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Engkawio etoyo, “Korneliusi, i wo perwira we anerarong weng mae metai Allai, kong kawasa Yaudi paya entuang wei we andi wieng pa, Allai ne mampang mamarang pei ria wuria sopana wei, we dewara we au rua wuri to nemanu pai we tarao pitoi ai topana wei pa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Impaina Petrusi kewio weya doyo, “Diru nini metena na nina pa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Kamai wadi Petrusi tewa ria kong ya, nyontarai we endoaoa na Yope pa embetotoi endakonta. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />We pira apai ya enda sisu Kaisarea. Na yana Korneliusi kong neta paya kong nyontarai we dewara we ya pa piana empandura etamamangto. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Na awe Petrusi ria sisu yana, Korneliusi ria wuria demamamani kong suang yomi wei na renawau. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Mana Petrusi riuwaria doa interi kewio doyo, “Towa! Mantau yau wo nyontarai di yau tato.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petrusi kewio kong Korneliusi toyana, mae yua to manu pai rarong pa, na yana reo nyontarai madu pei empandura kuira to. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Interi kewio weya doyo, “Manetapa mia, mantau mia mesaneaoa we, na Akama Yaudi pai yuara kangkuna we nyontarai Yaudi paya empandura wa kong Yaudi wa paya pe, ete esua to ene manupa pe, mana Allai piana denyawa we yau to, yau wo erewo etopana we nyontarai pea ya we ya engkararia pe. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Piyana pa donane na awe wau yau we erama pa, yau emaidai wa we erama pe, impaina yo etarawo pitoai donane Tuane wau yau tutura pa.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Korneliusi kewio doyo, “Ape botoru we rampa parari anei, yau etandau na manupai na saraka botoru rawandeng pa. Na tantuma nyontarai pei doana reuna wau, asung we yesuna pa waweria. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />I kewio doyo, ‘Korneliuse! Allai piana tarao nemu tandau pa to kong aneao waramu tapira we bingpata nyontarai enepianea wa pa to. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Impaina bomi nyontarai pei riato Yope, yau nyontarai pei we anompe Simon Petrusi, i nyaina Simoni ne manupai na kareng arawa pa, Simoni nini we nyari piaung rerawa raka manyena we pianea ea.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Toyana mamo yemi nyontarai peaya wu au ma kong anemu rarong pai merarising we ruama nina, wo piana amanda kuira tonina ma na Allai renane, imbaromi amantarao piwe Allai demi au topana we amapa.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Interi Petrusi kewio doyo, “Nina wo yau erewoarona tarai we Allai riukui nyontarai we esomi wei paya kuira na wemai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Ul. 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Nyontarai we na kawasa totoi ea na Yaudi ete Yaudi wa e, yati ematai Allai kong enari piwe maipa mamo nyontarai yasa ya Allai riukui ya. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Maneta pa mia mentarakamang piana Allai ne Arera wiuwua we ne rai Israeli paya, arera yani wo Arera Weweng parari wemadori piboki we rana Yesusi Kristusi, i andino we Seni we nyontarai nea engkai. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mia wo mesaneaoa to piwe tawa na raora Yudea tantenang, we retenang na Galileapa na awe wepiana Yoanisi wiuwu kakera baptisangpai, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />yana wo parari Yesusi na Nasareti topino Allai dupi na Duainunung Mamarang pai kong ne mambiri pa. Andi ria wari raorapa tantenang dong weweng pa kong dong nyontarai we nyombatangpai yumao yapa empanang, wo Allai nyai konti. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Amawo nyontarai we piana amandeo meari pitaubai we I dona na raora nyontarai Yaudi paya kong na bendari Yerusalemi, topianapa tato emuni etonia yeroi na aitabapai. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Mana na awe botoru pai Allai doni tewa nariaea warui kaidapai kong Allai doni denyawi we nyontarai neya. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />We nyontarai paya engkai wa mana we ama, nyontarai we Allai diri ama pampong we ambesaksi parari I pa, amati piana amatampi kong amatunung konti na awe tewa warui kaidapai. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Kong I demi ama amambuwu ne Arera Weweng ne we nyontarai taubai kong amambesaksi we, I wo Allai riuwari we Mananu we kiutu kawio we nyontarai we embeng paya kong nyontarai we engkada paya. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Andi nabi pa engkai engkawio parari pa etoyo, ‘Nyontarai pa matei kionta we rioaoa we Yesusi mamo, i ingkai Allai dupirandeni ne sasaripa tutu Anong pa.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai embe Yaudi wa etadu Duainunung Mamarang pai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Na awe Petrusi kewio rai mamo Duainunung Mamarang pai wiama yumao nyontarai taubai we entarao arera yana. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Nyontarai Yaudi we endoao Yesusi mae endakong Petrusi warui Yope ma pa, esarokutuya we endeo Allai dong Duainunung Mamarang pai we nyontarai na ri we embe Yaudi wa pa. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Wo ya entarao nyontarai paya engkawio na kawio pea weiya we mantaung ya enduinaria wa kong etaparanding Allai, interi Petrusi kewio doyo, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Mendema nyontarai nini ya, piana etadu Duainunung Mamarang pai parari we tataduta pa, impaina nyontarai pa mateidi yuara we embebaptisi na maria pa wae?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Impaina Petrusi demi ya embebaptisi na Yesusi Kristusi Anong pa, interi etewara we Petrusi imbaro nyai kong ya ape bototoi woroi ea.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Petrusi kewio parariapi Korneliusi we baptisi pa we Jemaati na Yerusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Rasuri paya kong nyontarai taubai we endoao Yesusi na Yudea tantenang, entaraoa we nyontarai tau we embe Akama Yaudi wa piana etadu Allai ne Arera pa to. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Impaina na awe Petrusi ria wu Yerusalemi ampai, nyontarai Yaudi we embe sunati paya etimbatetari. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Ya engkawio etoyo, “Pitoi dona wua na nyontarai we embe sunati wami paya ene manupae? Kong pitoi dona buampi kuira kong ya pae?” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Mana Petrusi doyaoa weya parari pitaubai we tawa pa, na retenangpa ra kai napa mae doyo, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Yau piana etandau na bendari Yope, mamo na tantuma Allai ne mambiri pa yumao yau impaina erewo piea parari ami. Piana perari irei we dererai yeroi na beou manua pa, wia na rora pai ma menaing na reuna wau. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Mae yau ereukakepani apuipa mamo erewo piaung we esaemi manua pa, kong piaung we eteung ya wa, piaung esawaya kong aya we eteung ya wa. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Interi etarawo nyondaupui pei kewio we yau doyo, ‘Petruse towa kutui buani!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Mana yau ekawio yoyo, ‘Seni e, wengki! Topino yau wo yang roweang we ewe tapuapa wa.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Interi nyondaupui yani kewio we yau ea doyo, ‘Pitoi ai Allai sopana we mamarang pa, remo topana we piana wetapua pe.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Toyana piwe ereoa yana ereoa we botoru interi irei pai wieita to rora-marising. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Na yana to nyontarai toru we etami itoru itonda na Kaisarea ma pa itonda sisu na manu we enai nai pai. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Interi Duainunung Mamarang pai kewio we yau doyo, ‘Towa rua kong ya menda kuira mae remo anemuriru pe.’ Kong neta embe wonang nisa etua yau to Kaisarea, nayana amasua kuira to nyontarai pei ne manupai apui. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Impaina muang pei kewio we ama topino i reo mampang pei doa na ne manu wadi rarong pa mae kewio doyo, ‘Bomi nyontarai peaya to Yope esau nyontarai muang pei anong pei Simoni we esawi tato we Petrusipai. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />I ingkai sopang arera we kio pariri pa we au, kong we nemu mandarong pai.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Mae na eruwa kawio pa, Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao ya, parari we tawa na tata pampong pa. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Na yana to yau aneuao Seni ne kawio sopani we doyo, ‘Yoanisi webaptisi na maria mana Allai ingkai webaptisi mia na Duainunung Mamarang pai.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Kis. 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Impaina Allai dong Duainunung Mamarang pai we nyontarai embe akama Yaudi wa pa parari doni we tata na awe tandoao Sen Yesus Kristusi pa, impaina topitotoi pa yongwido Allai e?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Na awe ya entarao piyana pa, ya aidisa interi etaparanding Allai etoyo, “Toyana mamo nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa paya tato Allai dong a pea we ya imbaro esanetaweri warui ene sasari pa interi etadu wieng ki woroi-woroi pa.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabasi kong Saulusi uronta to Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Na awe Stepanusia emuni ampa, nyontarai we etongkangkani we endoao Yesusi pa etadawa ya. Impaina we endoaoa paya embawu enaitatera na nu wau tantenang. Enaitatera sisu raora Fenisia, Siprusi kong bendari Antiokia. Mae ya embuwu Arera Weweng pai we nyontarai Yaudi paya ki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Kis. 8:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Mana na nyontarai we endoao paya, we na raora Siprusi kong Kirene embetotoi ya enda to Antiokia. Mae ya embuwu Arera We Wieng pai we nyontarai we embe akama Yunani paya, topino Yesusi wo Seni ina. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Seni ne paya pa derua ya impaina nyontarai madupei yati endoaoa kong esanetaweri we Seni.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Impaina kawio parari piwe tawa na Antiokia pa kawasa na Yerusalemi pa entaraoa. Interi ya etami Barnabasi to Antiokia we reo ya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Na awe Barnabasi ria ampai i reo Allai dong Ne weweng dona pinoma pa we nyontarai nayana pa. I merarising mae kewio denyau ya imbaro endoaoa we Seni na tarai. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnabasi ninipai wo anerarong pai weng mae Duainunung Mamarang pai yumaoi kong rioao Seni na pitarai, donane rai paya etua Seni. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Interi Barnabasi ria to bendari Tarsusia we yerai Saulusi. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />I dedu Saulusi interi kio Saulusi to Antiokia, na yana unai puda-dediru pei tantenang kong jemaati pai mae uranyau nyontarai tau paya. Na Antiokia wo nyontarai we endoao Yesusi pa we retenang esau ya we nyontarai keresteng. <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Na ayana nyontarai nabi pa embetotoi enda na Yerusalemi to Antiokia ra. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Koiri na nabi paya anong pei Agabusi, Duainunung Mamarang dong paya wei impaina kewio kakera doyo, “Na nunei tantenang ingkai piwawi baba pei tawa ki.” Ninane tawa napei Kaisari Klaudiusi riuwe mananu pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Kis. 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Interi nyontarai we etua Yesusi paya engkai engkutua we empandui pe pea parari pitoai koiri-koiri enempa, mae etanatua we etimpata eneta we enaina Yudea paya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Apa yani etong pararia, interi etami Barnabasi kong Saulusi asaru ungko piwe etongkuirapa we weembedung we jemaati na Yudea paya.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Rasuri pa ya etadu amuna baba na Herodesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Na a yani pai to mananu Herodesi dongkangkani nyontarai we endoao Kristusi na kangkuna. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />I deirora ne we empatari paya we emung Yakobusi, Yoanisi neta pai na sondu. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Na awe Herodesi reo piwe tawa yanapa, waua nyontarai Yaudi pa esanerarong pa. Impaina i dong we moyawa yana ea. Interi demi ne we empatari paya entapu Petrusi ea. Piwe yanapa tawa na A Baba Roti Weragi Wa. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Entapu Petrusi engkori to wangka rarong pai. Pimamuna pandura pe manua we etongwido Petrusi, pandura koiri mamo pimamuna pe embe manua. Herodesi anetatuata we a Paska paia kai mamo, i dutang kakewa Petrusi na nyontarai we empau paya endenawau.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kel. 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Toyana pa Petrusi nyai na wangka rarong pai, mana nyontarai endoaoa paya entandau pitarai we Allai we Petrusi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi meti warui wangka pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Kamai pai wami we Herodesi dutang waweri Petrusi na kawasa tau endenapa, diru yani Petrusi we piana etawiti na wai besipa wiata na pimamuna pa asaru une madupa na wangka rarong pai. Kong na aturarei pa tato pimamuna peaya etoa widori na yana.<figure style="fig" file="LB00335C.TIF" size="col" ref="12:6">Petrusi wiata na pimamuna pa asaru une madu pa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Interi na tantuma Seni ne mampang pei doa rurang Petrusi, mae wedea wadi wieria na mandarong wangka pai. Mampangpai waratia na Petrusi mae byauni doyo, “Towa moraru!” Na yanato wai besi etingkae Petrusi warang pa makakekutua. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Mae mampang wadi kewio wei doyo, “Wosung asung pa kong woya sandari pa!” I dong pararia. Interi mampang wadi kewio wei ea doyo, “Wosung asung pampang pai mae bua yau!” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Interi Petrusi dua mampang wadi toria mae i riuinari pitoai mampang wadi dona pa tarai tawato, i dorato we pi reoa pa parariapi demi. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Na unda toripa ra sisu we etoa widori na retenang pa kong we kodu pa, mae undara uradu aturarei baba besi pina we tete bendari wadi. Na yana aturarei wadi esepari parariapi ea esepari we asaru. Piana umati nari wau to, interi unda sisu na rang kapung wadi mamo na tantuma mampang wadi nyai warui Petrusi. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Interi Petrusi tentumao piwe piana tawa naipa mae kewio doyo, “Anei piana ereuaroana we Seni demi mampangnei pika yau warui Herodesi ne mambiri pa kong nyontarai Yaudi ene apa we esaipaya we yau pa.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Na awe Petrusi aneao piwe tawa pa, i ria wu Mariai, Yoanisi nyani ne manu paia, Yoanisi we esawi tato na Markusi. Na yana nyontarai madupei empandura mae entandau we Allai. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Awe Petrusi ria dedu manu wadi, i so aturarei repong wadi impaina wawing mampata pei anong pei Rodei riama we reo matei so aturareipai pa. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Petrusi doa weraupui na riwau, toyana wawing mampata wadi taraaroang Petrusi kewio towani, mana tutu merarising kia paina teweri to rarong we sopana wu nyontarai we empau nea we Petrusi doa na ri pa impaina perandeni yepa aturarei neipe. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Interi ya engkawio we wawing wadi etoyo, “Au wowawipe!” Mana Rodei kewio kangkuna doyo, “Taraie, Petrusina!” Interi ya engkawio wei etoyo, “Mampang we deruari pinape.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Toyana pa Petrusi so aturarei wadi pampang interi nyontarai we empanduiya wau esepa aturarei kong endeoi, ya entantuma mae esarokutuya. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Mana Petrusi dong kamang na warangpa weya imbaro endeo engkawio erape. Interi i kewio pararia weya topino Seni deruari meti tori warui wangka wadi. Mae i kewio doyo, “Mentopana we Yakobusi kong neta ea paya”, interi i meti ria to nu pea ea.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Na kamai wadi pimamuna wau ya etutang waweria kia tutu piwe tawa na Petrusi pa. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Interi Herodesi demi pimamuna paya eserai Petrusi, mana etadutiwa. Impaina demi etutangkakewa pimamuna we empata na wangkapai ya kong emusa. Interi Herodesi ria warui Yudea to Kaisarea mae nyaina wana.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herodesi keda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Mananu Herodesi keou kia we nyontarai na bendari Tirus kong Sidoni paya. Impaina ya engkai endama we eto esarota mananu Herodesi. Interi engkawio aya Blastusi tutu i wedung we Herodesi mandarong nempai, interi Blastusi anerarong sawa weya imbaro kewio ko Herodesi mamo, ya emadori kongti tutu ya wo roweang enempa etaduta na Herodesi raora nempa.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Na apeana Herodesi kewio kamang we ingkai kewio we ne rai paya. Na ayani i yesung ne asung mananu pa, meoina ne pata mananupa mae kewio weya. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Kawasa we entarao Herodesi ne kawio pa emararising mae etoyo, “Nina wo nyondaupui piami dina, mae nyondaupui nyontarai watang dina wa!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Na ayani to Seni ne mampangpai riora Herodesi tutu i yomi we Allai wa, impaina piaorapa etania keda.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Impaina Allai ne Arera pa embuwua tate nu pa mae nyontarai pa madupei endoao Allai. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Barnabasi kong Saulusi urong mariwapa ra kaipa, mamo untaweri na Yerusalemi kong ungko Yoanisi we esawi na Markusi ria kong asaru.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Etiri kong etanatu Barnabasi kong Saulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Na a yani, na jemaati Antiokia pai, nabi pe embetotoi kong kuru pe embetotoi, aino Barnabasi kong Simoni we esawi Bometani, Lukiusi nyontarai Kirene pai, Saulusi, Manaheni we eteuni kong mananu Herodesi. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Na awe embenadi we Seni kong embe puasa pa, Duainunung Mamarang pai riama kewio weya doyo, “Metiri Barnabasi kong Saulusi asaru we Yau, imbaro asaru unduwai mariwa we piana Yona we asaru we ingkai undupa.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Impaina embepuasa kong entandau mae enduwa embarami etimbarawawu asaru interi etami asaru unda.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saulusi kong Barnabasi asaru na nutakutu Siprusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Tutu Duainunung Mamarang pai demi Barnabasi kong Saulusi asaru paina, usa to Seleukia arau. Na wana urapai to nutakutu Siprusi. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Na awe uradu bendari Salamisi pa, asaru umbuwu Allai ne Arera pa na manu Yaudi esomi na pa. Yoanisi we esawi tato we Markusipai ria kong asaru we piata asaru. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Itondawari nutakutu paia sisu bendari Paposi. Na yana itoradu nyontarai Yaudi pei anong pei Baryesusi. I dedu paya na Nyombatangpai kong i wo nabi tarai dina wa. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />I wo maneta we piata Sergius Paulusi, gubernuri na nu takutu yani, i wo anemainuanung. Gubernuripai yau Barnabasi kong Saulusi asaru tutu do tarao Allai ne Arera pa. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Mana Elimasi we anong na kawio Yunani mamo Baryesusi we ne paya na nyombatangpai dongwido Barnabasi kong Saulusi asaru, imbaromi gubernuri na nutakutupai reo rioao Yesusi pe. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Mana Saulusi we esawi we Paulusipai Duainunung Mamarang pai yumaoi paina doa yeori. <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />Interi kewio wei doyo, “Auwo kumai nyombatang di au, au weangkakari barui, au wemarowa we weuna pa. Pitoi dona mamo bongwawido Allai ne anetatuata we periri nyontarai neya pae? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Interi remua Seni dong mambabati o au! Au ingkai rempipu, mae remuao wo pai ne aikarare peawa ape bototoi ea.” Na yana pato Elimasi ruradiduing na rekami pa parariapi piwe mietang yekowi ma kewung rekamipa, impaina ria deka-aera we yerai nyontarai we riupatari. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Na awe kubernuri pai reao piwe tawa yanapa, i rioao Yesusi, wo retantuma tarai Seni ne anyau pai.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi kong Barnabasi unda to Antiokia na raora Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Interi na Paposi, Paulusi kong neta paya etapaikutua na kapari pai, interi enda to Perga na raora Pampilia. Na yana Yoanisi we esawi Markusi pai ria warui asaru mae teweri to Yerusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Na Perga Paulusi kong Barnabasi unda pampang to Antiokia na nu Pisidia pai. Na a Sabati pai unda umayoi na manu Yaudi esomi nai pai. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Na awe etato Weraung Mamarang na nabi paya entoi pa kong parari Kawio we Musai soi pa rakai, we embedung we manu Yaudi esomi nai pai ya esoretuwa nyontarai peaya etutang Paulusi kong we endakonti paya etoyo, “Manetapa mia parari mene pianyau pea we nyontarai nina ya mamo, katu mentopanato!” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Paulusi tewara doa riuwa warang pai interi kewio doyo, “Maneta nyontarai Israeli pa mia kong neta neu Yaudi wa pa mia we mematai Sen Allai pa, mentarama! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Allai nyontarai Israeli pai, piana diri tantapumi woria paya, kong nyari ya empau ea na awe enaina Mesiri we nyontarai ea pea embei ya. Na warang we mambiri pa kio ya emati warui kakopa Mesiri pai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kel. 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:51">12:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Allai aidini retantawang pitau we etonapa na mapang pai woroi pudape piakodu pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:31">Ul. 1:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Marandang pe boitu we ene nupa na kakopa Kanaani pai, Allai miung ya ra engkai warui raora Kanaani, mae wiwo raora yana we kawasa Israeli paya imbaromi etaduta we ene.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Ul. 7:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Na awe embiwo kakopa Kanania eampa, Allai dona we ya mananu esau ya we Hakimi we embe mananu weya puda pe piaura we kodu ea piakodu ea ura (450), kiao awe Semueli we nabi pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Hak. 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Sam. 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Interi ya etewara we mananu pei. Impaina Allai dong Sauli we mananu weya. I riu mananupa pudape pia kodu. Sauli nini tamani anong pei Kisi. I riana marandang Benyamini nempai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:17-21">1Sam. 10:17-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Na awe Allai pika Sauli warui we mananupa, I riuwa Dauti we mananu we Israeli paya. Mae Dauti nini pai, Allai piana sopang parari na pampong pa doyo, ‘Yau yedu Isai ne kumai Dauti eampa to, we i kio aneurarongnei kong dong parari piwe aneutatuata pa na wemai.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1Sam. 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:21">Mzm. 89:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Na Dauti ne tapumi woriai wanea, Allai piana riuwa Mananu Mampariri pai we nyontarai Israeli neya parari ne kawio derekamana pa. Yatino Yesusi andi we Mananu Mampariri pa. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yesusi riuwa ne mariwa pa wami, piana Yoanisi yau we nyontarai Israeli paya imbaromi ya esanetaweri warui sasari enempa kong embebaptisi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk. 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yoanesi mariwa we riupa ra do kaipa, kewio doyo, ‘Mesanetatuata we matei di yau pa e? Yau wo Mesiasi metamamani pi di yau wa, mana katea katu I ingkai riama pa. Nyontarai yani eyepa ne sandari pa mamo emaiwa.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoh. 1:20</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />E, neu neta na Abrami ne mandarongpai mia kong neu neta Yaudi wa we mematai Allai pa mia kuira. Allai piana dong ne kawio we kio pariripa we tata to. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Wo nyontarai tau we enai na Yerusalemi kong ene mananu paya endoa we Yesusi wo Mananu Mampariri pai dina wa. Anyau na nabi paya anemai na Sabati pa etatora pa entapu wa, impaina ya etong mambabati kaida pa we Yesusi. Mana na pi enari toyana pa, aidonane pitoai na pampongpa nabi paya engkawio kakerapa nina wo piana parariato. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Topitotoi ya etadu piwe dosarara pea wa na Yesusi, we dedu mambabatio kaida pai, mana ya wo etewara kangkuna we Pilatusi we imbaro I emunia keda.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Mat. 27:22-23</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">57-61</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Kong etong parari piwe entoi na Weraung Mamarang pai rarong parari I pa kuira akai, ya etong netarai we kedapai toung warui aitabapai mae engkoria wiata na kambirei esirai we aisata na wi we kamipa. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Mana Allai doni wieng taweri warui kaidapai. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Kis. 1:3</ref></char></note> Na a peara woroi anto I ria denyawi netarai pai we nyontarai we piana enda konti na Galilea to Yerusalemi pa. Yati nina mamo embe saksi tutu I we rai Israeli paya pa. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Impaina nina mamo amambuwu kawio we weng yani pai we mia; pitoai Allai derekamana we tantapumi woriai paya pa, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mzm. 2:7</ref></char></note> piyana I dona we tata na dong Yesusi wieng taweri ea warui kaida pai. Wo na weraung mamarang Masmuri kodu we entoi topino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Auwo Neu Kumai di Au.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Na a nini Yau wo piana ewe Tamamui pa.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Yes. 55:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Allai piana doni wieng taweri warui kaida pai. Nina I wo netarai pai tepapising na aisata rarong eawa; weo piana Allai kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Yau ingkai yona we mia arera we mamarang we ingkai yona pararia we piana yerekamani we Dauti pa.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mzm. 16:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Topiana tato na rirang pea kewiora topino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Au pika Nemu Woming Memarang pai wiatara tepapesing na aisata pa rarong wa.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Dauti piana nyari piwe Allai demi nyari pa na wemaito, interi keda tato kong ne tapumi woriai mae esirai na aisata pai. Kong ne taraipai piana tepapesing kiaito. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Mana Yesusi we Allai doni wieng taweri warui kaida pai, Yesusi yani paiwo tepapesing wa. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Impaina netapa mia, topitotoi pa amambuwua we na Yesusi memeari sasari tane nei dupirandeni pa. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kong naina I nyontarai we endoaoa paya koiri-koiri dedu pariri warui sasari pa, we metaduta wa na Kawio we Musai pai. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Impaina mendekakepana aiwara, imbaro donane metadu piwe nabi paya entopanapa pe, pi entopana etoyo,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab. 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> ‘Mendekakepana pitarai nyontarai we mengkawio mengkakani nyontarai pa mia!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ingkai tawa tantuma mae mengkada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Wo na puda dediru nini pai Yau enari pianea we mia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Pi we ingkai mendoaoa wa Kong nyontarai pei sopana we miaki mana mendoaoa wa.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Na awe Paulusi kong Barnabasi unda tori warui manu we esomi nai pai, nyontarai tau etewara kong asaru imbaro untaweri ma na a Sabati we riama wanei untopang parari anyau yana pa ea. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Interi embe nadi akaipa, nyontarai Yaudi paya kong nyontarai ea ya, yawo nyontarai Yaudi diya wa, mana esua akama Yaudi. Empau kia enda kong Paulusi kong Barnabasi. Impaina rasuri pa asaru uranyau ya imbaro endu Sen Allai ne weweng dona pinoma pa ra maitui.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Na a Sabati eampai wareto nyontarai tau na bendari yani enda engkaima entarao Allai ne Arera pa. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Mana nyontarai Yaudi pa endeo nyontarai we empau paya, ya esaneung we rasuri pa asaru wa. Impaina ya entatipa Paulusi kong embateta kawio we sopana pa. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Mana na umataiwa, Paulusi kong Barnabasi ungkawio kangkuna uroyo, “Allai ne Arera we topitotoi kia umbuwua we mia pampong wo, mana memaidai metaduta kong mesaneaoa wa, impaina mantaung mia mengkutu we metadu wieng ki woroi-woroi pa wa. Aidonapa na a ninipai amampika mia, amanda wu kawasa pea weiya. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Yes. 49:6</ref></char></note> Wo, Seni dongkawio we ama, kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Yau piana ekawio kamana we au wepadamara wedea kawasa Yaudi wa paya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">imbaro ko pariripa we nunei tantenang.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Na awe nyontarai Yaudi wa pa entaraoa pi yana pa, ya emararising kia mae etaparanding Allai ne Arera pa. Kong nyontarai we piana Allai diri ya we etadu we wieng kio woroi-woroi pa, ya endoaoa. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Interi Seni ne Arera pa embuwua na nunei tantenang.<verse eid="ACT 13:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Nyontarai Yaudi engkawio aya wawing pampong peaya we piana ematai Allai, kong mananu baba na bendari yani, mae etong kangkania we Paulusi kong Barnabasi mae etadawa asaru warui raora yani. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat. 10:14</ref></char></note> Interi Paulusi kong Barnabasi untatai wawu na usaebampa we urisua nyontarai paya, mae unda to Ikoniumia. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Na Antiokia we etua Yesusi paya emararising kia kong Duainunung Mamarangpai Yumao ya.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Paulusi kong Barnabasi Na Bendari Ikoniumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Paulusi kong Barnabasi urong piwe mai kia na Ikoniumi pa tato, aino asaru unda wu manu Yaudi esominai pai, uranyau Kawio Mamarang pa na wengkia impaina nyontarai Yaudi madu peaya kong Yaudi wa pa endoaoa we Yesusi.<figure style="fig" file="LB00246C.TIF" size="col" ref="14:1">Nyontarai Yaudi ene manu esomi na, esawi we Sinagoge</figure> <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Mana nyontarai Yaudi we entampi rasuri pa asaru une anyaupa, endara engkawio aya nyontarai embe Yaudi wa pa, imbaromi engkayou nyontarai we endoao Yesusi paya. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Topiana pa mamo Paulusi kong Barnabasi unai manyona pei na yana pa. Mae asaru ungkawio na we mambiri tutu undoao Seni. Impaina Seni dong ne paya pa we asaru we unari pi aneaerai pa kong pi tantuma pa. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Mana kawasa taubai na bendari pai mamo empibau ya we pandura pe kodu; ea aino esaneweng nyontarai Yaudi wauya kong ea ya tato esaneweng rasuri wau asaru. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Interi nyontarai Yaudi paya kong ene mananu paya kuira kong nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa paya, engkawio mai we etong pampinong rasuri pa asaru kong eso asaru na kami. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Mana rasuri pa asaru usanetatua piyana pa, interi umbawu aididina to Listra kong Derbe, aino bendari na Likaonia, mae raora na yana pato. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Na wanapa asaru umbuwu Arera Weweng pai ea.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na Listra kong Derbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Na Listra mamo nyontarai muang pei aengpa paya na nyani meyoituturi pa, impaina i wo ria wa, wo aengpa mararua. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Nyontarai we piaya yani pai meyoi na yana pa tarao Paulusi kewio pa. Paulusi reoi kong rearoani topino i wo aneaoa kia impaina Paulusi doni penang. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Impaina Paulusi kewio kangkuna wei doyo, “Towa boa tera!” Nyontarai piaya pai keikoparia doa, interi ria towana-tonina. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Na awe nyontarai taubai paya endeo piwe Paulusi donapa, impaina etanana na kawio Likaonia: etoyo, “Nyombatangnai piana embia to nunei enetaraipa perari nyontarai.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Interi Barnabasi esawi anong pei Seusi mae Paulusi esawi anong pei Hermesi tutu andi kewio pa. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Nyombatanai Seusi ne manu esomi wei nai pai wiata na bendari ri wane. Ne imami pai kio sapi muang peaya kong pimaranding we enari na aibopu pei to aturarei baba na bendari pai we dona pikika we rasuri pa asaru kong we empaupa pikika enempa. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Na awe Paulusi kong Barnabasi untarao piwe nyontarai paya etona we asaru pa, ungkayou kia. Asaru usakoya asung unempa mae urapai to kawasa pa ene madupa, ungkawio na nyondaupui baba we ya uroyo, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Eh! Pitoai metona tonina pae? Andu wo nyontarai di andu tato parari maneta pa mia! Andu unai na ninane we umbuwu Arera Weweng pa we mia imbaro mempika piwe unawa nina mae mesanetaweri wu Allai we wieng pai. Andi nyari rorapai, nunei, rawanang rau kong pitaubai we nyai na pa. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Na awe rampa mamo Allai pika kawasa paya etong parari piwe mantau esaneaoa pa. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Mana Allai perandeni wa we denyawi netara pai na ne weweng we dona pa. Weweng yana denyawa na dong mamang miuna na rora we yeraru kakopa pa kong dong marepio pitantanang pa webong. Kong dong roweang we mia kong dong mesanerarong pa mararising.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Toyana rasuri pa asaru ungkawio pitau yana ki, mana kawio we untopana pa uraini ya tutu pikika we eto etona we asaru pa wa.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Mana nyontarai Yaudi pe embetotoi na bendari Antiokia na raora Pisidia kong Ikoniumi enda to Ristra, interi ya engkawio aya nyontarai we empau we engkosa. Impaina ya eso Paulusi na kami, ya etorato piana kedato impiana empapari tori warui bendari wadi, <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />mana awe nyontarai we endoaoa paya etoa wari pa, i tewa mae yua to bendari wadi. Kamai wadi i kong Barnabasi uronta to Derbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi kong Barnabasi untaweri to Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Na yana, Paulusi kong Barnabasi umbuwu Arera Weweng pa mae nyontarai taubai endoaoa we Yesusi. Interi untaweri ea to Listra, Ikoniumi kong Antiokia na raora Pisidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Na bendari wadi ungkawio usua nyontarai etua Yesusi pa, kong ungkawio kangkuna we ya imbaro endoao Yesusi pitarai. Kong uroyo, “Tatoyo tasua to Allai ne riu we Mananu pa mamo andi tatadu uira pitaubai wo.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Kong na jemaati pa, rasuri pa asaru unduwa nyontarai peaya we embedung na jemaati na yana na bendari undaoa pa. Interi untandau kong umbe puasa we urong we embedung na jemaati paya wu Seni. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Interi unda topong rire raora Pisidia tantenang kong ra sisu na raora Pampilia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Na yana piana embuwu Allai ne Arera pa na bendari Perga, interi ya enda to Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Na yana usataweri to Antiokia. Bendari ninipai di na pampong pa etong asaru we Allai ne weweng dona pinoma pa, we unduwa Ne mariwa pa we piana urona rakai pa nina. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Na awe uronta ra sisu yanapa mamo usau jemaati paya ma empandura, interi asaru ungkawio parari pitau we Allai dona tawa na asaru pa. Kong I yepa aturarei we kawasa peaya imbaro endoao Yesusi konta. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Na bendari yani Paulusi kong Barnabasi unai woroi kuira kong nyontarai endoaoa paya.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mayoi sidang baba na Yerusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Nyontarai Yaudi we endoao Yesusi pe embetotoi enda na Yudea to Antiokia mae etanyau nyontarai we endoao Yesusi na yana pa etoyo, “Topitotoi mamo andi membesunati parari pitoai kanang Musai soi pa, wereria mamo metadu pariripa wa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Im. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paulusi kong Barnabasi umbateta nyontarai pa ene anyau pa na kangkuna. Impaina nyontarai endoaoa paya engkutua we Paulusi kong Barnabasi kong nyontarai peaya na kawasa na Antiokia we endawu rasuri paya kong we embedung na Yerusalemi paya imbaro engkawio parari piwe tawa yana. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Interi jemaati na Antiokia endatutu ya to bendari ri wadia, interi ya enda rire Penisia kong Samaria. Mae na nu yani ya entopana we nyontarai endoaoa na yana pa, parari Yaudi wa we piana esanetaweri warui ene sasaripa kong endoao Yesusi. Piyana pa donane eneta we endoaoa na yana pa emararising kia. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Endara sisu Yerusalemi mamo jemaati na yana pa, rasuri paya kong we embedung we jemaati paya etamamang weya na wepiboki. Interi rasuri pa asaru ungkawio parari pitau we Allai nyari na asaru we Yaudi wa paya. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Mana nyontarai pe embetotoi na pandura nyontarai embe Farisi we piana endoaoa paya, etoa engkawio etoyo: “Nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa pa andi embesunati ya kong etong parari Kawio we Musai pa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Toyana pa rasuri kong we embedung we jemaati paya empanduiya engkawio parari piyana. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Emayoi engkawio we piyana saraka riora bototoi anto, interi Petrusi tewa doa kewio weya doyo, “Eh netapa mia, mia piana mantau mendeoa to, wo na retenang pa Allai diri yau na mia, imbaromi ewuwu ne Arera Weweng pai we nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa pa imbaro entarao arera yana kong endoaoa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Kis. 10:1-43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Kong Allai we rearoang nyontarai ne esanerarong pai, piana denyawa we demang weya na wemai. Piyana pa I denyawa na dong Duainunung Mamarang pai we ya parari dona we tata pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Kis. 2:4</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 10:44">10:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Allai pi we nyari we nyontarai ne tata pa mai kuira. Tutu ya endoaoi impaina Seni rioipapi esanerarongpai parari pitoai nyari we tata pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Impaina pitoi donane mia mentou Allai na metami nyontarai we endoao Yesusi paya etong parari kawio we memba we mentopana yana. Mana tantapumi woriaipa ma sisu tata ninane tatong pararia na we pitarai wa. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Mae tata tandoaoa kong tatadu pariri pa tutu Sen Yesusi ne weweng dona pinoma we tata pa, toyana tato we ya konta.” <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Impaina kawasa paya aidisa interi ya entarao Paulusi kong Barnabasi ungkawio parari piwe aneaerai kong piwe tawa tantuma we Allai nyari na asaru we nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa wauya pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Na Paulusi kong Barnabasi ungkawio akaipa, Yakobusi kewio doyo, “Netapa mia mentarao yau: <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni katene kewio pararia topino Allai ne wewengpa we kawasa embe Yaudi wa, yatino diri nyontarai peaya na nyontarai Yaudi wa paya, we ingkai yau ya we ne nyontarai. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Pi yanapa parari we nabi paya entoi kamana na weraung mamarang pai:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Seni kewio doyo, ‘Interi Yau ingkai etaweri ema</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">kong enari Dauti ne manu we piana wemunamunai pai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">kong enari doa tera taweri;<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Am. 9:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />imbaromi nyontarai tau we esea nea eserai Seni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">ya engkong kawasa we embe Yaudi wa paya we piana Yiri ya etua Yau.’ Seni kewio toyana,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />we piana sopang pi yana na pampong pato.”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Interi Yakobusi kewio naria ea doyo, “Impaina na yau mamo, tandeo tatong nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa nea esaseung we endoaoa kong entaweri wu Allai pe, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />mana tatawo tantoi arera pea weya, imbaromi ya endeo etang roweang we etona etisomi nyombatangnai pai kong endeo etong maniniawari kong endeo etang pieung we emung ya mae riapa nayapa pe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Kel. 34:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Im. 17:10-16</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">18:6-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Wo na awe rampa kawio we Musai soipa, anemai na a Sabati pai etatora pampang na manu Yaudi esominai pa na bendari pa tantenang.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Weraung we nyontarai Yaudi wa we piana endoaoa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Toyana rasuri pa kong we embedung na jemaati paya tapu nyontarai tau pa, engkutu we etiri nyontarai pe embetotoi we endato Antiokia tapu Paulusi kong Barnabasi. Impaina etiri Yudasi we esawi Barsabasi kong Sirasi. Asaruwo endearoana we umai na nyontarai we endoaoa paya. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Interi entoi arera pei weya we riotu topinina:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“We netapa mia na kawasa ea pa we membe Yaudi wa, we menai na Antiokia, Siria kong Kilikia.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">Tabea we rana rasuri kong we embedung ne ama, aino meneta pa ama.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Amawo piana amantaraoa we nyontarai pe embetotoi na ama, endama etanyau anyau wetarai wa we mia, mana yawo amatami ya wa. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Pi yanapa donane amangkutua we amatiri nyontarai pe embetotoi we mia kong amaneta Barnabasi kong Paulusi we amasanewiwu asaru pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Nyontarai kodu ni asaru wo piana umpika unduainunung pai we Seni tutu Yesus Kristusi anong pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Impaina amawo piana amatami Yudasi kong Sirasi we maneta pa mia, asaru ingkai utopana konta we mia parari piwe amantoi na weraung nini pai we mia pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Na Duainunung Mamarang pai ne paya pa, amangkutua we amamaidai amatong mia metong parari mambabati mamba warui we ingkai we metonapa pe. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Aino: mia wo metang roweang we etisomi nyombatangnai pa pe, metang ria pe, metang pieung tarai we riapa matiwa kong mendeo menari piwe maniniawari pe. Topino mia meteung menetaraipa warui piyana pa mamo metong parari we mai pa peina.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:29">Topiana wo, mae tabea we mia.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Etopang tabea we ya rakai pa, we etamiya pa enda to Antiokia. Na yana esau jemaati paya empandu ya interi etong weraung wadi we ya. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Jemaati pai emararising tutu etato arera we wana weraung wadi wiaua ya. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yudasi kong Silasi nabi di asaru tato, na a yani ungkawio uranyau uneta we endoaoa paya manyona pei kong urong ya esanemangkusi. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Mae unai nayana manyona pei, uneta paya empika asaru na wemadori interi untaweri wu nyontarai we etami asaru pa ea. [ <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Mana Silasi kiutu we do nyaina yana.]<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi kong Barnabasi Untatera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paulusi kong Barnabasi unai woroi ape bototoi na Antiokia. Asaru ungkong nyontarai we empau peaya etanyau kong embuwu Seni ne Arera pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Mana ape bototoi ea interi Paulusi kewio we Barnabasi doyo, “Weng peino tuntaweri wu tuneta na bendari wanea, we piana pampong pa tumbuwu Seni ne Arera pai we tundeo topitotoi pi naya pa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Interi Barnabasi anewe kio Yoanisi we esawi Markusi pai. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Mana Paulusi do moyawa we kio Markusi, we meidai meriwa kong asaru kong pika asaru na Pamfilia pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Kis. 13:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Impaina Paulusi kong Barnabasi ungkayou asaru mae umbeyeya: Barnabasi kio Markusi mae uronta to Siprusi. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Mana Paulusi tato diri Silasi we donta konti interi neta paya etong asaru to Seni ne weweng dona pinoma pa. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Asaru undawari Siria kong Kilikia, na wana umpata jemaati paya imbaro endoaoa kangkuna.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Timotiusi riakong Paulusi kong Silasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulusi ria pampang to Derbe kong to Listra. Na yana nyontarai we duara Yesusi anong pei Timotiusi; nyani wo nyontarai Yaudi we piana rioao Yesusi, mae tamani wo nyontarai Yunani dina. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Na Listra kong Ikoniumi mamo nyontarai endoaoa paya endearoang Timotiusi nyontarai we mei dina. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulusi anewe Timotiusi duari; impaina i wesunati Timotiusi. I dong piyana tutu nyontarai Yaudi na raora yani paya, ereuaroana we Timotiusi tamani wo nyontarai Yunani dina.<verse eid="ACT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi wiera to Makedonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Paulusi kong neta pa asaru, itonda waria na bendari pei to bendari pei ea, mae itontopana parari kawio we rasuri pa kong we embedung na Yerusalemi paya engkutua pa, imbaro jemaati pa etong pararia. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Topiana jemaati paya endoaoa pa maitui ea kong anemai mamo empau ea.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Duainunung Mamarang yuara we Paulusi kong Silasi asaru we umbuwu Arera Weweng pai na Asia pe. Impaina itonda waria na raora Prigia kong Galatia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Na awe itonda sisu na raora we dapii Misia pai, eto esua to raora Bitinia, mana Yesusi Duainunung pai Yua ya we esua to wana pe. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Impaina ya enda rire raora Misia topong ki sisu na Troasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Na diru yani pai Paulusi reo pianyawa pei, i reo nyontarai Makedonia pei doa na renawau mae kewio doyo, “Ruakutuama we puata ama!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paulusi reo pianyawa yani paia, kamai pai amanduasasoni we amandato Makedonia. Tutu amandoaoa we Allai di yau ama we amambuwu ne Arera Weweng nei we nyontarai na wana paya pa. <verse eid="ACT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Interi amampika Troasi mae amatapai to Samotrake, mae kamai wadi amampapa na Neapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Na yana amandatorei to bendari Pilipi, bendari retenang na raora Makedonia pina. Bendari nini piana nyontarai Roma enainaito kong etongwawidori. Amanai ape bototoi na yana.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Pilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Na a Sabati pai amanda to maria arawa na aturarei baba ri na bendari wadi, tutu ama amanduradiduing we na yana nu we nyontarai Yaudi entandau nai pei rai. Interi amamayoi amangkawio kong wawing we empandura na nu yani. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Nyontarai wawing pei na ya, i wo wawing we dewayang irei we keu, anong pei Lidiai mae ria na Tiatira ma. I anewiwu we Allai, impaina Seni yepa anerarong pai imbaro yewawa anyau we Paulusi sopana pa. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Impaina Lidiai kong ne mandarong pai embebaptisi. Interi dewa ama, doyo, “Netapa mia mendearoana pitarai we piana eroao Yesusi mamo, mendama memayoi kong yau na neu manu nei.” Interi i deirora imbaro amatong parari piwe dewara pa.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Na apeana amanda to nu we entandau nai pai, amatadu woming wawing pei. Wawing yani semi-semi pai dawi impaina kewio kakera piwe ingkai tawa pa. Na pidona pa kio pe pau we ne tuang paya. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Wawing wadi dua Paulusi kong andu mae kewio yeau kangkuna doyo, “Nyontarai nisa wo Allai ne woming we Entadai raweina di ya! Ya endama entopana we neta pa mia, rang we metadu pariri pa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Pi yanapa wawing wadi dona woroi we ape bototoi to. Impaina Paulusi demioming paina reweria kewio we semi-semi pai doyo, “Na Yesus Kristusi anompa yemi au moti warui wawing nini.” Na yanato semi-semi pai meti warui.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wewedung we wangka Pilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Na awe wawing wadi ne tuang paya endeoa we piwe esanesara we etingtadu pe weya pa nai warui ya pa to, impaina ya entapu Paulusi kong Silasi, interi empapa asaru to mananu parenta endena wau na nu awayang we kekawiri na bendari wadi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ya engko Paulusi kong Silasi asaru we mananu parenta Roma paya, interi engkawio etoyo, “Nyontarai nini asaru wo nyontarai Yaudi di asaru. Ya etong amuna na bendari tane nei. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Mae asaru uranyau kanang we bia tane mamba Roma nei pa. Kanang yani wo tataduti ete tatong parari wa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Nyontarai we empau paya tato embateta Paulusi kong Silasi. Interi mananu parenta paya entami nyontarai peaya esayabu une asung pa warui unetarai pa interi endaruba asaru na karipiapa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Piana ya endaruba kangkung asarua kaipa, ya eso asaru to wangka rarong pai. Mae etami we wedung na wangka wadi rekakepang asaru na pitarai. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Impaina we wedung we wangka wadi riukepang asaru na mandarong wangka rarong wiri puidi, mae rerai aitamu na usaemi wau. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Wa diru rabuang to Paulusi kong Silasi untandau kong undoi uraparanding Allai. Nyontarai we na wangka wau ya entarao undoipa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Na tantuma mundi we piaya era, ki kakopa wawong na wangka wadi medidou. Aturarei tau na wangka wau tapapa kong wai rante besi we etingkae nyontarai na wangka paya makaketua. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />We wedung na wangka wadi tentuma tewa. Awe reo aturarei na wangka pa tapapa, i piating sondu we miung waweri tutu i dorato nyontarai na wangka paya piana etapai engkaito. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Mana Paulusi denana kangkuna doyo, “Remo mung aupe! Wo amangkai amati nina rai!” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Wewedung na wangka wadi dewa padamara pei interi depai to rarong, mae na didora i meoi aebu na Paulusi kong Silasi undena wau. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Interi i kio asaru tori mae kewio doyo, “Tuani e maru! Pitoai eyona imbaro yedu pariri pa e?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Paurusi kong Silasi ungkawio uroyo, “Roaoa we Sen Yesusi! Au ingkai bodu pariri pa, au kong nyontarai we na nemu mandarong pai kiai.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Interi Paurusi kong Silasi untopang parari Seni ne Arera pa we wewedung na wangka wadi kong we nyontarai tau we na manu neng wadi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Na a yani pai to wewedung na wangka wadi kio asaru mae dongpapi une kapapowau. Na yana tato i kong nyontarai tau we na ne manu wadi ya embebaptisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Interi i kio Paulusi kong Silasi asaru wu ne manu wadia mae dong roweang pea we asaru. I kong ne mandarong pai emararising tutu ninane ya endoaoa we Allai paina. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Kamai wadi, mananu parenta Roma paya etami purisi we endupi na yana embetotoi enda wu wangka wadi we empika Paulusi kong Silasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Wewedung na wangka wadi pempang kawio pa we Paulusi. I doyo, “Mananu parenta paya piana etamia we empika maru. Impaina nina wo mumati tori kong munda na wepiboki to!” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Mana Paulusi kewio we purisi wadi doyo, “Andu wo nyontarai Roma di andu. Ya etutang kakewa andu wa, mana piana endaruba andu na nyontarai ene madu pa na endena wau kong eso andu to wangka rarong nei. Mae ninane ya eto etongpika andu na aididinae? Andu umaidai! Mia metami mananu parenta pa mantau ya endama empika andu.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Purisi wau entopangweroana we mananu parenta Roma paya. Topiyana mananu wauya entaraoa we Paulusi kong Silasi asaruwo nyontarai Roma di asaru, impaina ematai kia. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Interi ya enda esomi we Paulusi kong Silasi tutu piwe etosarara we asaru pa. Topiana ya endatutu asaru tori warui wangka wadi, kong etewara imbaro unda warui bendari wadi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Na yana Paulusi kong Silasi umpika wangka wadi interi unda to manu Lidiai neng wadi. Piana umpandura kong nyontarai we endoaoa pa na yana, mae uranyau ya imbaro endoaoa pa maitui, interi Paulusi kong Silasi uronta warui bendari wadi.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Nyontarai Yaudi na Tesalonika etauamuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulusi kong Silasi unda topong rire Ampipolisi kong Apolonia interi unda usua na Tesalonika. Na wana manu Yaudi esomi nai pei. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Interi Paulusi ria wu manu we esomi nai pai, parari we dona na nu ea pa. Na yana kewio kong nyontarai Yaudi wauya parari Weraung Mamarang pai. I nyari piyana pa taituwari na a Sabati pe botoru. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Na rirang Weraung Mamarang pai, i kewio kong denyauwa weya parari Mananu Mampariri we Allai derekamani pai, we ingkai andi dedu uira ki keda kong suwi warui kaidapai. Paulusi kewio topong doyo, “Yesusi we ekawiori we mia nini pai di Mananu Mampariri we Allai derekamini pina.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Nyontarai Yaudi pe embetotoi na yana endoaoa kong entua Paulusi kong Sirasi asaru. Kong nyontarai Yunani taubai we ematai Allai paya kong wawing pampong peaya na yana tato, ea kuira etua Paulusi kong Silasi asaru. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Mana nyontarai Yaudi paya esanekayowi kia na esanerarong. Ya esau nyontarai we emamuna we anemai mamo emayoi pampinoma na manu awayang wane. Imbaro embateta Paulusi kong Silasi asaru. Interi ya etong amuna na bendari wadi kuira mae esabu Yasoni manu nempai we eserai Paulusi kong Silasi asaru na yana, we empapa asaru wu nyontarai empau paya endenawau. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Mana etadu Paulusi kong Silasi asaru wa, impaina ya empapa Yasoni kong nyontarai we endoaoa pa embe totoi to parenta baba na bendari yani mae esayau etoyo, “Nyontarai nisaya wo etoamuna na nupa totoi ea, nina wo bendari tane nei endamaoi to. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Kong Yasoni piana pendukui ya na ne manupai. Ya engkai etosara piwe kaisari Roma kemang pa tutu ya etoyo mananu ei pei yatino Yesusi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Na kawio we entopana yana donane nyontarai madu pei kong we embedung na bendari yani pai yuira kia. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Mana mananu paya etami Yasoni kong nyontarai we endoao Allai paya embai pe pa we etingpariri imbaromi empika ya.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulusi kong Silasi na Berea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Na diru yani pai tato, nyontarai endoaoa na bendari yani pai etami Paulusi kong Silasi unda to Berea. Unda sisu nu yani Paulusi kong Silasi unda wu manu Yaudi esomi nai pai nayana. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Nyontarai Yaudi we enai na Berea paya esanerarong pa wengkia warui nyontarai Yaudi we enai na Tesalonika paya. Na esanerarong we mararising entarao arera parari Yesusi pa, kong anemai ya esaneatori Weraung Mamarang pai we etintatua anyau Paulusi sopana pa wepitarai ete wereriae. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Impaina madu peayati nayana endoao Yesusi kong nyontarai Yunani empau kia we embe pampong paya endoaoa, wawing kong muang. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Na awe nyontarai Yaudi we enai na Tesalonika paya entaraoa we Paulusi sopang Allai ne Arera pa na Berea, impaina ya enda to Berea ma we engkawio aya nyontarai tau paya kong etong ya esanerarongpa yai. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Mana nyontarai na Berea paya endatutu Paulusi to kareng rau mana Silasi kong Timotiusi unai na Berea. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />We etua Paulusi paya etadung ya sisu Atena interi entaweri to Berea mae engko arera we Paulusi sopana wu Silasi kong Timotiusi asaru imbaro unda tuwari umararu.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Atena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulusi demang Silasi kong Timotiusi asaru na Atena toyana, mana i anerarongpai yai tutu reo bendari yani pai donung na nyombatangnai paya. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Aidona pa na manu Yaudi esominai pai Paulusi nini riwang kawio pa kong nyontarai Yaudi kong nyontarai Yaudi wa we esomi we Allai paya. Toyana tato na manu awayang pai, anemai mamo riwang kawio pa kong we dedu ya na yana pa. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Kuru we entanyau Epikorusi ne anyau pa kong we etanyau Stoai ne anyau pa etarura we Paulusi, kong embetotoi na ya engkawio wei etoyo, “Nyontarai nini kewio barui mana rekamang kateaki?” Mana embe totoi eaya engkawio etoyo, “Parariapi i kewio kakera nyombatangnai na rai pea.” Yati engkawio topiana, tutu Paulusi kewio kakera Arera Weweng parari Yesusi kong tewa pa. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Interi engko Paulusi wu sidang Areopagusi na wi pai, mae engkawio wei etoyo, “Amasane we amantarao anyau waworu we topana pa. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Tutu au topang piwe amantarao mamo weia kia parari we amantaraoa pampongpa wa na amantarakambireine pa. Impaina amasane we amantarakamana.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Impaina nyontarai Atena paya kong nyontarai we enda na nu pea weiya ma we enai na Atenapa ya emararising we anemai mamo etong a pea we entarao kawio waworu yana pa.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Interi Paulusi tewara doa na sidang Areopagusi endenapa mae kewio doyo, “E nyontarai Atena pa mia! Yau erewo pitaubai we metonapa denyawa we miawo nyontarai mesomi na tarai we nyombatangnai di mia. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Tutu yau erawari mene bendari nei kong mene nu we mentandau napa. Yau erewo piwawinta pikika pei, na yana mentoi topinina: ‘We Allai we amandekamani wa pai.’ Impaina Allai we mesomi wei mana mendekamani wa yani, andi etopani we mia nina pa. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Allai we doyao nunei nini kong pitaubai we watanai nei, andi we Seng we rora peidi kong nunei. I wo nyaina manu nyombatanai we nyontarai pea enari pa wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1Raj. 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Yes. 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Kis. 7:48</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />I tato dosanewe nyontarai peaya we empatari wa tutu Andi dong we weweng kong aseng kong pitau pa we nyontarai neya pa. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Na nyontarai pe koiri, Allai nyari kawasa paya etonung na nunei, kong dong nu pea weya we enai nai pa, na nunei tantenang. I tato na retenang pa kiutua parari apatotoi kong na totoi ya embeng napa. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Allai nyari toyana pa, imbaro nyontarai ne tata taserai I kio tataduti. Toyana ki mana Allai meyoi woroi kia warui tata koiri-koiri wa. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Parariapi kawio we nyontarai pea entopana pa; ‘Na I, tambeng mae tamariwa na nunei tutu Allai ne mambiri pa.’ Konta parari mene nyontarai we endoi pa etoyo, ‘Tata tangkai Allai Antung di tata.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Tutu tatawo Allai Antung di tata, impaina tandeo tatorato Allai perariapi nyombatangnai we nyontarai enari na masi pe ete peraki ete kami we enari parari we nyontarai ene manuanung pa pe. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Na awe tandearoang Senipa wa, donane tanari sasari aino tasomi nyombatanai paya. Piyanapa Allai reaoa ea wa, mana na a nina pai dayoa we nyontarai ne tata kuira na nunei we tasanetaweri warui sasari tatona pa. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Wo I kiutu a pei we dutangkakewa parari pitau we na nunei tantenang na wemai. Piyana pa nyontarai we piana Allai diri ampai andi nyari pa. Kong imbaro nyontarai ne endoaoa pi yana pa, mamo Allai piana doni tewa warui ne kaida pai.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Na awe nyontarai paya entaraoa parari nyontarai entawa warui kaidapai pa, ea yati emari Paulusi mae ea yati etoyo, “Apei eambo ingkai amasane we amantarao maneta pa au kowio parari pinina pa naria ea.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Interi Paulusi ria warui sidang yani pai. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Mana na ya mamo ea yati engkong Paulusi kong endoao Yesusi, aino; Donisiusi ei na majelisi Areopagusi pai kong nyontarai wawing we anompei Damarisi kong nyontarai pe embetotoi naria ea.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Paulusi Na Korintusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Interi Paulusi donta warui bendari Atena to bendari Korintusia. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Na Korintusi i dedu nyontarai Yaudi pei anongpei Akwilai, i wo nyontarai na raora Pontusi dina. I kong ne wawini Persekilai unda na raora Italia ema, tutu Kaisari Kladiusi dong kawio parenta, imbaromi nyontarai Yaudi paya kuira enda warui Roma. Impaina Paulusi ria rewawa asaru na manu unempai. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Interi nyai kong asaru na yana mae itondu pi kuira tutu mariwa unempa mai parari mariwa Paulusi nempa, aino itonari tenda we itombowa. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Anemai na a Sabati pai mamo Paulusi ria kewio Seni ne Kawio pa na manu Yaudi esomi nai pai, we kewio kakepang nyontarai Yaudi paya kong Yunani paya imbaromi endoao Yesusi.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Na awe Silasi kong Timotiusi unda na Makedonia ma pa, Paulusi dedu a we denyau Allai ne Arera pa we nyontarai Yaudi paya, we Yesusi wo Mananu Mampariri we Allai derekamani pina. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Mana nyontarai paya etimbatetari kong engkangkani, impaina i tetai wawupa warui ne asungpa mae kewio doyo, “Metadu wemoya pa mamo, mantaung mia mene sarara pina, yau emamarang! Impaina na a nini to yau ingkai era we nyontarai Yaudi wa paya.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Interi Paulusi ria warui ya na manu Yaudi esomi pai mae ria meyoi na nyontarai pei anong Titius Yustusi na manu nempai. Manu yani wiata kikeu we manu nadi na yana pai. Titiusi nini pai nyontarai Yaudi dina wa, mana yomi we Allai. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Mana Krispusi, we wedung we manu Yaudi esominai pai, rioao Sen Yesusi, i kong ne mandarong paya kuira. Mae kawasa tau na nyontarai Korintusi paya, we entarao Paulusi ne anyaupa, endoaoa kong engko enetaraipaia embebaptisi.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Na diru pei, Seni kewio we Paulusi na pianea parari ami pei doyo, “Pauluse, remo motai pe! Wuwu Neu Arera ne pampang mae au remo aidinau pe! <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Wo Yau yerua au mae nyontarai pei ingkai dong wemoyawa pa we au wa, wo nyontarai tau na bendari nini pai mamo, Neu nyontarai diya pa.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Impaina Paulusi nyai na yana puda pe koiri yembai pa bowonang, mae denyau Allai ne Arera parari Yesusi na ene madupa. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mana na awe Galioi we kubernuri na raora Akaya pai, nyontarai Yaudi paya embekoiri we etimbateta Paulusi mae engkori to kubernuri renapa we kiutu kawio parari i. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Engkawio etoyo, “Nyontarai nini denyau kawasa paya we esomi we Allai na anyau waworu pea. Anyau yana biateta we Kawio we Musai soi pa.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Na awe Paulusi doyo kewiopa, mamo kubernuri Galioi piana kewio pampong we nyontarai Yaudi paya doyo, “Nyontarai Yaudi pa mia, metimbu nyontarai nini we pi dosararapa ete wemoyawa pea mamo, ekutu mene kawio pa, <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />mana ninawo parari kawio pa tutu anompa tutu mene mamba pai mamo, mantaung mia mengkawio pararia, yau emaidai ekutu wa.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Interi i dedawa ya tori warui mandarong we engkutu kawio nai pai. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Impaina nyontarai paya entapu Sostenesi, nyontarai wewedung we manu Yaudi esomi pai. Interi endorai na nu we engkutu kawio nai pai yani; mana Galioi aneaoa wa we pi etona toyana pa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi teweri to Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulusi nyai na Korintusi woroi katea ea. Interi sopana we neta paya na yana we depai to raora Siria. Persekilai kong Akwilai uronta konti. Itorapai to Siria wami, mana na bendari Kengkrea Paulusi kiutu duandaung pa we piana pikari terimbai pai na yana tutu arera dona we Seni eampa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:18">Bil. 6:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Interi ya etapaia empapa na Epesusi. Paulusi pika Persekilai kong Akwilai asaru unai na bendari yani, mae Paulusi ria yua na manu nadi pai mae kewio kong nyontarai Yaudi paya parari Seni ne Arera Mamarang pai. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Etutani we nyai kong ya na yana woroi katea wo mana meidai. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Toyana mana na awe dontapa, kewio weya doyo, “Wo Allai aneaoa mamo, ingkai etaweri ea ema ki.” Kewio toyana weya interi donta warui bendari Epesusi. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Dontara wia na Kaisarea, i ria to Yerusalemia rewawarao jemaati na yana pa mae doyo, “Tabea we neta pa mia,” interi ria pampang to bendari Antiokia ea. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Nyai nayana ape bototoi ea, interi i donta ea. Ria wari raora Galatia tantenang kong raora Prigia we kewio kong nyontarai endoaoa paya we endoao Yesusi na maitui.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolosi denyau na Epesusi kong Korintusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Na yana pato nyontarai Yaudi pei anompi Apolosi, i na awa Aleksanderi. I anemanuainung kia na kewio pa mae rearoang Weraung Mamarang pai na wemai. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />I piana yewawa anyau we rearoang anyau parari Sen Yesusi Ne Rang wemai. Impaina na merarising kia i kewio mae denyau na kangkuna parari Yesusi, mana i wo rearoang baptisang Yoanesi mameari. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />I denyau kawasa paya na manu Yaudi esominai pai na metai wa. Na awe Persekilai kong Akwilai untarao ne anyau pa, urutani ria kong asaru to manu unempaia. Na yana ungkawiora na wemai wei parari Allai ne Rang we periri nyontarai neya na Yesusi pa. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolosi anewe tepira to Akaya, impaina neta paya na Epesusi entoi weraung pei wu nyontarai endoaoa paya nayana, imbaro etamamani na wemai. Apolosi dontara wia na Akaya mamo, ne anyau pa, piata nyontarai we endoao Yesusi paya, tutu Allai ne weweng dona pinoma weya pa. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Wo Apolosi kewio kangkuna mae biateta nyontarai Yaudi paya na kawasa endenawau kong denyawa na Weraung Mamarang pai we Yesusi mamo Mananu Mampariri dina.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Efesusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Na awe Apolosi nyaina Korintusi pa, Paulusi piana ria waria na raora na wi pa interi ria dedu Efesusi. Nayana dedu nyontarai endoao Yesusi pe embebototoi. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />I sopana weya doyo: “Mia piana metadu Duainunung Mamarang paia na awe mendoao Yasusi pa ete wereria e?” Mana endoa wei etoyo, “Wereria rai, kong amantarao parari Duainunung Mamarang pai wa.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Interi Paulusi kewio weya doyo, “Toyana mamo membebaptisi pa na matei ne baptisang pai e?” Endoa wei etoyo, “Parari Yoanesi ne baptisang pai.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Interi Paulusi kewio doyo, “Yoanesi webaptisi kawasapa denyawa we nyontarai yani paya piana esanetaweri warui ene sasaripa to. Mana na awe embebaptisi yana, Yoanesi sopana we nyontarai Israeli paya we, topitotoi ki endoao nyontarai we ingkai ria tuwari ma pai, andino Yesusi.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mrk. 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">7-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luk. 3:4</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26-27">Yoh. 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Na awe entarao Paulusi sopana toyana pa, ya embebaptisi na Sen Yesusi anompa. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Mae na awe Paulusi riuwa warangpa so yapa, Duainunung Mamarang pai yumao ya, interi engkawio na kawio pei weiya we mantaung ya enduinaria wa kong engkawio kakera parari kawio we ra na Allai pa. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Ya kuira empaupa embe urayakodu.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Na yembaipe botoru, Paulusi kewio na metaiwa we nyontarai paya na manu nadi pai mae aneatora kong nyontarai paya we dong ya endoaoa parari topitotoi Allai ne riu we Mananu pa. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Mana nyontarai pa embetotoi esanerarongpa maitui kong endoaoa wa, kong na kawasa empanduiya na yana pa endenawau, ya engkangkani anyau parari Allai ne anetatua we periri nyontarai neya na Yesusi pa. Aidona pa Paulusi ria warui ya, kio nyontarai etua Yesusi paya, enda to Tiranusi ne mandarong baba na pampongpa doni we manu sikora pai. Na yana anemai mamo Paulusi denyau ya parari Seni ne Arera pa. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />I nyari piyana pa manyona pudape kodu, impaina kawasa na nu Asia pai entarao Seni ne Arera pa, Yaudi kong Yaudi wa.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Na Paulusi, Allai nyari pitantuma pitau, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />impaina nyontaraipa engko ne asungpa ete ne rensopa ra etona wata na we esui pea kong we semi-semi dong ya pea mamo nyontarai yana paya empanang.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Skewai ne Kumai paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Nyontarai Yaudi embetotoi, ya wo nyontarai etong nyontarai empanang na ene ubapa diya, enda wu nu tantenang, mae etoyo etadawa semi-semi warui nyontarai we semi-semi yumao ya pa parari Paulusi. Impaina etoyo, “Na Sen Yesusi we Paulusi kewio parari pai anompa, amatadawa mia.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Nyontarai we enari toyana pa mamo, imami wewedung pei na Yaudi paya anong pei Skewai, ne kumai embeitu pa diya. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Mana semi-semi pai kewio weya doyo, “Yesusi mamo ereuaroani, mae Paulusi tato ereuaroani, mana matei di mia pa e?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Interi nyontarai we semi-semi yumaoipai kiopara kong yauayabu ene asungpa kong enetarai paia weria, mae etapai na enetarai kakawiri warui manupai tutu asung enempa pioayabua paina.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Nyontarai Yaudi paya kong Yaudi wa paya we enai na Epesusipa ya entarao pitawa yana, donane ematai kia. Impaina kawasa madu pei etaparanding Sen Yesusi anompa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Kawasa empau we endoao Yesusi pa endama endoa we Paulusi parari ene sasari uba we etona na pampompa. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Nyontarai we engko arawi paya, empau engko ene weraung we entoi parari ene arawipa, empandura ma enunung na kawasa endenawau. Ene weraung pa etintatuata na pe mamo ne harga pe peraki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">peraki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">peraki: pe peraki koiri mamo ne harga pa parari we riupi ne gaji a koiri. (Mat 20:2)</char></note> 50,000. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Na pitoyana pa Seni ne Arera parari Yesusi pa, embuwua na nu pa tantenang kong nyontarai pa empau endoaoa ea.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Demetriusi dong amuna na Efesusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Pi toyana pa ra kaia mamo, Paulusi kiutu we donta to Makedonia kong Akhaya mae na yana donta to Yerusalemi. Kewio doyo, “Yontara yedu nu yana pa mamo andi yontara erewo bendari Roma tato.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Interi demi nyontarai kodu we umpatari pa asaru aino Timotiusi kong Erastusi. Asaru umpamponi to Makedonia ra, mae mantauni wo nyaina raora Asia ape asaru ea.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Na a yani paidi nyontarai tau nayana pa engkayou etong amuna baba na Efesusi tutu anyau parari Yesusi ne Rang pai. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Wo na bendari yani nyontarai pei anong pei Demetriusi, i mamo menuanung nyari piwe na peraki. Andi nyari manu nyombatanai wawing Artemisio esomi wei we ene sen dina pa. Na piwe donapa dedu pe pa pau kia we ne nyontarai endupi wei paya. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Impaina pendukui ne nyontarai endupi paya kong nyontarai eaya we emanuanung enari pi na peraki parari ya pa, interi kewio weya doyo, “Netapa mia! Mesaneoa we tatadu pe pau na pitanari nina pa. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Mana nina wo piana mendeoa kong mentaraoa pitoai Paulusi dona pa. I kewio doyo nyombatangnai nyontarai ne enari pa Sen dina wa. Mae na kewio toyana pa donane kawasa tau endoao ne anyaupa, na Efesusi memeari wa mana katea ea mamo raora Asia nei tentenang. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Mae ne toyana pa donane pi tandu ne anompa wemoyawa. Pitandu ne meari wemoya wa, mana manu nyombatangnai Artemisi, sen tedai pai tato ingkai nyontarai esawi we sen tarai dina wa. Mana I wo nyombatanai tedai, we sen na raora Asia nei kong nunei tentenang.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Na awe entarao pi Demitiriusi sopana toyana pa, esanerarongpa kayou kia, interi etanana kia mae etoyo, “Artemisi au momeari kia, au we seni we kawasa na bendari Efesusi nei pa!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Impaina ya endawari bendaripai tantenang esayau mae etanana kia. Interi entapu Gayusi kong Aristarkusi, nyontarai Makedonia we urua Paulusi na ne rang rarongpa, kong empapa asaru to manu baba we kawasa empandui ya naina bendaripai. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulusi do riawu rai we pau paya we kewio kakera weya, mana nyontarai endoao Yesusi paya esuari. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Kong nyontarai baba pe embetotoi na raora Asia pai, we esanerarong wieng we Paulusi pa, etami nyontarai pea entopana we Paulusi imbaro ria we denyawi netaraipai na manupai we kawasa paya pe.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Na yana tato nyontarai we empandui ya na manu baba pai etanana kangkuna; ea entopana tonina, ea ya entopana toyana, wo ya enduinaria pitoai dona mamo empadui ya pa. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Nyontarai Yaudi paya esanetatuata we Aleksanderi andi dona mamo kawasa pa etong kawio toyana pa. Impaina entantubari topongna we kewio we rai madu pai. Interi Aleksanderi riuwa warangpa we kamang we kewio parari pitoi entubakepana weipa. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Mana awe endeoi we i wo nyontarai Yaudi dina pa, impaina etanana kangkuna kia woroipa saraka riora kodu mae etoyo, “Artemisi au momeari, au we sen we nyontarai na Efesusi pa!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Impaina sekertarisi na bendaripai deimindui ya doyo, “E nyontarai Efesusi pa mia! Matei konta na nu totoi pa, ya esaneaoa to we bendari Epesusi memeari di deung manu sen wawini Artemisi pa kong ne nyombatanai wia na rorapai maweupa. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Matei ea konta kong embateta piyana pa wa. Impaina mia aidimia mae metong pampinong mia pe. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Wo mengko nyontarai nina ya toninama pa mamo ya etawara nyombatangnai tanenei wa kong entatipa sen wawini wa. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Impaina Demetiriusi kong ne we endupi wei paya entubakepang ene piea mamo, engko ene kawiopa wu we engkutu kawiopa ya kong we kubernuria, ya etamamang. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Mana mesanetatuata we mene kawio pea ea mamo, mengko wu nyontarai we parenta pai riuwa ya we engkutu kawiopa ya. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Wo pitoai metona nina pa, imbaro kio wemoya wapa kia. Nyontarai paya ingkai etubakepang tata we tatong marowa, wo piwe tatona nina pa tarai wa.” Interi na kawio we sopana pa donane rai we pitau pai ria tatera. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Sekretarisipai kewioa kai toyana pa, i demi kawasa tau pai entaweri to ene manupa ea.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi ria to Makedonia kong Yunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Na awe uira na Efesusi pa madori taweri, interi Paulusi penduikui nyontarai we etua Yesusi na yana paya mae denyau ya imbaro esanerarongpa paya. Interi i kewio dewara kong ya we ria to Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />I ria wari raora yani kong kewio denyau neta wauya na yana imbaro esanerarongpa paya. Interi ria ra sisu na kakopa Yunani. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Piana nyai nayana woroito yembai pe botoru na yana interi depai to Siria. Mana na awe do donta to Siria yana, tarawoa na nyontarai pei we nyontarai Yaudi paya esanewe emuni. Impaina i kiutu we teweri rire raora Makedonia pai. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Nyontarai pe embetotoi endakonti, yatino Sopateri, Pirusi na Berea ne kumaipai. Aristarkusi kong Sekundusi, asaru mamo nyontarai Tesalonika di asaru, kong Gayusi na Derbe, mae Timotiusi kong nyontarai pe kodu na Asia, aino Tikikusi kong Tropimusi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Ya wo enda pampongna kong etamang ama na Troasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Mana na a baba Roti Weragi wa pai akai pa amatapai warui Pilipi. Pira ape boring amampapa na Troasi mae amampandura kong nyontarai embeitu paya. Nayana amanai woroi ape boitu ea. <verse eid="ACT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Na a retenang na arimingku yani, amampandura we amambabau rotipa we amatang kuira. Paulusi kewio we neta we endoaoa paya nayana tutu anetatua we do donta na kamai ayarima, impaina kewio pampang ki diru rabuang to. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Na mandarong na yeipei, mandarong amampandura nai pai padamara pe maduapei etona dea. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Nyontarai aimiomang anong pei Eutikusi meoi na yendera pai. Tutu Paulusi kewio pa manyona kia, impaina aimiomang wadi ayena doni kapara paina meoi denaera, impaina sawa na jendera na mangkawawuani toru pai na manu wadi toung. Na awe enduwari pa mamo piana keda to. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Mana Paulusi wiaweu meoi na aebu pa mae tepuwari interi kewio doyo, “Mesaneriru pe, wo andi wieng ne rai.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Paulusi wieita taweri aeipa, bebau rotipa mae wiwo tate nyontarai we empandura paya mae etampi kuira. Na etampia kaipa i kewio ki ayari ketua. Interi i donta. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Interi nyontarai we endoao paya engko aimiomang we wieng taweri pai to ne manupaia, mae ya kuira emararising kong endiroi kia.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi donta na Troasi to Miletusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Ama amanda pampong to kaparipai we amasanai we amatapai to Asosi, nawana amatamang we Paulusi, wo i kiutu we ria na rang rei pai to Asosi.<figure style="fig" file="HK00216C.TIF" size="col" ref="20:13">Kapari na rawanang kong ne bo pai</figure> <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Na awe riama dedu ama na Asosi pa, amanda kuira to kaparipai, interi amatapai to bendari Metilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Nayana amatapai topong ki kamai wadi mamo amendeo nutakutu Kiosi kikeu we ama. Na kamaipai ea mamo amampapa na Samosi mae na kamai wadi ea amampapa na Miletusi. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulusi piana kiutu we reo amampapa na Epesusi wa, tutu i meidai a nembau akai na raora Asia pe. Wo emararu keto era sisu na Yerusalemi na a Pantekosta pai.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi tepiratori kong penatua na Efesusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Impaina na Miletusi Paulusi denatu nyontarai pei to Efesusi we kio arera pea we dewa we embedung we jemaati paya enda wurima. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Awe endama pai, Paulusi kewio doyo, “Mia mendearong yau to, parari pitoai yona na mene madu kuirapa na raora Asia nei pa, na retenang erama yedu nu nini ra sisu a we yepai warui nu nini ea ne. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Yedu uira taubai na nyontarai Yaudi paya tutu esanetatuata we emung yau. Mana na aneutoung kong apea mamo reukaru takutu, eruwa Seni mariwa nempa pampang. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Toyana ki mana yau wo eyutopui wa we eyanyau mia pitoai una we mia pa. Pitau nina piana etopana kong yenyau mia na awe tapandura na nyontarai we empaupa endena pa kong na mene manupa kuira. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Yau ekawio eyanyau pampang we nyontarai Yaudi paya kong nyontarai Yunani wauya, imbaro ya esanetaweri warui ene sasari pa mae enda we Allai kong endoaoa we tane Sen Yesus Kristusi. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Mana anei na yongparari kawio Duainunung Mamarang demi yau wea pa, impaina yau erato Yerusalemi mae eruinari pitoai ingkai nyontarai pa etona tawao yau pa. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />We yau ereuaroana na bendari we epaioa pa kai, wo Duainunung Mamarang pai sopana kangkuna we nyontarai paya ingkai etong yau eyua wangka pai kong etong yau yedu uirapa. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Toyana mana yau ematai katea wa we ekadapa, wengki maina mamo Sen Yesusi ne mariwa we demi yau yonapa, enari na we mai, aino ewuwu Arera Weweng pai parari Allai ne weweng dona pinoma we nyontarai pa, kio engkada wane.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2Tim. 4:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Yau wo piana reuwawa mia mengkai na mene jemaati pa kong ewuwua parari Allai ne riu we Mananupa we mia. Nina ereuaroana we mia ingkai mendeo reukamine ea wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Aidonane na a nini etopana kangkuna we mia, na awa puiwane ei dedu wemoyawa mamo yau neu sara pina wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Wo yau eparandengwa we ewuwu Allai ne weanetatuata tantenang we miapa. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Impaina Paulusi kewio we weembedung paya doyo, Metosaiwa mia kong metosaiwa jemaatipai, tutu Duainunung Mamarang kemang mia we metongwido Allai ne jemaati we dedu ya na mantauni ne ria pai pa. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Yau wo ingkai era warui mia mana ereuaroana we nyontarai emparari wona emamuna we ingkai esua to mene pandura pa. Kong etongkangkani nyontarai we Allai demi mia metongwido yapa. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Mana na mantau mia, nyontarai pe embetotoi ingkai entawa we etanyau jemaati wauya na anyau we mai wa, esamupa we engko nyontarai we endoaoa paya entaweri warui rang wemai pa, imbaro etua ya. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Impaina mesaneaiwara kong mesaneaoa na wemai! Piana pudape botoru, yau yenyau mia koiri-koiri pampang, diru raida na reukarupa takutu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Nina ne yau yong mia we Allai imbaro deung mia kong mendua maitui na Allai ne Arera parari ne weweng dona pinoma pa. Allai ne mambiri we dong mia mempaya kong dona we mia muangpa we piana dona manyena we ne nyontarai neya pa. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Yau wo aneuwe yedu pe ete asung na nyontarai pei wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mia wo mesaneaoa we mantau yau na mariwa endu eampa, yedu pe pa we yau kong we enda kong yau nea. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Yau piana yenyawa we mia to na piwe pau, mamo na tamariwa kangkuna toyana pa, tampata nyontarai we empaya paya. Kong tasaneaoa we Sen Yesusi ne kawio sopana pa doyo, ‘Piboki kia we tatong pi we nyontarai, warui tataduta na ya pa.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Interi Paulusi kewioa kaipa meoiaebu ko ya mae tendau kuira. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Na yana ya engkai esai kong entapuwari Paulusi mae entopang au bonta pa. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Ya etaidu kia, tutu Paulusi kewio topino mia wo ingkai mendeo yau eawa, interi ya endatuturi wu kapari wadia.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Tirusi kong Kaisarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Na Miletusi ama amatewara we amanda warui we embedung we jemaati na Efesusi paya na amasanerarong papea mae amatapai to Kosi. Kamaipai amatapaia amampapa na Radosi, na Radosi amatapaia amampapa na Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Interi na Patara amatadu kapari pei we do depai to Penisia, impaina amambeita na kapari wadia mae amatapai. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Interi amatapaia amandeo nutakutu Siprusi to amasaneung dowiri pai mae amatapai topong to Siria. Interi amatapaia amampapa na Tirusi, wo etadaung piwe kapari kiopa. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Nayana, amandara amampaiyo nyontarai we endoao Yesusi paya kong amanai nayana ape boitu. Duainunung Mamarang pai kewio we ya imbaro esua Paulusi reo riato Yerusalemi pe. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Interi apa ra kai na yana pa, amanda we amatapai naria ea. We etua Yesusi paya kong ene wawing paya, ene kumai paya enda kong ama rasisu bendari ri waneia. Nayana na kareng pa amamayoi amasaebu mae amantandau kuira we Allai. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Nayana amatewara piboki we ya, interi Paulusi kong ama amasana kapari pai mae ya kong ene mandarong paya entaweri to manu enempa. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Na Tirusi amatapaia amampapa na Potolemaisi. Nayana amatapaia amantopang piboki we amaneta wauya mae amanai ape koiri ko ya. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Interi kamai wadi amatapai ea amampapa na Kaisarea. Amasua to Pilipusi we wiuwu Kawio Weweng wadi ne manu wadi. Iwo nyontarai koiri na embeitu we piana etiri ya na Yerusalemi pa, mae amanai na nemanu wadi ape koiri.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Kis. 6:5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Pilipusi wo ne kumai wawing pe manua, ya etadu mambiri na Allai, we engkawio kawio Allai dona we etingkawiora pa.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Piana ape bototoi amanai nayana pa, nyontarai pei riana Yudea ma iwo nabi dina, anongpei Agabusi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Kis. 11:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />I riawu ama ma. Interi kio Paulusi ne wai we dingkae anerabuang wadi. Wai nini pai dingkae mantau warang kong aengwau, i kewio doyo, “Duainunung Mamarangpai kewio tonina, We ne wai nini pai ingkai nyontarai Yaudi paya na Yerusalemi etingkaei mae etoni wu kawasa ea wauya embarararongpa.” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Amantarao kawio yana mamo, ama kong nyontarai nayana amatewara imbaromi Paulusi reo riato Yerusalemi pe. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Mana Paulusi kewio doyo, “Pitoi dona ne mesaipa, metong aneurarongnei tekakutua pa e? Mesaneaoa we yau piana yemang we entapu yau to, kong yemang we ekada na Yerusalemi tutu Sen Yesusi anongne.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Tutu Paulusi meidai tarao amane anyaupa, impaina amantopang pianea wei ea wa mae amatoyo, “Tawa parari we Seni aneaoa pa!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi pendura kong Yakobusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Piana amanai ape bototoipa ra kai na Kaisarea pa amanduasasoni ea, interi amatapai to Yerusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Weetua Yesusi pe embetotoi na Kaisarea enda kuira kong ama. Ya enda tutu ama to nyontarai we anong pei Manasoni manu nempai, i wo nyontarai Siprusi dina, i piana rioao Yesusi manyona to. Na ne manupai ingkai amamayoi konti. <verse eid="ACT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Awe amampapa na Yerusalemi pa, amaneta we endoaoa paya etamang ama na esanerarong we mararising. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Kamai wadi amanda kuira kong Paulusi wu Yakobusia; we wedung we jemaati na yana pa empandura tato. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paulusi kewio sopang piboki weya. Interi kewio na wemai parari piwe Allai nyari we kawasa ea wau ya pa na mariwa we nyari pa. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ya entarao kawio yana pa etaparanding Allai. Interi ya engkawio we Paulusi etoyo, “Maneta pa au, au remuaroana we nyontarai Yaudi madupei piana endoaoa Yesusi to. Ya wo nyontarai we etong parari kawio we Musai soipa na wemai di ya. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Mana nyontarai madupei entaraoa we au bonyau nyontarai Yaudi wauya engkai, we enai na kawasa ea wauya pa, we empika Kawio we Musai soi pa, wo au topana weya imbaro embe sunati ene kumai muang paya pe kong endeo etong parari tane kanang nei pe. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nina ne nyontarai Yaudi we piana endoaoa we enai na nina paya ingkai entaraoa we au piana bonta ma nuai na nina pa. Impaina topitotoi rai? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Impaina, nuari parari piwe amantopana ninapa: Naina ama nyontarai pe embe manua ya piana etong arera wu Seni.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Bil. 6:13-21</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Au ruakong ya we metong kanang we mendoipi menetarai pa memarang. Kong au buai ene piwe etingbaita pa imbaro ya engka enduandaung pa. Na toyana pa nyontarai paya kuira endearoana we kawio we entaraoa parari aupa tarai wa. Mae ya esaneaoa konta tutu au wo bongparari kawio we Musai soi pa na wemai di au. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Mana parari kawasa ea ya paya, we endoaoa pa, piana amantoi arera pea we ya to parari pitoai amangkutua pa. Imbaromi ya etang roweang we etona etisomi nyombatangnai pa pe, etang ria pe, ete etang pieung we emuni mana riapa nainai pe, kong etong manyinyawari pe.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Kis. 15:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Na apei ea mamo Paulusi kio nyontarai embe manua paya kongti enda, mae i rioipi netaraipai kong embe manua wauya. Interi esua to Allai ne Manu pai mae emberoana we apa totoi kanang endoipi enetarai pai etonia kiai, impaina imami pai nyunung pikika etona pa ki.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai Yaudi Entapu Paulusi na Manu Mamarang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Na a boitu pa ra kikeuwe kaipa, nyontarai Yaudi we enda na Asia ma pa, endeo Paulusi na Allai ne Manu Mamarang wadi. Interi engkawioaya nyontarai we empau peaya imbaro engkayou Paulusi kong ya kuira enda entapuri, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />etanana etoyo, “He nyontarai Israeli pa mia, metapai ma mempata ama! Nyontarai ninipai anemai denyau nyontarai neya engkai we embateta kawasa tanenei kong Kawio we Musai soi pa kong Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai! Kong anei kio nyontarai Yunani paya esua wu Allai ne Manu rarong pai mae etonia keraria!” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Wo ya piana endeo Toropimusi na Efesusi kong Paulusi na bendaripai, kong ya etorato Paulusi kiori to Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai rarong wadi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Kis. 20:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Impaina bendari wadi tantenang donung na nyontarai we engkayou kong etong wawara paya. Interi entapu Paulusi mae empapari tori warui Allai ne Manu Mamarang wadi mae nayana to aturarei baba na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pa kai esui. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Nyontarai paya esamupa we emung Paulusi, mana nyontarai pei depaia sopana we wewedung we pimamuna Roma paya we bendari Yerusalemi donung na nyontarai weetong wawara paya. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />We wedung we pimamuna paya kio perwira pa embetotoi kong pimamuna pea etapai emararu to nu we nyontarai paya etongamuna nai pai. Na awe nyontarai paya endeo wewedung pai kong ne pimamuna paya pa, ya empo we endora Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Wewedung we pimamuna wadi ria kikeu Paulusi, tepuri mae demi ya engkaei na wai rantepe kodu. Interi dutani doyo matei au kong pitoai bonapa. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Mana naina nyontarai we empau wauya eayati etanana tonina, eayati etanana toyana, donane entawa embawari pa, dona wewedung wadi anekaeng kong riuinari pitoiai we rangwe ya endora Paulusi wea tuturapa. Tutu i demi pimamuna wauya we engko Paulusi to ene markasi paia. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Enda sisu tei wadi mamo nyontarai wauya embatiteta ya impaina pimamuna paya esadowari toyeia. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Rai tau etuari mae etanana etoyo, “Memunia!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi dewara kewio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Awe engko Paulusi esuato markasi wadi, i kewio we wewedung we rai wadi doyo, “Yaie topino etopang pianea we aukie?” Wewedung wadi kewio doyo, “Au kowio na kawio Yunanie? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Impaina au nyontarai Mesiri pi di au wa e? We pampompe dong amuna kong kio nyontarai pe piaring we ura we manua (4,000) we etosaepi na apai ambe to mapangpai di au wa e?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulusi kewio doyo, “Yau wo nyontarai Yaudi di yau, na bendari Tarsusi, yau erana na bendari we anong na raora Kilikia. Yau yewara we bong a pea we yau we ekawio we nyontarai empau neya.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Interi wewedung we rai mamuna paya dong apea we Paulusi we kewio, impaina ria doa na tei wadi mae doa kewio kemang na warang wau we nyontarai we empau wauya. Piana aidisa, interi kewio na kawio Iberani wea.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi kewio we nyontarai Yaudi paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Kewio doyo, “Yai pa mia kong netapa mia mentarama, pitoai yo etopana we mia nina we yingba yau ne.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Na awe nyontarai we empau paya entarao Paulusi kewio na kawio Iberani pa, ya aidisa kia. Interi Paulusi kewio doyo, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Yau wo nyontarai Yaudi di yau, yau dukamitebau na bendari Tarsusi na raora Kilikia. Mana ebaba na bendari Yerusalemi nini; Gamalieli denyau yau pitarai parari Kawio we Musai soi kong doni we tantapumi woriai paya pa. Impaina yau wo nyontarai we emarising kia emariwa we Allai parari mia mengkai na a nini.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Kis. 5:34-39</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-19a">Kis. 9:1-19a</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:4-18">26:4-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Yau piana yongkangkani nyontarai we etua Seni ne Rangpai ki engkada. Etapu muang kong wawing interi yong ya esua to wangka pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Kis. 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Parari pi yana pa, Imami Baba kong Majelisi Akama paya endoa wea mamo embesaksi pararia tato. Wo na ya, yau yewa weraung pei we maneta we na Damsiki kong yau era towana we etapu nyontarai we endoao Seni paya, kong ekoya to Yerusalemi we etadu mambabati pa. <verse eid="ACT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Mana na rangpai towana pa, yau piana ekikeu we Damsiki, wake raida to, na tantuma wedea we wieria kia pei wiana rora paima dariwari yau. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Na yanato etabari to kakopa wadi mae etarawo nyondaupui pei kewio we yau doyo, ‘Saulus, Sauluse pitoi andi kongkani yau pae?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Ekawio wei joyo, ‘Tuane, matei di au?’ Nyondapui pai kewio doyo, ‘Yau Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti we kongkani pai di Yau.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Nyontarai we engkong yau pa, endeo wedea wadi mae ya entarao nyondaupui we kewio kong yau wadi wa. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Interi yutani ea yoyo, ‘Seni au ne, pitoai ingkai yonipa?’ Seni kewio doyo, ‘Towa mae wua to Damsiki. Na wana ingkai ei sopana we au pitau we Allai anewe bonapa.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Tutu wedea wieria pai dona reukamine ereunawa, impaina neu maniwowi we endakong yau enduna waraune mae eting yau to Damsiki.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Na wana nyontarai pei anongpei Ananiasi. I nyontarai we dong parari kawio we Musai soipa na we mai dina. Nyontarai Yaudi we enaina Damsiki paya engkai esomi wei. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />I riama doa rurang yau mae kewio doyo, Saulus, Sauluse neta pa au, wepa rengkamipa remuna taweriea! Na yanato yau erewoa ea kong ereukakepani. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Interi Ananiasi kewio we yau doyo, ‘Allai tantapumi woriai esomi wei pai piana diri au imbaro rearoang pitoai anetatuata pa, kong remo Yesusi, Allai ne Woming pai we dongparari Allai ne anetatuata pa kong taramo Yesusi raupui memeari. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Wo au andi we saksi we kowio we nyontarai paya kuira parari pitoai remoa kong we taramoa pa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Pitoai andi bomani eampa e? Towa mae bong nemutarai paia webaptisi kong tondau we Seni imbaro nemu sasari pa dupirandenia.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Yau etaweri to Yerusalemi ea, kong na awe etandau na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai toyana pa mamo, Duainunung Mamarang pai yomuo yau. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Yau erewo Seni kewio we yau doyo, ‘Pika Yerusalemi moraru, tutu nyontarai nisa entamang we kawio we topana parari Yau pa wa. <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Yau ekawio yoyo, Senie, ya piana endearona we yau eyuana manu entandau na pa we etapu ya kong eso ya to wangkapai kong eraruba nyontarai we endoao Au paya. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Toyana tato na awe Stepanusi emuni pa, mantau yau enai na yana tato kong eroa we mamuni yani. Yau tato yewawu nyontarai we emuni wadi ene asung pa.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Kis. 7:58</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Mana Seni kewio we yau doyo, ‘Ruaki, wo Yau ingkai yemi au woroi warui nina wu kawasa Yaudi wa paya.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Nyontarai tau paya entarao Paulusi kewio pa, mana na kawio sopana na pui parari doyo ria wu Yaudi wa paya, ya etanana kangkuna etoyo, “Memung nyontarai yani ki warui nunei. I andi mei we wieng wa!”<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na markasi rarong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ya etanana pampang mae eso ene asung pampangpa kong eso wawu toyei peia. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Impaina wewedung na rai wadi dong airora we engko Paulusi to markasipai mae demi ya etutang kakewari kong endarubati na ene wai pirarubata, imbaro esaneaoa we pitoai donane nyontarai we empau wauya etanana wei pa. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Mana awe etawi Paulusi we endarubati na ene wai pirarubata pa, Paulusi kewio we perwira we doana yana pai doyo, “Na tane mamba Roma nei mamo, nyontarai pei etiri ne parakara pai wami mae endarubati pampong ne?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Perwira wadi tarao kawio pa impaina ria ra sopana we wewedung na rai wadi doyo, “Tuanie! Pitoai bona tonina pa? Nyontarai nini paiwo nyontarai Roma dina.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Interi we wedung na rai wadi kewio we Paulusi doyo, “Topana we yau, taraie au nyontarai Roma di aue?” Paulusi doyo, “Tarai.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />We wedung wadi kewio doyo, “Yau ewe rai Romanei pa na ebai pe we pau kia!” Paulusi kewio doyo, “Mana yauwo dukamitebau we nyontarai Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Na yanato pimamuna we eto etiri Paulusi wauya esutopui, mae we wedung na pimamuna wadi tato metai, tutu piana dawi Paulusi aempa, mana iwo nyontarai Roma dina tato.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Majelisi Akama endenawau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />We wedung na pimamuna Roma wauya pai anewe rearong na pitarai we pitoi dona nyontarai Yaudi entubakepang Paulusi wea pa. Impaina na kamai wadi i yau we embedung na imami wauya kong Majelisi Akama paya imbaro empandura. Interi pimamuna pa engko Paulusi tori warui markasi wadi ma arota ya.<figure style="fig" file="LB00284C.TIF" size="col" ref="22:30">Majelisi Akama paya</figure><verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulusi rekakepang Majelisi Akama paya mae doyo, “Maneta pa mia! Ra sisu a nini pai mamo na aneurarong mantaung nei ereoa we yong parari Allai ne awiapa na wemai.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Na awe Paulusi kewio toyana pa, Imami Baba Ananiasi demi nyontarai we doa rurangni pai biananoang Paulusi woreng. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Mamo Paulusi kewio we Imami Baba pai doyo, “Ingkai Allai riora au, nyontarai we bongayara we moipa au. Au moyoi nayana we bimbu yau na Kawio we Musai soi pa, mana mantau au tato tuarobang mamba pai mae bomi nyontarai nei bia yau.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27-28">Mat. 23:27-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Nyontarai we engkiria Paulusi wauya engkawio we Paulusi etoyo, “Au totipa Allai ne Imami Baba pai!” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulusi kewio weya doyo, “Yo neta pa mia, yau wo eruinariawa we iwo Imami Baba dina pa. Tarai, we na Weraung Mamarang pai ea entoi topinina: ‘Remo kowio moyawa we embe mananu we kawasa pai ya pe!’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kel. 22:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paulusi reoa we nyontarai emayoi na Majerisi Akama paya mamo, eaya na nyontarai embe Saduki kong ea ya tato nyontarai embe Farisi. Impaina kewio weya doyo, “Maneta pa mia, yau wo nyontarai embe Farisi erana mandarong Farisi di yau, mesarota yau to Majelisi Akama pai we entutangkakewa yau nina ne tuturapi aneusara we nyontarai we engkada pa ingkai embeng taweri ea.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:5">Kis. 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Flp. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Na entaraoa we Paulusi kewio toyana pa, nyontarai embe Farisi paya engkong nyontarai embe Saduki paya embawaweri ya impaina mayoi pandura yani entabau we kodu. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Wo nyontarai embe Saduki paya endoaoa we nyontarai we engkada paya embeng taweri ea wa, mampang peaya wa kong duainunung pea wa. Mana nyontarai embe Farisi paya wo endoao piyana pa kuira.)<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat. 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mrk. 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luk. 20:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ai donane entawa etaminduya baba. Nyontarai embe Farisi pe embetotoi yawo embe kuru akama Yaudi, etoa engkawio embaireri we embe Saduki paya etoyo, “Parari ama mamo nyontarai nini pai nyariara pa katea wawiria! Naina duainunung ete mampang pei di kewio wei pa pe.” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ya etong amuna baba kia, donane we wedung we pimamuna paya metai we dona emung Paulusi pe. Impaina i demi pimamuna paya enda engko Paulusi warui nyontarai paya ene rabuangpa to ene markasi paia. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Diru eipa ea mamo Sen Yesusi doa rurang Paurusi kong kewio wei doyo, “Anemurarong pai meitui! Wo parari au piana topang kakera yau na Yerusalemi pa, Au tato ingkai andi topang kakera Yau na bendari Roma pai tato pa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai Yaudi paya esanerarong koiri we emung Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Na kamai eampai nyontarai Yaudi paya epandu ya, kong engkutua we ingkai emung Paulusi. Impaina ya empapora we Allai we emung Paulusi wami mamo, etampi kong etunung wa. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Nyontarai Yaudi we engkutua we emung Paulusi paya mamo embe piakodu raweina. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ya endawu imami we embedung paya kong we embedung na Yaudi paya engkawio etoyo, “Piana amampapora kuirato we amamung Paulusi wami mamo amatampi kong amatunung pianea wa. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Impaina ninane maneta pa mia kong Majelisi Akama pa mia, mentoi arera pea we metanatua we we wedung we raimamuna pai, metewara imbaro kio Paulusi ria tuturi tewerima arota mia, pianeaketo meto metutangkakewari tuturapi piwe dona pa. Kong amawo amatamani we amamuni na rang rabuangpa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Mana Paulusi anong muang pei na ne rarowawin pai tarao piwe entopana pa. Impaina i ria sopang piana pa we Paulusi na markasi pai. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Impaina Paulusi yau perwira pei doyo, “Ko aimiomang nini pai wu we wedung we raimamuna waneia, wo do sopang pianea wuria.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Perwirapai kio aimiomangpai wu we wedung we raimamuna paia mae doyo, “Paulusi wewe nyaina wangkapai yau kong dewara we yau doyo eratutu aimiomangnei wu iyai auma, i do sopang pianea we au.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />We wedung we pimamuna pai riuna aimiomangpai warang, undato wararei pa interi dutani doyo “Bo topang pitoi we Yau pa e?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Aimiomang pai doyo, “Nyontarai Yaudi embe totoi piana engkawio mai we etewara we yai au, imbaro kamai mamo au aronta Paulusi wu Majelisi Akama paya, parariapino eto etutani aiwara ea. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Mana yaie remo bongparari piwe etewarapa pe, wo waketo empiakodu raweina yati etanyuing na rang rabuangpa we etoaweti. Ya kuira piana empapora we etampiwa kong etunung wa, ki emung Paulusi wo. Nina mamo piana etamamang to kong etamamang kawio kong mananu pa au.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />We wedung we raimamuna pai doyo, “Remo topana we ei eampe wo piana ruama topana we yaune to.” Interi demi aimiomangpai teweri ea.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi etanatui wu Kaisarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Interi Komandangpai yau ne perwira pa kodu mae kewio we asaru doyo, “Munduasasoni pimamuna pea we enda kong Paulusi na saraka pe enjatang diru nini pai to Kaisarea. Yatino empiaura kong pimamuna we etapai kudapa piatoru ea ura kong pimamuna we endu wondua pa piaura tato, <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Metong kuda pa ea tato we Paulusi yanai kong mengkori na wemai wu gubernuri Felikia.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />We wedung we pimamuna pai soi kawio we rotu topinina,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />We wemoi Gubernuri Feliksi au, piboki we au. Na yau Komandang Kaladius Lisiasi.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Nyontarai nini nyontarai Yaudi paya piana entapuri mae eto emuni, mana yau era emararu kong neu rai mamuna neya ra amatong widori, tutu yau tarawoa we iwo nyontarai Roma dina.<verse eid="ACT 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Yau tato yo etarakamang pitoi donama etintubakepani oapa, Ai donane ekori wu ene Majelisi Akama paya ra. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ya etimburi tutura pi we rana Kawio we Musai soipa meari, kong yedu pisarara pea wa we dona mamo dedu mambabati kaida pai ete yua wangka pai pa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Interi nyontarai pei sopana we yau, we nyontarai Yaudi paya esanerarong we eto emuni. Aidona ne emararu yemi engkori wu iyai Gubernuri auma nina pa. Mana we nyontarai entubakepani paya piana entopana weya we engko ene kawio entubakepani ea pa wu iyai au. <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Impaina pimamuna paya etong parari kawio we ene komandangpai sopana pa. Interi engko Paulusi warui wangkapai kong engkori na diru yani pai sisu bendari Antipatrisi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Kamai pai rai we empau paya empika rai we etapai kuda paya enda topong tutu Paulusi mae mantau ya wo entaweri to ene markasi pai ea. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Na rai we etapai kuda pa enda sisu Kaisarea mamo engko weraung anatua pai wu gubernuria, kong empika Paulusi wuria. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Gubernuri deto weraung anatua pai rakaipa mamo, i dutang Paulusi we ria na raora totoi pa. Paulusi sopana wei we i riana raora Kilikia. <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Impaina Gubernuri pai kewio doyo, “Wento! Yau ingkai yiri nemu kawio ne ki, na awe nyontarai etimbu aupa endama sisu nina pa.” Interi i demi endukepang Paulusi na Herodesi ne manupai.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Feliki Renawau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Na ape boring we rama wane, imami baba Ananiasi kong we embedung we Yaudi pa embetotoi kong nyontarai we anemanuainung na mamba Roma pai, we anong pei Tertulusi. Ya embia to Kaisarea we esarota Gubernuri Feliki mae ya etong autang we Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Interi Kubernuri yau Paulusi ma arota ya, kong Tertulusi kewio subakepang Paulusi doyo, “Tuan Gubernuri we moipa au, na nemu mananu pa raora amanenei we madori. Kong na anemukurayang pa piana kawasa amanempai weng kia. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Tau yana pa na nupa totoi ea, amantuang we au kong amatong piboki pampang we au. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Mana imbaro amampika nemu apa wa, yau yewara we Tuane taramu amane kawio tanang we amatintuba kamani nina pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Nyontarai ninipai wo nyontarai wememuna dina kia. Na nunei totoi ea amataduti we dong amuna tawa na nyontarai Yaudi nea. Andi wedung we nyontarai etua nyontarai Nasareti pai ne anyau pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />I dong we unawa na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai mana amantapuri. Amasanetatuata we amatoyo amangkutu kawio parari Kawio Musai soi we amapa. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Mana Lisiasi, wewedung we rai mananu paya meraru ma kiori na we barui warui ama. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Kong dewara we nyontarai etimburi paya enda we auma. Impaina tuani mantau au butangkakewari imbaro bodu pitoai amatimburi wei pa.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Nyontarai Yaudi wauya engkonta entubakepang Paulusi mae engkawio endoao piwe Tertulusi sopana pa.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi kewio biawaweri na Feliki renawau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Interi Gubernuri wadi dong kamang we Paulusi we kewio. Impaina Paulusi kewio doyo, “Tuane, yau aneuaoa we tuani au wo kutu kawio na kawasa Yaudi paya puda dediru bototoi manyona to. Ai donane na aneurarong merarising yau yong kawio we yimpata yau na remuna ne. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Tuane mantau au ingkai biria we anemuao parari ape ura ea kodu we rampa, erato Yerusalemi we eyomi na pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Kong nyontarai Yaudi paya etaduta wa we yong amuna we nyontaraipei ete epanduikui nyontarai peaya amatoamuna na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai, ete na manu esominai pei wa ete na nu pea wa na bendari pa wa. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Ya tato etadu pianeawa we etanyawa we tuani au pitoi ai etona etintubakepang yau wea pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Yau eroa we tuani au, wo yau eyomi we Allai o amantapumi woria esomi wei pai parari anyau Yesusi we etorato anyau wetarai pina wa. Mana yau eroao kawio tau na Kawio we Musai soi pa kong Weraung na nabi paya entoi pa na Weraung Mamarang pai. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Parari ya, yau tato aneusara we ingkai Allai dong nyontarai we engkada paya embeng taweri ea, aino nyontarai we emai paya kong nyontarai we emamuna paya. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Topiana yau anemai yosaera we imbaromi aneurarong mantaung nei kekawiri we Allai kong we nyontarai paya. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Kong piana pudape bototoi ampa yau era taweri to Yerusalemi eko piwe etona etimpata neu kawasa nea pa kong we yong pikika we Allai pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Kis. 21:17-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Na awe nyontarai Yaudi embe totoi na Asia endeo yau na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai pa, yau wo enari kanang parari Kawio Musai soipa we yupi neutarai pai rakai peina. Kong nyontarai pe empau nayana wa, kong yong amuna pea wa. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Nyontarai Yaudi embetotoi we enda na Asia ma pa ki. Yatino esarota au na nina kong etubakepang yau na remunawau nina pa keto. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ete wento nyontarai nisa mantau ya entopana we yai au, wemoyawa totoi ai etaduta na yau pa, na awe arouta Majelisi Akama paya pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Ete tutu kawio we etopana na awe etimbu yau pa yoyo, Yau eroaoa we nyontarai engkada paya ingkai embeng taweri ea ki.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Kis. 23:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Mana Feliki rekamana tarai parari Yesusi ne Rang Waworu pai, impaina i yui sidang pai toura ki mae kewio doyo, “Metamamang na Lisiasi we wedung we rai mamuna pai riama sisu ninapa, yau ingkai ekutu kawio ne ki.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Interi demi perwira pai riukepang Paulusia nyaina wangkapai na wetapia kong kewio weya, imbaro endeo etong widori warui we empanduya paya we enda wurima we empatari pa.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi doa na Feliki kong ne wawini Dursilai asaru undenapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Kong piana ape bototoi ea Feliki riama, kio ne wawini Dursirai, nyontarai Yaudi dina. Feliki demi esau Paulusi interi tarao piwe sopana pa parari roaoa we Yesus Kristusi pa. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Mana na awe Paulusi kewio parari tanari wetarai pa, parari tantampira warui weunawa pa kong parari mambabati tataduta na awe Seni riama we kiutu kawio we nyontarai ne tata pai, Feliki metai kia impaina doyo, “Manaing na nina to mae ruanto. Ingkai apei kai yemia esau au ea.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Kong Feliki tato anesara Paulusi dong pe pea wei. Impaina apea mamo Feliki yauwi pampang we kewio konti naria ea. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Mana na puda dediru kodu we rampa enduwa Perkius Festusi we riwang Feliki. Feliki nini do kio nyontarai Yaudi paya esanerarong pa, impaina pika Paulusi wiata na wangka rarongpai pampang.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi kewio we kio ne kawiopa wieita to Kaisari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Na awe Gubernuri Festusi dedu bendari Kaisarea pa, a pe botoru ea mamo donta warui Kaisarea to Yerusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Nayana we embedung we imami kong nyontarai Yaudi we empampong paya endama we esarota Festusi mae engkawio entubakepang Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Etewara na kangkuna we imbaro Gubernuri anerarong pai sawa weya imbaro demi nyontarai engko Paulusi to Yerusalemi; wo ya piana etapa we emuni na rang rabuang pa. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Mana Festusi kewio doyo, “Paulusi erukepani na Kaisarea wo, kong woroi wa yau ingkai etaweri to wana. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Impaina metami nyontarai we empampong na mia, enda kuira kong yau to Kaisarea mae entubakepani nayana. <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festusi nyai a pe injatoru ete ura na Yerusalemi, interi i tewerito Kaisarea ea. Kamaipai do kiutu kawio parari Paulusi impaina demia we engko Paulusi wurima. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Awe Paulusi piapa na yana pa, nyontarai Yaudi we enda na Yerusalemi ma paya etoawari, kong ya etong kawio we mambapa oi. Mana pi etimburi ea pa etanyawa pianea we denyawa parari pi etimburi ea pa wa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Interi Paulusi Kewio biawaweri doyo, “Yau yong sara pianeawa we Yaudi pa amane Kawio we Musai soi pa ete we Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai ete we Kaisari wa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Mana Festusi do kio nyontarai Yaudi esanerarong pa impaina kewio doyo, “Au boyo ruakonta to Yerusalemia imbaro ekutu nemu kawio pa na wana e?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Interi Paulusi kewio doyo, “Yau yoana nina na Majelis Kaisari Roma endena ne kong na nu nini pai, andi metiri yau pa to. Au piana remoaraona we yau yosara pianea wa we nyontarai Yaudi neya pa. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Impaina tarai wo yau yosara mamba nei kong yong piwe unapa wa ea we yedu mambabati kaida pa, piana yemang to. Mana piwe entubakepang yau wea pa tarai wa mamo, matei tato ne barui pea we dong yau weya wa. Impaina yau yewara we eweita to Kaisari Roma pai we kiutu neu kawio ne napa!” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Impaina Festusi kewio kong ne we empatari etong anyau wei paya, interi kewio we Paulusi ea doyo, “Au buewara we wueita we Kaisari we kiutu nemu kawio pa, toyana au andi rua aronta Kaisari.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Agripa kong Bernikei undena wau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ape bototoi ea mananu Agripai kong Bernikei unda to Kaisarea we untopang tabea we Festusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Tutu unai ape bototoi na yana, impaina Festusi kewio parari Paulusi ne kawio pa we mananu Agripai doyo, “Na ninane nyontarai pei wangka riuti na awe Feliki we kubernuri pa. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Na awe enai na Yerusalemi pa mamo we embedung we imami paya kong we embe mananu we nyontarai Yaudi paya etong autang we entubakepang nyontarai wadi mae etewara kong yau imbaro yong mambabati wei. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Yau etopana weya topino na mamba Roma wadi wo, nyontarai pei etoni dedu mambabati pa wami mamo nyontarai yani dedu awe kewio biawaweri i kong arota we entubakepani paya. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Impaina awe ya endama mamo nyontarai yani arota nyontarai we entubakepani paya a pai yemang woroi wa ea, kamai wadi yau yeirora nyontarai wauya imbaromi engko Paulusi ma we engkutu ene kawiopa. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Mana awe we entubakepani wauya etoawari pa, ya engkawio kawio peawa we etimburi napa, tutu yorato dong we moyawa pea parari we aneutatuata pa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ya embatetari pa mamo parari ene anyau akama pai ki kong parari nyontarai we anompei Yesus pai. I wo kedato, mana Paulusi kewio kangkuna we iwo wieng. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Tutu yau ereukamana wa we topitotoi ingkai yiri parakara ninipai pa, impaina yutang weia we do anewe riato Yerusalemi imbaro yiri parakara wadi na wana. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Mana Paulusi dewara we kio ne kawio pa wieita to Kaisari, impaina dewara imbaro nyaina wangka pai kio Kaisari kiutu parakara wadi. Impaina yau yeirora imbaro endukepani topong ki yau yedu rangpea we yenatui to Kaisari.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agripai kewio we Festusi doyo, “Yau aneuwe mantau etarawoi.” Festusi doyo, “Kamai kai taramoi ki.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Kamai wadi Agripai kong Bernike undama na anang baba usua to rerawuani pengadilan pai, engkuira kong wewedung na pimamuna pai kong nyontarai we empampong na bendari wadi, Festusi deirora imbaro Paulusi arotari. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Interi Festusi kewio doyo, “Mananu Agripai kong tau we mendama pa mia! Nyontarai nini pai di nyontarai Yaudi nea kuira entubakepani we yau, yatino we na Yerusalemi paya kong we enai na nina paya. Ya etewara kong etanana we i reo wieng woroi eampe. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mana yau yeduta wa we i dong pi we moyawa ea we dedu mambabati kaidapa. Kong i memeari kiutua we kio ne kawiopa wieita we Kaisari, impaina yau ekutu we yenatuia arota Kaisari. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Mana yedu pi moyawa pea wa parari pi etimburi ea pa imbaro etoi pararia wu Kaisaria. Aidonane yau yoni arota mia mengkai, retenang peino we Mananu Agripa au, imbaro piana na aubiri pa, yau tato yedu pianea we etoi pararia. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Tutu we yau mamo maiwa we yenatu nyontarai wangka riuti pei we Kaisari, napei etoi pisarara we etubakepani ea wa na kawio anatua pai pa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi Biawaweri na Agripai renawau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Mananu Agripai kewio we Paulusi doyo, “Yong a ne we au mantau au kowio we buawaweri au to.” Impaina Paulusi riuwa warangpa dong kamang. Interi kewio sopang piwe dimbo waweri pa doyo, <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“We moi yai mananu Agripa au, yau eruradiduina we yedu piboki kia, wo a nini ekawio ebawaweri yau na yai remuna ne tuturapi pitaubai we nyontarai Yaudi pa etimbu yau tutura ne, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />retenang peino piana mantau au remoaroang nyontarai Yaudi amambeng toane pa kong we dona amamberi waweri ama pa. Impaina yewara kong tuani au, imbaromi taramo aiwarao piwe etopana ne.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Nyontarai Yaudi neya engkai endearoang yau kong esaneo yau parari topitotoi ewengpa na awe ewe aimiomangpai. Wo na ewe aimiomang pa, yau piana enai kong kawasa tau neu waneya mae na Yerusalemi pa to.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3-5">Kis. 22:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Piana manyona pei to endearoang yau. Impaina esanewea mamo, ya engkawio parari yau wo na retenang pa nyontarai embe Farisi. Ama we amambe Farisine amatong parariapi kawio we Musai soipa na wemai kia warui nyontarai Yaudi ea wauya pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Kis. 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Flp. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Kong nina ne yau yoa na nina ne we entubakepang yau tutu yau aneusara we arera Allai doni we tantapumi woriai paya pa. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Arera yani tato andi marandang ura ea kodu Israeli paya esanesari kong etamang we Allai dong parari ne arera yani pai. Impaina ya diru raida esomi we Allai pampang nina pa. Yai Mananu Agripa au, arera yani yau tato eroaoi, aidonane nyontarai Yaudi nea entubakepang yau nina pa. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Pitoi dona mamo mia mendoaoa wa we Allai dong nyontarai we engkada paya embeng pae? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Topitotoio mantau yau na pampong aneutatuata we yorato yau andi yemuna kangkuna we ebateta we etua Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti pai ya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Kis. 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Kong piyana pa piana yonato na Yerusalemi. Na weraung we dong paya we yau na we embedung we imami etoni pai, piana yong nyontarai emamarang paya madupei esua to wangkapai. Piyana pa meari wa, yau tato eroaoa we ya engkutu mambabati oya we engkada. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Yau emungtati we empau wauya na manu entandau napa, imbaro etairora ya we empora pitoai endoaoa pa. Kong na aneurarong dotara oya pa, impaina to bendari ea wauya warui nu Israeli pai yepaia yedawa ya na wana.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi kewio parari anetaweri pa kong topitotoi Seni yawi pa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Paulusi kewio pampang ea doyo, “Na piyana pa we embedung we imami paya etong airora we yau kong etong weraung we dong paya pei we yau ekori erato bendari Damsiki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-19a">Kis. 9:1-19a</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mana Yai Mananu Agripa, na a yani, a we ena na rang rabuang pa piana wo doatera, yau erowo pianei dea wieria wiana rora pai dea raweing wo pai. Dea wadi wieria wari yau kong nyontarai we endakonta wauya. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Amang kai amantawa to kakopa wadi. Interi yau etarawo nyondaupui pei kewio we yau na kawio Iberani doyo, ‘E Saulus, Sauluse! Pitoandi bongkangkani Yau pae? Au piana bong aseung we mantau au tutu buateta Allai ne awiapa, impaina au ingkai bong uira we mantau au.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Mana ekawio yoyo, ‘Matei au, Tuane?’ Seni kewio doyo, ‘Yau Yesusi we kongkani pai. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Mana nina ne, yoyo towa mae boa! Yau yenyawa neutarai nei we au we eruwa au we mampata we Yau. Au andi kowio kakera we nyontarai peaya parari piwe anei remoa na Yau pa kong parari pitoai ingkai yenyawa na awe ramawane. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Yau ingkai empika au warui kawasa Israeli paya kong kawasa peaya we embe Yaudi wa paya. Yau ingkai yemi au ruawu yara, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />we wepa endekami pa imbaro ya entori warui berorangpai wu wedeapai kong entori warui paya Nyombatang pai wu Allai. Imbaro na endoao Yau pa ene sasaripa Yupirandenia mae eruwa ya we neu nyontarai we yirii ya.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Aidonane, Yai Mananu Agripai aune, yau eyerai kangkuna we nukepanao pianyawa we yeduta na Allai pa. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Kong piana yau ekakera to, retenang we nyontarai na Damsiki, na Yerusalemi kong na raora Yudea tantenang, kong we kawasa we embe Yaudi peaya wa tato, wo andi esanetaweri kong entaweri we Allai mae ya etanyawa na pi etonapa we tarai esanetaweri warui ene sasaripa to. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Tutu yanapa donane nyontarai Yaudi entapu yau na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai mae eto emung yau. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Mana naina Allai ne paya derua yau, impaina yedu eweng ma sisu a nini mae yoa ekakera wu nyontarai we empau paya baba kong maia. Pitoai etopana nina weia wa warui piwe nabipa engkawio kakerapa kong we na Kawio we Musai pa; <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />aino Mananu Mampariri we Allai derekamani pai, wo I andi yuira mae Andi we retenang suwi warui kaida pai, imbaro kewio wedea pai we kawasa Yaudi nini kong we kawasa ea ya we embe Yaudi wa pa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Yes. 42:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:20">1Kor. 15:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi kewio we Agripai imbaro rioaoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Awe Paulusi kewio rai we biawaweri pa, Festusi kewio kangkuna doyo, “Pauluse wowawi! Anyau pitau we boduti pai piana dong aua wowawi!” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Mana Paulusi kewio doyo, “Festusi we moi pa au! Yau eawawi wa. Kawio we etopana nina tarai kong mati na we aneutatuata mai pa! <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mananu Agripai tato retawang pinina neto, aidonane ekawio na barui wa wei pa. Yau aneusara we pitoiai etopana nina pa mananu Agripai rearoana to, tutu piwe etopana nina pa tawa na nu anyuingpa wa, mana pi kawasa tau endearoana pina. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Yai Mananu pa au, roaoa we kawio nabi paya entoi ninae? Yau erewoaroana we au roaoa!” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Interi Mananu Agripai kewio we Paulusi doyo, “Au borato mawa we bong yau ewe Kresteng na awe wemararue?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulusi kewio doyo, “Yau etandau we Allai imbaro na awe mararu ete manyonae, Yai au momeari roaoa wa mana tau we mempandu mia na nina ne kong mentarao piwe etopana nina pa, ingkai memparari yau ki, aino wai besi weetawi yau nini pai.” <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Interi Mananu Agripai, gubernuri Festusi kong Bernike, kong we engkai emayoi kuira paya etoa enda tori. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Na emati toripa, ya engkawio waweria weya etoyo, “Nyontarai ninipai wo dong sara piea wa we dedu mamba baba we kedapa ete dedu wangka pai pa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Interi Agripai kewio we Festusi doyo, “Nyontarai nini kio ne kawio pa wieita to Kaisari, wereria mamo piana empikari to.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi Donta to Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Na awe Gubernuri kong ne nyontarai we empatari paya engkutu awe rama we Paulusi depai to Italia, impaina Paulusi kong nyontarai pe embetotoi we enai na wangkapai etong ya to perwira we anongpei Yuriusi na pimamuna we etongwido Kaisari pai. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Interi yau Lukasi tato ekong Paulusi amambeitao kapari we depai na Adramitiumi ma, mae do depai yua tate bendari wata rire na kareng raora Asia pai, interi amatapai. Aristarkusi, nyontarai we riana raora Makedonia na bendari Tesalonika, derua ama. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Kamai pai amasua na bendari Sidoni. Yuliusi dosaiwa Paulusi na wepiboki mae rioa we ria piaio neta we endoao Yesusi paya, imbaromi neta yana paya empatari na piwe do nempa. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Na bendari Sidoni amatapai topong. Mana tutu wanang we wia na wapong wadi piaya mana amatapai topong rurang kareng nutakutu Siprusi we wido ama warui wanang wadi. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Mae amatapai kutu rawanang we na raora Kilikia kong raora Pampilia doai pa, amatapaia amampapa na bendari Mira, na raora Likia.<verse eid="ACT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Na yanapa perwira wadi dedu kapari pei we depai na Aleksanderia ma mae depai to nu Italia. Interi i dedaungweria ama to kapari wadi. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Ape bototoi ea amatapai mana wanang pai wia na kapari pompaima impaina parari amatapai na amanduenang ape bototoi. Na amasaseung era ki amangkikeu bendari Kinidusi. Tutu wanang wadi wia era, impaina amatapai rurang kareng nutakutu Kreta rire worewu Sarmonei. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Na aseung wa amatapai amatari worewu wadia amampapa na maro pei anompei Awa Weweng, kikeu bendari Rasea. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Na a yani pai, a baba we nyontarai Yaudi paya enari wemadori embepuasa pa piana teweri to. Kong amane a madupei nai ampa to, impaina apa maiwa ea we amatapai topong. Tutu Paulusi kewio yua ya doyo, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Maneta pa mia, meto tatapai mana, yau piana erewoa we ingkai tanai rai aino kapari nei kong piwe kapari kione kong tanduainunung nei tato.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Mana perwira wadi rioao weyiru wadi kong wewedung na kapari wadi warui Paulusi kawio pa. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Tutu pelabuang wadi mioya wa we kapari pa awoi na yana na ne aidu wanang wia era peina. Impaina madupei yati endoawe etapai topong kong tatuata ki na bendari Feniksi. Imbaro enai nayana pa ki wanang ne aidu pai wia manaing. Bendari Feniksi mamo pelabuang na nutakutu Kreta kong nu we maro dina, nu weweng we wematani mamo kapari dewoi na wemai. Pelabuang yani kekawiri tete do matani kong tete do wanang marai wadi.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dowara rawanang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Apeana wemadui inte do wiana do matani pai. Esanetatuata we rawanang medori we etapai to. Impaina ya enduwa kamutupai mae etapai rurang kareng nutakutu Kreta paia.<verse eid="ACT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Mana woroi wami mae dowara wadi wia na nutakutupai ma, esawi we “Dowara Murang Rawanang.” <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Dowara wadi miung kapari wadi tutu ama. Mae kapari wadi ne mambiri pea wa we depai topong yoa wanang wadi pa, impaina amampika kapari wadi mae wanangpai yowaweri. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Impaina amatawoi ya sisu kareng nutakutu kumai pei anong Kaudai, na yana wido ama katea impaina na esaseung enduwa sawadoi pa to kapari wadi. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Enduwa sawadoi wadi wu kapari wadi apong, ya engko wai pa we empauwari kapari wadi we piata wido kaparipai. Tutu ya ematai embatia na ruwuang takutu na Sirtisi, impaina empi arawi pa mae empika kapari wadi dewoi wanangpai kiori. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Tutu wanang wadi wiaera kong tarowapa yo ama, impaina kamai wadi nyontarai we endupi na kapari wadi engkayai piwe kapari kiopa ea to rawanang wadi. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Na awe botoru wadi ya engkayai papusi na kapari wadi na mantau embarami pa. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />We ape bototoi eampa amandeo wopai wa kong piori koiri wa, mae dowara wia pampang. Impaina amasanesara we amambempa nai. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Tutu piana ape bototoi etampi wa, impaina Paulusi tewa doa na enemadupa mae kewio doyo, “Maneta pa mia! Na ayani meto mentarao piwe etopana we mia yanapa kong tatapai warui Kreta wa, mamo dowara yiraibu kapari neia wemunamunai wa kong piwe na kapari nei nai wa. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Mana ninane yisua mia wo imbaro mendeo mematai pe, tutu koiri tato na mia ingkai ei nyai ete keda wa, mana kapari nei ki. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Tutu diruampe Allai we eyomi wei pai kong we ne yau nei ne mampang pei riama doa rurang yau, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />mae i kewio doyo, ‘Pauluse remo motai pe! Au andi rua aronta Kaisari. Tutu na Allai ne weweng dona pinoma we au pa, impaina nyontarai we enai na kapari nei kong au, mia mengkai membeng.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Impaina maneta pa mia, mematai pe mana mesanekangkuna! Tutu yau eroaoa we pitoai Allai sopana we yau pa ingkai tawa pararia. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Mana ingkai andi tambatia na kareng pei na nutakutu pei ki.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kapari pai kikeu we reipeto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Na diru pe uraya manua to mamo tarowa pa yo ama towana tonina na Rawanang Adriai. Mana piana wake diru rabuang to nyontarai we endupi na kapari wadi amanduradiduina we piana amangkikeu we rei pea to. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Interi ya empi wai tatua pei we etintua rawanangpai mamo wa meteri pe piakodu. Woroi wa mae entuati ea mamo wa meteri pe piareia ura. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Tutu amamatai amambatia na kami awaing pe, interi ya engkai kamutu pe manua na kapari pui wadi, mae amasanekangkuna we ayaria dea meraru waro. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Mana we endupi na kapari wauya aididisi we embawu warui kapari wadi. Ya empi sawadoipa na kapari wadi, etosayara we empi kamutu pei na kapari pom pai. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Mana Paulusi kewio we perwira Yuriusi kong ne pimamuna wauya doyo, “Parari ya enai na kapari nei wa mamo, mia metadu membeng pa wa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Interi pimamuna wauya engkutu wai na sawadoi wadi mae empikari dewoi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />A we ayari do ketuapa, Paulusi pera nyontarai nea we etampi, kewio weya doyo, “Piana ape uraya manua metangpi wa, metanona na mesaneaera miapa. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Topiana yau ekawio eyua mia, imbaro mia metangpi wo. Pininane weapi membengpa. Wo na mia nyontarai pei duandaung pa koiri nyai warui dukami pai wa.”<verse eid="ACT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Piana kewio toyana ra kaipa, i kio roti pa mae tendauoa sopang piboki we Allai na engkai endenawau, interi piobabau roti pa interi wiwo we etang. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Impaina nyontarai nea engkai emararising taweri ea mae ya etampi tato. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Nyontarai we amanai na kapari wadi amampau pa piaura ea piatoru ea ura ea wonang (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Piana amatampia amamoi to, ya engkai pasibu we engkori na kapari wadi wu rawanang wadi imbaro kapari tepia.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kapari wiatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Piana raida to, ya endeo maro pei kong ne kareng we tebora. Ya endearoang rei yani wa, mana ya engkutua we andi engko kapari wadia wiatia na yana. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Interi ya empika wai kamutu pa, mae ya esoa to rawang wadi. Nayana ya empika wai bo-iru pai mae entara arawipa ea, imbaro wanang wia mamo kio kapari wadi to kareng reia. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Mana ya embatia na ruwuang takutu pei, impaina kapari wadi pompai wiatia na ruwuang pai, mana puipai tawora weitaoia menaing. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Na a yani pimamuna pa esanewe emung nyontarai we wangka riuya paya, imbaro nyontarai pea embawua esarosoi pe. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Mana perwira wadi anewe dongwido Paulusi. Impaina yowe yana esanewe emamunapa mae deirora imbaro nyontarai esaroesoi yuara paya esaro pampong we empapa to reia, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />mae nyontarai we esoi uarawapa esoi na wongkia we tababau pa tuwa ea wauya. Na yana ya engkai embeng embeita torei reia.<figure style="fig" file="LB00219C.TIF" size="col" ref="27:44">Kapari wiatia na ruwuang pai, tarowa wietaoia menaing</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi Na Maltai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Na awe amampapa na kareng pa na we piboki pa, nayana amatadu we rei nini pai anong nutakutu Maltai. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Nyontarai we enai na nutakutu wauya etosaiwara we ama na wemai kia, ya enduri adia baba pei mae empara ama towana tutu piana do myuna kong we madui deaa. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Na awe Paulusi riurikui ai arirawani pea mae tetuwara wu adia wadia, tutu adia wadi riata paina piara pimamuna pei meti interi keri warakea wadi. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Nyontarai we enai na nu yani endeo piara wadi yeroi na Paulusi warakea wadi paina, engkawio waweria weya etoyo, “Nyontarai nini pai miungbemuna, tutu i tepira warui wemoya wa na rawanangpai mana tane sen we kiutu kawio na wemai pai pikari wa, impaina demi piara pai keripi imbaro keda.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Mana Paulusi kepateta piara wadi to adia wadi rarong mae i ruradiduing ui katea wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Ya etorato Paulusi ingkai warang wadi bebara ete keda tantuma. Mana ya etanona woroi katea mae pianea tawa nai wa, ya esanetaweri ea interi engkawio topino Paulusi wo sen dina. <verse eid="ACT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Woroi wami warui nu yani pai gubernuri na nutakutu yani ne kakopa pea. Gubernuri yani anongpei Pubriusi, kong I dewa ama na anerarong we piboki we amanai konti na ne manupai ape botoru. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Na a yani Publiusi tamani wiata tutu yui deninuanang kong yari. Paulusi yua to mandarong nempaia; i tendau kong riuwa warangpa warawawuri kong doni penang. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Tutu piwe Paulusi nyari we nyontarai yui pai yana, donane nyontarai we esui peaya na nutakutu yani enda wu Paulusi ma kong dosa empanang tato. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Ya entuang we ama mae na awe amantampira amatapai pa, ya etong pitaubai we amasanewea pa.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi donta na Malta piapa na Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Yembaipe botoru rakai na nutakutu yanipai pa, interi amasa na kaparipei we depai na Aleksanderia ma, we neaidu we wanang wia era pai piana dewoi na nutakutu wadi. Kapari wadi pompai enduru nyombatangnai Kastori kong Poruksi nai. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Amampapa amasua na pelabuang bendari Sirakusa mae amanai ape botoru nayana. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Nayana amatapai rurang kareng pa ki amampapa na bendari Regiumi. Kamai wadi wanang matani wia, impaina amatapai amamararu na ape kodu amampapa na bendari Putioli na raora Italia. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Na yana amatadu nyontarai we endoao Yesusi peaya, impaina ya etewa ama we amanai ape boitu kong ya. Interi amatapaia amampapa na bendari Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Maneta we na bendari Roma we endoao Yesusi entarao kawio parari ama, impaina ya endama etamang ama na bendari Manu Awayang Apiusi kong na bendari Hoteri Toru pai. Na awe Paulusi reo ya pa, i dewa piboki we Allai mae anerarongpai piaya ea.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Awe amampapa na bendari Roma pa, Paulusi empikari nyai meari na manu pei kong pimamuna pei we maninuing oi.<figure style="fig" file="HK00242C.TIF" size="col" ref="28:16">Bendari Roma</figure><verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi kewio kong nyontarai Yaudi na Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Piana a pe botoru ea, Paulusi yau nyontarai we empampong na kawasa Yaudi nayana pa mae ya empandura. Interi Paulusi kewio doyo, “Maneta pa mia! Yau yong sara pianea wa we kawasa tanenei ete we kanang we wia na tantapumi woriai paya ma pai wa, mana entapu yau na Yerusalemi kong etong yau we nyontarai Roma wauya. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Na awe etiri neu parakara pai pa, ya eto empika yau, wo yau yosara pianea wa we yedu mambabati kaida pa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Mana nyontarai mananu Yaudi embateta piyana kia, donane yau yerura parakara wadi we eweita to Kaisari Roma pai ma nina. Yau yong toyana pa tutu we yoyo yerura neu kawasa mantau wadi wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Kis. 25:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Aidonane yau yewara kong mia, imbaro erewo mia mae ekawio kong mia. Wo etawi waraune na wai besi pai nina ne tutu eroao Mampariri nyontarai Israeli nei tasanesari we riama periri tata pai pa.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Interi ya engkawio wei etoyo, “Amawo amandu arera pei wa na Yudea we entoi parari neta pa au wa. Kong nyontarai pei wa ria na wana ma we kewio kawio we moyawa parari neta pau tato. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Mana amasane we amantarao parari neta pa au anemuaoa pa, wo ama amangkai piana amantaraoa nyontarai entatipa anyau we neta womi weapa.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Interi ya engkutu a pei we empandura kong Paulusi. Na awe engkutui yani pai, nyontarai paya empau kia enda wu Paulusi ema, empandura na nu we Paulusi nyainai pai. Na ayari pai ki rawandeng pa, i kewio suba anyauwa weya parari Allai ne riu we Mananu pa; mae na Kawio we Musai soi pa kong na weraung nabi pa entoi na Weraung Mamarang pai, i tato dosaera we dongsa endoaoa we Yesusi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Eayati endoao pitoai Paulusi sopana pa, mana eaya tato endoaoa wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Interi pandura yani esanerarong koiri wa, embateta ya mae interi entatera warui nu yani. Impaina Paulusi sopang kawio nina doyo, “Tarai kia pitoai Duainunung Mamarangpai kewiora na nabi Yesayai we mentapumi woriai paya pa.<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26-27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Yes. 6:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Allai kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Mendara mentopana we kawasa nini metoyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Mia ingkai mentaraoa kong mentaraoa, mana mesanebaua wa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Mia ingkai mendeoa kong mendeoa, mana menduinaria wa.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Wo kawasa nini esanerarong pa meitui eampa to,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kong engkawung entarakambirei pa eampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kong endekamipa engkawung eampa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Nina tawa imbaro ya embe endekami mana endeoa wa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kong embe entarakambirei mana entaraoa wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kong esanetatuata na esanerarong pai mana etong parari Allai wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">interi ya esanetaweri warui sasari enempa impaina yong ya empanang.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Impaina Paulusi kewio weya doyo, “Mentarama! Wo Allai ne Arera Weweng pa parari periri tata pa dona wu kawasa Yaudi wa paya, kong ya ingkai etaraoa mae etong pararia.” [<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Paulusi kewio toyana ra kaipa, nyontarai Yaudi paya empika nu yani na esorewaweri ya.]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi wiuwu Allai ne we Mananupa na Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paulusi nyaina yana pudape kodu na manu we mantau biaiti pai; i merarising demang nyontarai tau we endawurima paya. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Na anyuing wa kong aseung pea wa i wiuwu Allai ne riu we Mananupa kong parari Sen Yesus Kristusi we ya. <figure style="fig" file="AN2 Paul's 4th Journey.png" size="col" loc="28.31" ref="28:31">Paulusi donta to Roma</figure><verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>